{"topic": "migraine", "competency": "Investigation", "stem": "A 28-year-old woman presents with a history of recurrent migraines and is found to have elevated levels of a certain hormone. Which of the following tests could be used to evaluate the function of the pituitary gland in this patient?", "options": {"A": "Lysine-8-vasopressin test", "B": "Oral pancreatic function test", "C": "Progesterone challenge test", "D": "Urinary 3'5' cyclic AMP test"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The lysine-8-vasopressin test is used to evaluate the function of the pituitary gland, particularly in patients with suspected pituitary disorders. In this case, the patient's history of migraines and elevated hormone levels may be related to pituitary function, making this test a suitable option.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0006_15831", "title": "Effect of an oral contraceptive on the lysine-8-vasopressin test in the diagnostic evaluation of pituitary function", "span_text": "Effect of an oral contraceptive on the lysine-8-vasopressin test in the diagnostic evaluation of pituitary function."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2023-02-20 14:30:00", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0011_5658", "pubmed23n0009_1359", "pubmed23n0003_6331", "pubmed23n0006_10403", "pubmed23n0008_1555", "pubmed23n0007_15843", "pubmed23n0002_575", "pubmed23n0006_15831", "pubmed23n0003_7845", "pubmed23n0011_6022", "pubmed23n0004_7326", "pubmed23n0002_2030", "pubmed23n0003_2920", "pubmed23n0011_6768", "pubmed23n0005_8739", "pubmed23n0007_4725", "pubmed23n0005_825", "pubmed23n0011_1379", "pubmed23n0007_11214", "pubmed23n0010_2732", "pubmed23n0006_16010", "pubmed23n0003_5914", "pubmed23n0011_2343", "pubmed23n0011_3488", "pubmed23n0008_4352", "pubmed23n0011_3230", "pubmed23n0007_7385", "pubmed23n0004_4885", "pubmed23n0004_7287", "pubmed23n0006_9679", "pubmed23n0006_14312", "pubmed23n0008_11669", "pubmed23n0012_388", "pubmed23n0004_6558", "pubmed23n0007_5606", "pubmed23n0001_14334",