{"topic": "Thyroid Disorders", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "What is the preferred diagnostic test to distinguish Graves\u2019 disease from destructive thyroiditis, ectopic thyroid tissue, and factitious thyrotoxicosis?", "options": {"A": "Scintigraphy", "B": "TRAb measurement", "C": "Thyroid scan", "D": "CT or MRI scan"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Scintigraphy is the preferred diagnostic test to distinguish Graves\u2019 disease from other causes of thyrotoxicosis.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_26785", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Scintigraphy is the preferred diagnostic test; however, TRAb measurement can be used to assess autoimmune activity."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_26785", "InternalMed_Harrison_26302", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1599", "InternalMed_Harrison_28583", "pubmed23n0020_1117", "InternalMed_Harrison_26020", "Gynecology_Novak_5476", "InternalMed_Harrison_31620", "pubmed23n0015_4995", "pubmed23n0011_9743", "pubmed23n0003_11516", "pubmed23n0004_8902", "pubmed23n0014_13380", "pubmed23n0012_8787", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3292", "InternalMed_Harrison_18212", "InternalMed_Harrison_24082", "pubmed23n0039_3855", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_522", "pubmed23n0017_10519", "pubmed23n0015_8564", "pubmed23n0017_8164", "InternalMed_Harrison_22258", "pubmed23n0027_14089", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1158", "pubmed23n0026_3269", "pubmed23n0040_1735", "pubmed23n0036_7194", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_410", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_2033", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_512", "Neurology_Adams_7841", "pubmed23n0024_2010", "InternalMed_Harrison_23008", "pubmed23n0011_9236", "pubmed23n0039_3854", "Gynecology_Novak_1529", "pubmed23n0017_6049", "pubmed23n0025_8297", "pubmed23n0032_6029", "pubmed23n0010_6579", "pubmed23n0037_11998", "pubmed23n0027_1947", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_360", "pubmed23n0003_1245", "pubmed23n0005_4152", "pubmed23n0008_6241", "pubmed23n0022_8534", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_90"], "evidence_doc_ids"