{"topic": "Immunization", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a potential consequence of pertussis vaccination, as observed in a cluster of cases within 24 hours of immunization?", "options": {"A": "Neurological complications, including convulsions and status epilepticus", "B": "Cardiovascular complications, including myocardial infarction and stroke", "C": "Gastrointestinal complications, including diarrhea and vomiting", "D": "Respiratory complications, including pneumonia and bronchitis"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The clustering of neurological complications in the 24 hours following immunization suggests a potential consequence of pertussis vaccination.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0008_14111", "title": "[Neurologic manifestations following pertussis vaccination]", "span_text": "Twenty cases of acute neurological complications occuring within 7 days of pertussis immunization are reported. Convulsions were present in every case and status epilepticus was observed in five infants."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"search_terms": "pertussis vaccination complications", "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_12013", "pubmed23n0024_8060", "pubmed23n0018_492", "pubmed23n0008_14111"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0018_492", "pubmed23n0008_14111", "InternalMed_Harrison_12013", "pubmed23n0024_8060"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"expert_review": "yes", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Immunization Complications complications adverse outcomes sequelae comorbidity disease progression risk factors mortality morbidity hospitalization long-term effects severity clinical deterioration", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 3204.1581660159864, "llm_ms": 930.8337919937912, "verification_ms": 805.8548750123009, "extra_instructions": "", "status_counts": {"OK": 1, "INSUF