{"topic": "Immunization", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "A patient with a history of atopic disease undergoes long-term hyposensitization with allergenic extracts. What is the likelihood of this patient developing autoimmune or collagen vascular disease as a result of the treatment?", "options": {"A": "Increased risk", "B": "No increased risk", "C": "Uncertain risk", "D": "Decreased risk"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Long-term hyposensitization with allergenic extracts does not increase the risk of autoimmune or collagen vascular disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0005_12889", "title": "Evaluation of the adverse effects of long-term hyposensitization", "span_text": "Atopic individuals receiving five or more years of hyposensitization with allergenic extracts showed no increased autoimmune, collagen vascular, or lymphoproliferative disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_21641", "pubmed23n0017_2869", "InternalMed_Harrison_7915", "InternalMed_Harrison_467", "Obstentrics_Williams_5951", "Biochemistry_Lippincott_1201", "InternalMed_Harrison_4203", "Pathology_Robbins_4630", "InternalMed_Harrison_11332", "pubmed23n0005_12889", "Obstentrics_Williams_7738", "Surgery_Schwartz_13389", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3574", "InternalMed_Harrison_25535", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1175", "pubmed23n0020_9378", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3401", "pubmed23n0030_10091", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "InternalMed_Harrison_25237", "Pathology_Robbins_4649", "pubmed23n0012_7416", "pubmed23n0023_9957", "Obstentrics_Williams_6591", "pubmed23n0032_3863", "pubmed23n0003_1634", "pubmed23n0028_9591", "pubmed23n0015_2487", "Pathology_Robbins_1083", "Obstentrics_Williams_2354", "Obstentrics_Williams_7545", "pubmed23n0030_11320", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3551", "Pathology_Robbins_3910", "Gynecology_Novak_6994", "Pediatrics_Nelson_741", "InternalMed_Harrison_8755", "Pathology_Robbins_4648", "InternalMed_Harrison_22236", "Surger