{"topic": "Pimple", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary goal of prevention in the context of pimple formation, considering the underlying causes and risk factors?", "options": {"A": "To eliminate the major risk factors for pimple formation, such as hormonal imbalances and poor skin care", "B": "To reduce the severity of pimples once they have formed", "C": "To increase the frequency of pimple formation to build immunity", "D": "To ignore the pimples and let them resolve on their own"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Prevention of pimple formation involves addressing the underlying causes and risk factors, such as hormonal imbalances, poor skin care, and genetics. By eliminating or reducing these risk factors, individuals can reduce their likelihood of developing pimples.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0047_5386", "title": "Screening for occupational cancer", "span_text": "The main strategy for preventing occupational cancer is an environmentally based approach or primary prevention."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0043_6323", "InternalMed_Harrison_294", "pubmed23n0048_7714", "pubmed23n0050_7903", "pubmed23n0022_6533", "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "pubmed23n0047_5386", "pubmed23n0049_8703", "pubmed23n0050_5486", "pubmed23n0023_10306", "pubmed23n0024_2414", "Gynecology_Novak_839", "pubmed23n0049_3300", "pubmed23n0014_768", "pubmed23n0024_1190", "pubmed23n0048_17336", "Surgery_Schwartz_5388", "pubmed23n0025_9035", "pubmed23n0016_3295", "pubmed23n0048_3940", "pubmed23n0049_9825", "Gynecology_Novak_249", "pubmed23n0049_9294", "pubmed23n0044_2780", "Obstentrics_Williams_9092", "pubmed23n0025_2076", "pubmed23n0045_15534", "InternalMed_Harrison_17264", "pubmed23n0047_21300", "pubmed23n0043_4912", "pubmed23n0027_6254", "InternalMed_Harrison_322", "pubmed23n0028_4618", "Surgery_Schwartz_2339", "Surgery_Schwartz_13653", "InternalMed_Harrison_321", "pubmed23n0047_4504", "pubmed23n00