{"topic": "fever", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is a key objective of a complex program of measures for prevention of streptococcal infections and their complications?", "options": {"A": "Prevention and fight against acute streptococcal infection", "B": "Treatment of rheumatic fever", "C": "Prevention of malaria", "D": "Prevention of tuberculosis"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The complex program of measures for prevention of streptococcal infections and their complications has several objectives, including prevention and fight against acute streptococcal infection, prevention of severe complications of acute rheumatic fever, and prevention of relapses of acute rheumatic fever.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0017_6372", "title": "Results of the use, for a period of 3 years (1974-1977), in pilot districts, of the complex program of measures for prevention of streptococcal infections and their complications", "span_text": "Starting with the year 1974 a total 11 pilot units have been organized, in as many counties in which a complex program of surveillance of streptococcal infections was applied, that had the following objectives: 1. Prevention and fight against acute streptococcal infection ; 2. Prevention of severe complications of acute rheumatic fever of rheumatic carditis and acute glomerulonephritis ; 3. Prevention of relapses of acute rheumatic fever."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0017_6372", "pubmed23n0063_747", "pubmed23n0037_9934", "Gynecology_Novak_250", "InternalMed_Harrison_25310", "pubmed23n0025_10436", "pubmed23n0060_17782", "pubmed23n0022_1211"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0017_6372", "pubmed23n0063_747", "pubmed23n0037_9934", "Gynecology_Novak_250", "InternalMed_Harrison_25310", "pubmed23n0025_10436", "pubmed23n0060_17782", "pubmed23n0022_1211"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "n