{"topic": "pimple", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is a common treatment for acne that causes pimples, redness, and inflammation?", "options": {"A": "Benzoyl peroxide", "B": "Ruxolitinib cream", "C": "Calcium hydroxide", "D": "Tretinoin"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Benzoyl peroxide is a common treatment for acne that causes pimples, redness, and inflammation. It exhibits antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and antioxidant properties.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41302529", "title": "Development and Validation of an HPLC-DAD Method for the Quantitative Determination of Benzoyl Peroxide, Curcumin, Rosmarinic Acid, Resveratrol and Salicylic Acid in a Face Mask-In Vitro/Ex Vivo Permeability Study", "span_text": "Acne is a common skin condition that causes pimples, redness and inflammation. Benzoyl peroxide (BENZ), salicylic acid (SAL), curcumin (CUR), rosmarinic acid (ROS) and resveratrol (RESV) exhibit antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties and are recommended for its treatment."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41302529", "pubmed_web_41211091", "pubmed_web_41084588", "pubmed_web_41069919", "pubmed_web_40991478", "pubmed_web_40765636", "pubmed_web_40519232", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40181218", "pubmed_web_40151034", "pubmed_web_40136416", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40008491", "pubmed_web_40006535", "pubmed_web_40006023", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39412108"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41302529", "pubmed_web_41211091", "pubmed_web_41084588", "pubmed_web_41069919", "pubmed_web_40991478", "pubmed_web_40765636", "pubmed_web_40519232", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40181218", "pubmed_web_40151034", "pubmed_web_40136416", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40008491", "pubmed_web_40006535", "pubmed_web_40006023", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573