{"topic": "pimple", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "A patient presents with a small pimple on their shoulder that has purulent discharge. What is the most likely diagnosis and recommended treatment?", "options": {"A": "Pilomatrix carcinoma, surgical excision with wide margins", "B": "Acne vulgaris, topical antibiotics and retinoids", "C": "Infected cyst, incision and drainage", "D": "Keratosis pilaris, moisturizers and topical steroids"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Pilomatrix carcinoma is a rare skin tumor that can present as a small pimple or nodule, often with purulent discharge. Surgical excision with wide margins is the recommended treatment to prevent recurrence.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_40765636", "title": "A case of pilomatrix carcinoma found in the shoulder", "span_text": "We report a case of pilomatrix carcinoma located on the shoulder, initially presenting as a small pimple with purulent discharge in a 64-year-old man."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41302529", "pubmed_web_41211091", "pubmed_web_41084588", "pubmed_web_41069919", "pubmed_web_40991478", "pubmed_web_40765636", "pubmed_web_40519232", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40181218", "pubmed_web_40151034", "pubmed_web_40136416", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40008491", "pubmed_web_40006535", "pubmed_web_40006023", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39412108"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41084588", "pubmed_web_41069919", "pubmed_web_40991478", "pubmed_web_40765636", "pubmed_web_40519232", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40181218", "pubmed_web_40151034", "pubmed_web_40136416", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40008491", "pubmed_web_40006535", "pubmed_web_40006023", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_41302529", "pubmed_web_41211091"], "retrieval_mode": "pubmed_web"}, "verificat