{"topic": "pimple", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is a potential trigger for the onset of herpes labialis, characterized by swollen lips with tiny pimples?", "options": {"A": "Anxiety and sun exposure", "B": "Poor hygiene and illiteracy", "C": "Dehydration and seizures", "D": "Tobacco use and smoking"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Herpes labialis is a viral infection that can be triggered by various factors, including psychosocial factors such as anxiety and stress, as well as exposure to ultraviolet light.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_40297472", "title": "Anxiety and Sun Exposure as Triggers for Herpes Labialis: A Case Report and Review of Literature", "span_text": "The reactivation of HSV-1 leading to HL can be triggered by various factors, including psychosocial factors (depression, stress, and anxiety), exposure to ultraviolet light, a febrile environment, and specific dietary inadequacy."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41272864", "pubmed_web_41272863", "pubmed_web_40597773", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40297472", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40033917", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39430078", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_38652954", "pubmed_web_38186806", "pubmed_web_38078840", "pubmed_web_38063647", "pubmed_web_37949086", "pubmed_web_37520786", "pubmed_web_37355195"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41272864", "pubmed_web_41272863", "pubmed_web_40597773", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40297472", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40033917", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39430078", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_38652954", "pubmed_web_38186806", "pubmed_web_38078840", "pubmed_web_38063647", "pubmed_web_37949086", "pubmed_web_37520786", "pubmed_web_37355195"], "retrieval_mode": "pubmed_web"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass