{"topic": "pimple", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "A 20-year-old male patient presents with swollen lips and tiny pimples, accompanied by malaise, after working as a florist in a sun-exposed area and experiencing stress due to financial difficulties. What is a potential factor contributing to his condition?", "options": {"A": "Exposure to ultraviolet light", "B": "Poor hygiene practices", "C": "Inadequate nutrition", "D": "Genetic predisposition"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The patient's condition is likely related to herpes labialis, which can be triggered by exposure to ultraviolet light, among other factors.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_40297472", "title": "Anxiety and Sun Exposure as Triggers for Herpes Labialis: A Case Report and Review of Literature", "span_text": "The reactivation of HSV-1 leading to HL can be triggered by various factors, including psychosocial factors (depression, stress, and anxiety), exposure to ultraviolet light, a febrile environment, and specific dietary inadequacy."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41272864", "pubmed_web_41272863", "pubmed_web_40597773", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40297472", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40033917", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39430078", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_38652954", "pubmed_web_38186806", "pubmed_web_38078840", "pubmed_web_38063647", "pubmed_web_37949086", "pubmed_web_37520786", "pubmed_web_37355195"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_40597773", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40297472", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40033917", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39430078", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_38652954", "pubmed_web_38186806", "pubmed_web_38078840", "pubmed_web_38063647", "pubmed_web_37949086", "pubmed_web_37520786", "pubmed_web_37355195", "pubmed_web_41272864",