{"topic": "pimple", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "A patient with a history of acne and pimples is considering using a topical probiotic to improve skin health. What can be expected from using such a product?", "options": {"A": "A significant reduction in blackheads, oiliness, and pimples within 10 days", "B": "An increase in fine lines and wrinkles", "C": "No change in skin health", "D": "A worsening of acne and pimples"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The use of a topical probiotic has been shown to improve skin health by reducing blackheads, oiliness, and pimples. This is due to the probiotic's ability to balance the skin's microbial flora and inhibit the growth of pathogens associated with skin diseases.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_39840452", "title": "Efficacy of a topical live probiotic in improving skin health", "span_text": "A total of 96 participants completed this research. In comparison to the baseline (Day 0), within 10 days, a significant reduction in blackheads (48%), oiliness (48%), blemishes (57%), dry areas (23%), redness/rosacea (45%) and flaky and rough skin (38%) were reported."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "exact_match", "query": "topical probiotic skin health", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41272864", "pubmed_web_41272863", "pubmed_web_40597773", "pubmed_web_40509937", "pubmed_web_40297472", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40033917", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39430078", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_38652954", "pubmed_web_38186806", "pubmed_web_38078840", "pubmed_web_38063647", "pubmed_web_37949086", "pubmed_web_37520786", "pubmed_web_37355195"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_40297472", "pubmed_web_40125199", "pubmed_web_40033917", "pubmed_web_39840452", "pubmed_web_39529521", "pubmed_web_39521573", "pubmed_web_39430078", "pubmed_web_39412108", "pubmed_web_38652954", "pubmed_web_38186806", "pubmed_web_38078840", "pubme