{"topic": "Diarrhea", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is a common adverse effect of the drug nelfinavir?", "options": {"A": "Diarrhea", "B": "Abdominal pain", "C": "Headache", "D": "Rash"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The most common adverse effects associated with nelfinavir are diarrhea and flatulence.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_5445", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "The most common adverse effects associated with nelfinavir (10\u201330%) are diarrhea and flatulence."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"source": "textbook", "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_6141", "pubmed23n0055_16874", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5453", "pubmed23n0053_12327", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5752", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1397", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4047", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3843", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5068", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5740", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5445", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6654", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5750", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6918", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3966", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2086", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5928", "Pharmacology_Katzung_770", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2415", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5956", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3997", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5096", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1052", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5397", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3817", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7143", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1403", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5754", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5395"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_6141", "pubmed23n0055_16874", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5453", "pubmed23n0053_12327", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5752", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1397", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4047", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3843", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5068", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5740", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5445", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6654", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5750", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6918", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3966", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2086", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5928", "Pharmacology_Katzung_770", "Pharmacology