{"topic": "Myocardial infarction", "competency": "Pathophysiology", "stem": "What is a potential cause of ischemia in the presence and absence of atherosclerotic lesions?", "options": {"A": "Coronary spasm", "B": "Hypertension", "C": "Hyperlipidemia", "D": "Diabetes"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Coronary spasm has been shown to be an important cause of ischemia in the presence and absence of atherosclerotic lesions.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0007_6635", "title": "Pathophysiology of myocardial infarction", "span_text": "Coronary spasm has been shown to be an important cause of ischemia in the presence and absence of atherosclerotic lesions."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0007_6635", "pubmed23n0054_21237", "InternalMed_Harrison_20982", "pubmed23n0014_3949", "pubmed23n0056_7477", "InternalMed_Harrison_9290", "pubmed23n0052_15585", "pubmed23n0060_9216", "pubmed23n0047_19810", "pubmed23n0045_4650", "pubmed23n0050_7742", "pubmed23n0054_2992", "pubmed23n0054_8461", "pubmed23n0054_8460", "pubmed23n0050_13381", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1259", "Pathology_Robbins_2649", "pubmed23n0024_1744", "pubmed23n0057_12980", "pubmed23n0011_5074", "pubmed23n0050_3561", "pubmed23n0028_13574", "pubmed23n0048_13624", "pubmed23n0053_16582", "InternalMed_Harrison_19265", "pubmed23n0051_15100", "pubmed23n0046_17672", "pubmed23n0040_2955", "pubmed23n0061_7743", "pubmed23n0058_18274", "pubmed23n0048_435", "InternalMed_Harrison_20981", "InternalMed_Harrison_19227", "pubmed23n0016_6744", "InternalMed_Harrison_19250", "pubmed23n0060_7788", "pubmed23n0058_21587", "pubmed23n0036_10771", "pubmed23n0037_2479", "pubmed23n0052_15315", "pubmed23n0053_9139", "pubmed23n0046_21942", "pubmed23n0037_11402", "pubmed23n0036_54", "pubmed23n0054_8478", "pubmed23n0052_17465", "pubmed23n0053_18573", "Neurology_Adams_6215", "pubmed23n0047_7125", "pubmed23n0059_6295", "InternalMed_Harrison_1743", "pubmed23n0052_2663", "pubmed23n0061_10988