{"topic": "Peptic ulcer disease", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the most obvious method for mass prevention of peptic ulcer disease if it were to be contemplated on a large scale?", "options": {"A": "Vaccination", "B": "Medication", "C": "Surgery", "D": "Lifestyle modification"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Vaccination would be the most obvious method for mass prevention of peptic ulcer disease if it were to be contemplated on a large scale, as it has shown promising results in experimental immunization of animals.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_12603", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "If mass prevention were contemplated, vaccination would be the most obvious method, and experimental immunization of animals has given promising results."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0014_766", "pubmed23n0059_18944", "InternalMed_Harrison_12603", "InternalMed_Harrison_19033", "pubmed23n0055_13775", "pubmed23n0049_8703", "pubmed23n0061_20690", "InternalMed_Harrison_294", "pubmed23n0060_4515", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0055_13768", "pubmed23n0063_11753", "pubmed23n0048_17336", "pubmed23n0049_3300", "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "pubmed23n0024_2414", "Gynecology_Novak_839", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "pubmed23n0050_7903", "pubmed23n0022_6533", "pubmed23n0054_3559", "InternalMed_Harrison_17264", "pubmed23n0052_5362", "pubmed23n0045_15534", "pubmed23n0054_9105", "pubmed23n0053_8313", "pubmed23n0058_1366", "pubmed23n0055_165", "InternalMed_Harrison_25239", "pubmed23n0061_8532", "pubmed23n0058_15950", "pubmed23n0024_1190", "Surgery_Schwartz_5388", "InternalMed_Harrison_4907", "Surgery_Schwartz_13653", "pubmed23n0057_2100", "pubmed23n0048_7714", "Obstentrics_Williams_9092", "InternalMed_Harrison_10758", "pubmed23n0054_4200", "pubmed23n0060_6566", "InternalMed_Harrison_321", "pubmed23n0007_6598", "pubmed23n0028_4618", "pubmed23n0063_3886", "pubmed