{"topic": "Influenza", "competency": "Pathophysiology", "stem": "What is the effect of influenza on cerebrovascular reactivity?", "options": {"A": "Influenza impairs cerebrovascular reactivity", "B": "Influenza has no effect on cerebrovascular reactivity", "C": "Influenza improves cerebrovascular reactivity", "D": "Influenza has a variable effect on cerebrovascular reactivity"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Influenza impairs cerebrovascular reactivity, as evidenced by reduced cerebral blood flow velocities and breath-holding index in patients with influenza infection.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41525289", "title": "Evaluation of cerebrovascular reactivity using transcranial Doppler in patients with influenza", "span_text": "The influenza group demonstrated significantly lower cerebral blood flow velocities in the middle cerebral artery both at rest (PSVrest, MVrest, p < 0.001) and after the breath-holding test (PSVmax, MVmax, p < 0.001) compared to healthy controls. The BHI was also significantly reduced in the influenza group (p < 0.001), indicating impaired cerebrovascular reactivity."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2024-02-20", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41576702", "pubmed_web_41558718", "pubmed_web_41527686", "pubmed_web_41525289", "pubmed_web_41498247", "pubmed_web_41488397", "pubmed_web_41441213", "pubmed_web_41359492", "pubmed_web_41306415", "pubmed_web_41304130", "pubmed_web_41295514", "pubmed_web_41268452", "pubmed_web_41263641", "pubmed_web_41227273", "pubmed_web_41211943", "pubmed_web_41150424", "pubmed_web_41092928", "pubmed_web_41092926", "pubmed_web_41091464", "pubmed_web_41086685"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41576702", "pubmed_web_41558718", "pubmed_web_41527686", "pubmed_web_41525289", "pubmed_web_41498247", "pubmed_web_41488397", "pubmed_web_41441213", "pubmed_web_41359492", "pubmed_web_41306415", "pubmed_web_41304130", "pubmed_web_41295514", "pubmed_web_41268452", "pubmed_web_41263641