{"topic": "Dengue", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "What is the current status of specific antiviral drugs for the treatment of dengue infection?", "options": {"A": "There are several specific antiviral drugs available for the treatment of dengue infection.", "B": "There are no specific antiviral drugs currently available for the treatment of dengue infection.", "C": "The development of specific antiviral drugs for dengue infection is not a priority.", "D": "Specific antiviral drugs for dengue infection are only available for severe cases."}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "According to current research, there are no specific antiviral drugs available for the treatment of dengue infection.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41575777", "title": "Dengue and Aging: Challenges and Opportunities in Prevention and Care. A narrative review.", "span_text": "To date, there are no specific prognostic markers and no specific antiviral drugs."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41575777", "pubmed_web_41571683", "pubmed_web_41571221", "pubmed_web_41568746", "pubmed_web_41561567", "pubmed_web_41559858", "pubmed_web_41557736", "pubmed_web_41545435", "pubmed_web_41538617", "pubmed_web_41531540", "pubmed_web_41530076", "pubmed_web_41529013", "pubmed_web_41524167", "pubmed_web_41511926", "pubmed_web_41505455", "pubmed_web_41503260", "pubmed_web_41502203", "pubmed_web_41499962", "pubmed_web_41498886", "pubmed_web_41496564"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41575777", "pubmed_web_41571683", "pubmed_web_41571221", "pubmed_web_41568746", "pubmed_web_41561567", "pubmed_web_41559858", "pubmed_web_41557736", "pubmed_web_41545435", "pubmed_web_41538617", "pubmed_web_41531540", "pubmed_web_41530076", "pubmed_web_41529013", "pubmed_web_41524167", "pubmed_web_41511926", "pubmed_web_41505455", "pubmed_web_41503260", "pubmed_web_41502203", "pubmed_web_41499962", "pubmed_web_41498886", "pubmed_web_41496564"