{"topic": "COVID-19", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the prognostic value of the Brixia score in predicting outcomes across COVID-19 and H1N1 patients?", "options": {"A": "The Brixia score has a high prognostic value in predicting outcomes across COVID-19 and H1N1 patients.", "B": "The Brixia score has a low prognostic value in predicting outcomes across COVID-19 and H1N1 patients.", "C": "The Brixia score is not useful in predicting outcomes across COVID-19 and H1N1 patients.", "D": "The Brixia score is only useful in predicting outcomes for H1N1 patients."}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The Brixia score is a useful prognostic tool in predicting outcomes across COVID-19 and H1N1 patients, with higher scores indicating greater severity and mortality.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41578536", "title": "Brixia score on initial chest X-ray as a predictor of outcome in COVID-19 and H1N1 acute chest infections: A retrospective study.", "span_text": "Our study demonstrates the prognostic value of the Brixia score in predicting outcomes across COVID-19 and H1N1 patients. COVID-19 patients had higher Brixia scores and greater score increments over time, correlating with increased mortality."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41578536", "pubmed_web_41576058", "pubmed_web_41574291", "pubmed_web_41573583", "pubmed_web_41572753", "pubmed_web_41568045", "pubmed_web_41562079", "pubmed_web_41558017", "pubmed_web_41557029", "pubmed_web_41556143", "pubmed_web_41553094", "pubmed_web_41551542", "pubmed_web_41551441", "pubmed_web_41543599", "pubmed_web_41543095", "pubmed_web_41536336", "pubmed_web_41533960", "pubmed_web_41532840", "pubmed_web_41532263", "pubmed_web_41532065"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41578536", "pubmed_web_41576058", "pubmed_web_41574291", "pubmed_web_41573583", "pubmed_web_41572753", "pubmed_web_41568045", "pubmed_web_41562079", "pubmed_web_41558017", "pubmed_web_41