{"topic": "Iron deficiency anemia", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a potential long-term developmental outcome for infants with iron deficiency anemia?", "options": {"A": "Lowered scores on tests of mental and motor development", "B": "Increased risk of cardiac complications", "C": "Higher risk of preterm delivery", "D": "Improved hematologic status"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Iron deficiency anemia has been associated with lowered scores on tests of mental and motor development in infancy, and this effect can persist into childhood.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0062_11776", "title": "Long-term developmental outcome of infants with iron deficiency", "span_text": "Iron-deficiency anemia has been associated with lowered scores on tests of mental and motor development in infancy. However, the long-term developmental outcome of infants with iron deficiency is unknown, because developmental tests in infancy do not predict later intellectual functioning."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0060_3233", "Surgery_Schwartz_7917", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1179", "pubmed23n0060_15744", "Obstentrics_Williams_7738", "pubmed23n0052_12482", "pubmed23n0062_11776", "pubmed23n0007_5466", "pubmed23n0046_18126", "InternalMed_Harrison_7972", "pubmed23n0023_3754", "Obstentrics_Williams_8071", "Biochemistry_Lippincott_125", "pubmed23n0058_2981", "InternalMed_Harrison_21649", "pubmed23n0053_8948", "pubmed23n0032_10773", "pubmed23n0043_8419", "pubmed23n0059_554", "pubmed23n0021_6038", "Obstentrics_Williams_1013", "pubmed23n0004_1185", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3195", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3464", "pubmed23n0052_18492", "pubmed23n0044_24827", "InternalMed_Harrison_7989", "pubmed23n0047_13369", "pubmed23n0051_3990", "pubmed23n0035_5735", "Pathology_Robbins_2752", "Surgery_Schwartz_10039", "pubmed23n0043_17170", "InternalMed_Harrison_8009", "pubmed23n0052_18501", "pubmed23n0031_6266", "pubmed23n0063_9142", "pubmed23n