{"topic": "Breast cancer", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the primary factor influencing survival in patients with recurrent breast cancer?", "options": {"A": "Site of first recurrence and rate of tumor progression", "B": "Choice of initial therapy", "C": "Age at diagnosis", "D": "Hormonal status"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The site of first recurrence and rate of tumor progression are the primary factors influencing survival in patients with recurrent breast cancer, as they govern prognosis more than the choice of initial therapy.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0015_666", "title": "Recurrent breast cancer: factors influencing survival, including treatment", "span_text": "Factors influencing survival were reviewed in 464 patients with recurrent breast cancer. Site of first recurrence and rate of tumor progression governed prognosis more than choice of initial therapy."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0063_10697", "pubmed23n0015_666", "pubmed23n0062_13842", "pubmed23n0062_13837", "pubmed23n0049_4984", "pubmed23n0054_10173", "pubmed23n0044_23548", "pubmed23n0057_12404", "pubmed23n0050_1921", "Surgery_Schwartz_3921", "pubmed23n0057_20740", "pubmed23n0061_9002", "pubmed23n0054_13123", "Surgery_Schwartz_9248", "pubmed23n0054_17029", "pubmed23n0021_12033", "pubmed23n0056_7990", "pubmed23n0063_12841", "pubmed23n0045_3378", "pubmed23n0063_6431", "Surgery_Schwartz_3694", "pubmed23n0017_877", "pubmed23n0007_6125", "InternalMed_Harrison_31956", "Gynecology_Novak_7934", "Surgery_Schwartz_3795", "Surgery_Schwartz_4144", "pubmed23n0051_6928", "pubmed23n0023_11675", "pubmed23n0037_3240", "pubmed23n0056_20844", "pubmed23n0046_3408", "pubmed23n0042_15111", "pubmed23n0061_16143", "pubmed23n0052_13288", "pubmed23n0054_16380", "Obstentrics_Williams_8693", "pubmed23n0043_19005", "pubmed23n0061_14586", "pubmed23n0057_19860", "pubmed23n0054_10143", "pubmed23n0053_9222", "pubmed23n0053_3084", "Surg