{"topic": "Pulmonary embolism", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "What is the primary anticoagulant recommended for aggressive medical management of acute deep vein thrombophlebitis and pulmonary embolism in late gestation?", "options": {"A": "Heparin", "B": "Warfarin", "C": "Aspirin", "D": "Antivenom"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Heparin is the primary anticoagulant recommended for aggressive medical management of acute deep vein thrombophlebitis and pulmonary embolism in late gestation.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0034_2582", "title": "Thrombophlebitis and pulmonary embolism with surgical intervention in the third trimester", "span_text": "It is our belief that aggressive medical management is best accomplished by giving heparin intravenously as the primary anticoagulant."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0013_7566", "pubmed23n0035_124", "pubmed23n0026_1356", "pubmed23n0034_2582", "pubmed23n0060_13975", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6275", "InternalMed_Harrison_18253", "pubmed23n0045_6108", "pubmed23n0013_11386", "pubmed23n0037_2417", "pubmed23n0054_18227", "pubmed23n0022_1339", "InternalMed_Harrison_7925", "pubmed23n0061_12104", "Surgery_Schwartz_5014", "pubmed23n0014_8318", "pubmed23n0052_1199", "Obstentrics_Williams_7236", "pubmed23n0062_17112", "pubmed23n0032_5037", "pubmed23n0052_6289", "pubmed23n0057_23335", "pubmed23n0062_4555", "pubmed23n0061_8767", "pubmed23n0059_10007", "pubmed23n0021_3641", "pubmed23n0026_5602", "pubmed23n0054_17523", "pubmed23n0045_11357", "pubmed23n0030_1146", "pubmed23n0025_1441", "pubmed23n0011_2053", "InternalMed_Harrison_18596", "pubmed23n0046_20928", "pubmed23n0028_26", "pubmed23n0026_4651", "pubmed23n0062_8890", "Gynecology_Novak_3681"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0013_7566", "pubmed23n0035_124", "pubmed23n0026_1356", "pubmed23n0034_2582", "pubmed23n0060_13975", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6275", "InternalMed_Harrison_18253", "pubmed23n0045_6108", "pubmed23n00