{"topic": "Depression", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the recommended first-line treatment for insomnia in patients with major depression?", "options": {"A": "Pharmacotherapy", "B": "Behavioral therapies", "C": "Psychotherapy", "D": "Electroconvulsive therapy"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Behavioral therapies should be the first-line treatment for insomnia in patients with major depression, followed by judicious use of sleep-promoting medications if needed.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_2200", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Behavioral therapies should be the first-line treatment, followed by judicious use of sleep-promoting medications if needed."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_2200", "pubmed23n0047_9565", "pubmed23n0056_2610", "pubmed23n0062_10204", "pubmed23n0051_18119", "pubmed23n0063_14292", "pubmed23n0056_4757", "pubmed23n0062_112", "pubmed23n0047_9561", "pubmed23n0052_13251", "pubmed23n0057_17817", "pubmed23n0053_6874", "pubmed23n0057_21089", "pubmed23n0002_2987", "pubmed23n0049_2904", "pubmed23n0001_13261", "pubmed23n0056_3866", "pubmed23n0059_6938", "pubmed23n0002_3536", "pubmed23n0023_3022", "pubmed23n0001_2759", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1218", "pubmed23n0021_6866", "Gynecology_Novak_7625", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3148", "pubmed23n0060_12863"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_2200", "pubmed23n0047_9565", "pubmed23n0056_2610", "pubmed23n0062_10204", "pubmed23n0051_18119", "pubmed23n0063_14292", "pubmed23n0056_4757", "pubmed23n0062_112", "pubmed23n0047_9561", "pubmed23n0052_13251", "pubmed23n0057_17817", "pubmed23n0053_6874", "pubmed23n0057_21089", "pubmed23n0002_2987", "pubmed23n0049_2904", "pubmed23n0001_13261", "pubmed23n0056_3866", "pubmed23n0059_6938", "pubmed23n0002_3536", "pubmed23n0023_3022"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": [