{"topic": "Deep vein thrombosis", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the impact of deep vein thrombosis on mortality in patients with acute stroke?", "options": {"A": "Mortality is significantly higher among patients who develop deep vein thrombosis", "B": "Mortality is lower among patients who develop deep vein thrombosis", "C": "Deep vein thrombosis has no impact on mortality in patients with acute stroke", "D": "The relationship between deep vein thrombosis and mortality in acute stroke is unclear"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Deep vein thrombosis is a frequent complication of acute stroke and may influence the prognosis by inducing pulmonary embolism, which can be fatal.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0051_9881", "title": "Venous thromboembolism in acute stroke. Prognostic importance of hypercoagulability.", "span_text": "Mortality was significantly higher among the 20 patients who developed a deep vein thrombosis, and eight of them had necropsy evidence of pulmonary embolism."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0042_11508", "Surgery_Schwartz_7883", "pubmed23n0051_9881", "InternalMed_Harrison_21922", "pubmed23n0057_21160", "pubmed23n0042_1771", "Surgery_Schwartz_13806", "Surgery_Schwartz_6737", "pubmed23n0011_907", "pubmed23n0051_16383", "Surgery_Schwartz_5045", "InternalMed_Harrison_19220", "Obstentrics_Williams_8386", "Surgery_Schwartz_7848", "pubmed23n0063_4426", "pubmed23n0013_6526", "Surgery_Schwartz_6661", "pubmed23n0038_3894", "pubmed23n0061_4046", "pubmed23n0050_21776", "pubmed23n0025_10740", "pubmed23n0004_3136", "Surgery_Schwartz_12423", "pubmed23n0016_1380", "pubmed23n0048_10257", "Surgery_Schwartz_6736", "pubmed23n0054_4665", "pubmed23n0029_11456"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0042_11508", "Surgery_Schwartz_7883", "pubmed23n0051_9881", "InternalMed_Harrison_21922", "pubmed23n0057_21160", "pubmed23n0042_1771", "Surgery_Schwartz_13806", "Surgery_Schwartz_6737", "pubm