{"topic": "Pulmonary embolism", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the most documented prophylactic modality for preventing pulmonary embolism in patients at high risk of developing venous thromboembolic complications?", "options": {"A": "Application of low-dose heparin", "B": "Oral anticoagulants with low intensity of anticoagulation", "C": "Mechanical methods of prophylaxis", "D": "Dextran"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The application of low-dose heparin is the best documented prophylactic modality for preventing pulmonary embolism in patients at high risk of developing venous thromboembolic complications.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0044_2780", "title": "Prevention of pulmonary embolism", "span_text": "Application of low-dose heparin is the best documented prophylactic modality."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0044_2780", "pubmed23n0016_5510", "pubmed23n0059_8009", "pubmed23n0059_1335", "pubmed23n0059_5393", "pubmed23n0030_8826", "pubmed23n0034_2683", "pubmed23n0029_9420", "InternalMed_Harrison_29933", "pubmed23n0013_10878", "pubmed23n0059_1931", "pubmed23n0060_2333", "pubmed23n0055_16040", "InternalMed_Harrison_5930", "Surgery_Schwartz_6771", "pubmed23n0025_1442", "pubmed23n0062_15316", "pubmed23n0025_1433"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0044_2780", "pubmed23n0016_5510", "pubmed23n0059_8009", "pubmed23n0059_1335", "pubmed23n0059_5393", "pubmed23n0030_8826", "pubmed23n0034_2683", "pubmed23n0029_9420", "InternalMed_Harrison_29933", "pubmed23n0013_10878", "pubmed23n0059_1931", "pubmed23n0060_2333", "pubmed23n0055_16040", "InternalMed_Harrison_5930", "Surgery_Schwartz_6771", "pubmed23n0025_1442", "pubmed23n0062_15316", "pubmed23n0025_1433"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Pulmonary embolism Prevention prevention prophy