{"topic": "Iron deficiency anemia", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is the primary indication for the use of iron preparations?", "options": {"A": "Treatment of iron deficiency anemia", "B": "Treatment of vitamin deficiency anemia", "C": "Treatment of chronic kidney disease", "D": "Treatment of rheumatoid arthritis"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Iron preparations are primarily used to treat or prevent iron deficiency anemia, which is a hypochromic, microcytic anemia characterized by a low mean cell volume and mean cell hemoglobin concentration.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_3634", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "The only clinical indication for the use of iron preparations is the treatment or prevention of iron deficiency anemia."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_6212", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4010", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3619", "pubmed23n0055_16874", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3084", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3634", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1043", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3635", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5232", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3648", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6173", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3618", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5928", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5368", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3617", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5765", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7085", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6954", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6459", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4002", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3761", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5231", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2547"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_6212", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4010", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3619", "pubmed23n0055_16874", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3084", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3634", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1043", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3635", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5232", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3648", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6173", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3618", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5928", "Pharm