{"topic": "Neonatal sepsis", "competency": "Pathophysiology", "stem": "What is a key factor in the pathogenesis of sepsis-induced acute lung injury?", "options": {"A": "Increased alveolar-capillary membrane permeability", "B": "Decreased neutrophil migration into the alveoli", "C": "Upregulation of resident alveolar macrophages", "D": "Downregulation of oxidative stress"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Sepsis-induced acute lung injury is characterized by increased alveolar-capillary membrane permeability, leading to the leakage of plasma proteins into the alveoli.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0061_16789", "title": "Sepsis-induced lung injury and the effects of ibuprofen pretreatment", "span_text": "Increases in BAL fluid total protein were primarily due to low-molecular-weight plasma protein, indicating relative preservation of alveolar-capillary membrane size selectivity."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0061_16789", "pubmed23n0060_3157", "InternalMed_Harrison_21505", "Pathology_Robbins_694", "pubmed23n0062_2056", "InternalMed_Harrison_9290", "pubmed23n0047_14615", "pubmed23n0051_11348", "Surgery_Schwartz_276", "Surgery_Schwartz_923", "pubmed23n0012_5252", "pubmed23n0014_6593", "pubmed23n0049_4643", "pubmed23n0035_253", "pubmed23n0059_14752", "Obstentrics_Williams_5190", "pubmed23n0053_15022", "pubmed23n0052_5423", "pubmed23n0043_6478", "pubmed23n0045_19477", "Obstentrics_Williams_4278", "pubmed23n0055_6038", "Pathology_Robbins_716", "pubmed23n0060_17997", "pubmed23n0050_21085"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0061_16789", "pubmed23n0060_3157", "InternalMed_Harrison_21505", "Pathology_Robbins_694", "pubmed23n0062_2056", "InternalMed_Harrison_9290", "pubmed23n0047_14615", "pubmed23n0051_11348", "Surgery_Schwartz_276", "Surgery_Schwartz_923", "pubmed23n0012_5252", "pubmed23n0014_6593", "pubmed23n0049_4643", "pubmed23n0035_253", "pubmed23n0059_14752", "Obstentrics_Williams_5190", "pubmed23n00