{"topic": "Diabetes mellitus", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary goal of screening for type 1 diabetes in genetically predisposed and high-risk subjects?", "options": {"A": "To identify immunological and metabolic markers of prediabetes", "B": "To diagnose diabetes mellitus", "C": "To prevent cerebro-cardiovascular diseases", "D": "To manage hypercholesterolemia"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The primary goal of screening for type 1 diabetes in genetically predisposed and high-risk subjects is to identify immunological and metabolic markers of prediabetes, which can help in early intervention and prevention of the disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0050_1929", "title": "Screening and prevention of type 1 diabetes", "span_text": "Among genetically predisposed and high risk subjects, this phase of prediabetes can be identified by detection of immunological and metabolic markers."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0050_1929", "pubmed23n0043_6323", "pubmed23n0055_21781", "InternalMed_Harrison_17264", "pubmed23n0049_3300", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "pubmed23n0047_21300", "Surgery_Schwartz_5388", "InternalMed_Harrison_322", "pubmed23n0044_23667", "InternalMed_Harrison_11663", "pubmed23n0063_12708", "pubmed23n0056_5267", "InternalMed_Harrison_21709", "Gynecology_Novak_958", "InternalMed_Harrison_27844", "pubmed23n0050_3812", "pubmed23n0054_2264", "InternalMed_Harrison_19008", "pubmed23n0047_3577", "pubmed23n0002_1055", "pubmed23n0058_15904", "InternalMed_Harrison_28054", "pubmed23n0052_2656"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0050_1929", "pubmed23n0043_6323", "pubmed23n0055_21781", "InternalMed_Harrison_17264", "pubmed23n0049_3300", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "pubmed23n0047_21300", "Surgery_Schwartz_5388", "InternalMed_Harrison_322", "pubmed23n0044_23667", "InternalMed_Harrison_11663", "pubmed23n0063_12708", "pubmed23n0056_5267", "InternalMed_Harrison_21709", "Gynecology_Novak_958