{"topic": "Systemic lupus erythematosus", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is a potential adverse effect of long-term procainamide therapy?", "options": {"A": "Reversible infertility in women", "B": "A syndrome resembling lupus erythematosus", "C": "Seizures", "D": "Hepatotoxicity"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Procainamide therapy can cause a syndrome resembling lupus erythematosus, which usually consists of arthralgia and arthritis, and in some patients, pleuritis, pericarditis, or parenchymal pulmonary disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_1396", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "A troublesome adverse effect of long-term procainamide therapy is a syndrome resembling lupus erythematosus and usually consisting of arthralgia and arthritis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_5229", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1397", "pubmed23n0015_4598", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4010", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3481", "pubmed23n0057_7830", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5325", "pubmed23n0013_3263", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1078", "pubmed23n0002_7034", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1396", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6222", "pubmed23n0022_5868", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1079", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5228", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2810", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6134", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6790", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5326", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6467", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1670", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3801", "pubmed23n0009_4526", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2773", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4057", "pubmed23n0052_21566", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6129", "pubmed23n0002_3465", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6954", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5466", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3066", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6788", "pubmed23n0023_7182"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_5229", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1397", "pubmed23n0015_4598", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4010", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3481", "pubmed23n0057_7830", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5325", "pub