{"topic": "Osteoarthritis", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a potential complication of osteoarthritis in obese individuals?", "options": {"A": "Increased risk of diabetes mellitus", "B": "Decreased risk of heart disease", "C": "Improved joint mobility", "D": "Reduced risk of hypertension"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Osteoarthritis is associated with various health risks, including diabetes mellitus, heart disease, hypertension, and stroke, particularly in obese individuals.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Obstentrics_Williams_6591", "title": "Obstentrics_Williams", "span_text": "The adverse health aspects of obesity are staggering and include risks for diabetes mellitus, heart disease, hypertension, stroke, and osteoarthritis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"source": "database", "doc_ids": ["Obstentrics_Williams_6591", "pubmed23n0063_20619", "pubmed23n0052_14508", "InternalMed_Harrison_26060", "pubmed23n0057_21760", "pubmed23n0044_23263", "pubmed23n0045_15011"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Obstentrics_Williams_6591", "pubmed23n0063_20619", "pubmed23n0052_14508", "InternalMed_Harrison_26060", "pubmed23n0057_21760", "pubmed23n0044_23263", "pubmed23n0045_15011"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "expert review", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Osteoarthritis Complications complications adverse outcomes sequelae comorbidity disease progression risk factors mortality morbidity hospitalization long-term effects severity clinical deterioration", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 19697.757916001137, "llm_ms": 881.678500038106, "verification_ms": 1135.0333750015125, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 1, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FAILED_VERIFICA