{"topic": "Prostate cancer", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "What is the primary goal of second-line therapy in relapsed prostate cancer?", "options": {"A": "To prolong survival", "B": "To improve the quality of survival", "C": "To reduce symptoms", "D": "To achieve a complete cure"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Second-line therapy in relapsed prostate cancer aims to improve the quality of survival, rather than just prolonging it, while considering the patient's specific expectations and wishes.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0046_2320", "title": "Management of relapsing disease in prostate cancer", "span_text": "Second-line therapy in relapsed disease makes sense if life can be prolonged while relieving symptoms and maintaining or improving the quality of survival."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0046_2320", "pubmed23n0014_1234", "pubmed23n0057_6886", "pubmed23n0049_1490", "pubmed23n0045_20584", "pubmed23n0059_21327", "pubmed23n0047_18377", "Gynecology_Novak_7505", "pubmed23n0035_5", "pubmed23n0050_3505", "pubmed23n0063_22274", "pubmed23n0046_3716", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6022", "pubmed23n0061_987", "pubmed23n0051_15077", "pubmed23n0057_9751", "pubmed23n0054_17944", "pubmed23n0046_19458", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5954", "InternalMed_Harrison_532", "pubmed23n0061_19896", "Surgery_Schwartz_11662", "pubmed23n0056_3208", "pubmed23n0051_386", "pubmed23n0057_17763", "InternalMed_Harrison_540", "InternalMed_Harrison_7921", "pubmed23n0059_8920", "pubmed23n0053_4520", "Surgery_Schwartz_2050", "pubmed23n0062_10726", "pubmed23n0052_15077", "pubmed23n0053_12179", "pubmed23n0046_11650", "pubmed23n0052_15070", "InternalMed_Harrison_7728", "Gynecology_Novak_7625", "pubmed23n0063_22383", "pubmed23n0056_16263", "pubmed23n0059_4521", "pubmed23n0036_4452", "pubmed23n0050_12565", "pubmed23n0018_5923", "pubmed23n0038_9815", "pubmed23n0037_592", "pubmed23n0010_1239", "InternalMed_Harrison_21302", "Surgery_Schwar