{"topic": "Hepatitis C", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary method of preventing hepatitis C transmission through blood transfusions?", "options": {"A": "Screening donor blood with surrogate markers", "B": "Excluding commercial blood donors and relying on volunteer blood supply", "C": "Using hepatitis C vaccines", "D": "Implementing strict handling and storage procedures"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Prevention of transfusion-associated hepatitis C has been accomplished by excluding commercial blood donors and relying on a volunteer blood supply, among other measures.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_23589", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Prevention of transfusion-associated hepatitis C has been accomplished by the following successively introduced measures: exclusion of commercial blood donors and reliance on a volunteer blood supply;"}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0055_9924", "Surgery_Schwartz_1283", "InternalMed_Harrison_23589", "pubmed23n0051_1197", "pubmed23n0043_8175", "pubmed23n0061_3727", "pubmed23n0044_19424", "pubmed23n0043_1189", "pubmed23n0050_2282", "pubmed23n0046_4404", "pubmed23n0061_9105", "pubmed23n0061_593", "pubmed23n0044_1828", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3319", "Obstentrics_Williams_7653", "pubmed23n0007_4002", "pubmed23n0049_5390", "pubmed23n0041_8099"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0055_9924", "Surgery_Schwartz_1283", "InternalMed_Harrison_23589", "pubmed23n0051_1197", "pubmed23n0043_8175", "pubmed23n0061_3727", "pubmed23n0044_19424", "pubmed23n0043_1189", "pubmed23n0050_2282", "pubmed23n0046_4404", "pubmed23n0061_9105", "pubmed23n0061_593", "pubmed23n0044_1828", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3319", "Obstentrics_Williams_7653", "pubmed23n0007_4002", "pubmed23n0049_5390", "pubmed23n0041_8099"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "exp