{"topic": "Typhoid fever", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is a key measure to prevent the spread of typhoid fever in a community?", "options": {"A": "Improving vaccination coverage among food handlers", "B": "Increasing the use of antibiotics in treatment", "C": "Reducing the number of medical facilities", "D": "Decreasing the frequency of water chlorination"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Preventing the spread of typhoid fever involves measures that reduce the transmission of the bacteria. Improving vaccination coverage among food handlers is crucial because they can be carriers of the disease and spread it through contaminated food.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41573761", "title": "Investigation of an outbreak of typhoid fever in a rural district of East Malaysia, 2019", "span_text": "Immediate steps to control the outbreak included chlorinating water wells, disinfecting waste disposal areas and promptly vaccinating all food handlers, including those working in street food settings."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41573761", "pubmed_web_41556126", "pubmed_web_41438164", "pubmed_web_41418607", "pubmed_web_41415828", "pubmed_web_41409555", "pubmed_web_41327441", "pubmed_web_41276924", "pubmed_web_41246287", "pubmed_web_41240962", "pubmed_web_41240950", "pubmed_web_41209881", "pubmed_web_41160821", "pubmed_web_41125003", "pubmed_web_41092802", "pubmed_web_41082884", "pubmed_web_41080792", "pubmed_web_41066482", "pubmed_web_41062830", "pubmed_web_41056354"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41573761", "pubmed_web_41556126", "pubmed_web_41438164", "pubmed_web_41418607", "pubmed_web_41415828", "pubmed_web_41409555", "pubmed_web_41327441", "pubmed_web_41276924", "pubmed_web_41246287", "pubmed_web_41240962", "pubmed_web_41240950", "pubmed_web_41209881", "pubmed_web_41160821", "pubmed_web_41125003", "pubmed_web_41092802", "pubmed_web_41082884", "pubmed_web_41080