{"topic": "Hepatitis B", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the prognosis for patients with acute viral hepatitis B in terms of the chronic course of the disease?", "options": {"A": "The chronic course of acute hepatitis B is more severe than non-B hepatitis.", "B": "The chronic course of acute hepatitis B is less severe than non-B hepatitis.", "C": "There is no difference in the chronic course of acute hepatitis B and non-B hepatitis.", "D": "The chronic course of acute hepatitis B is always fatal."}, "answer_key": "C", "explanation": "A difference in prognosis as to a chronic course of acute hepatitis B and non B hepatitis could not be found.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0021_10046", "title": "Prognosis of acute viral hepatitis B (author's transl)", "span_text": "A difference in prognosis as to a chronic course of acute hepatitis B and non B hepatitis could not be found. Transition to a chronic stage seems to occur in about 3-15% of both forms of the disease together."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0021_10046", "pubmed23n0059_9002", "pubmed23n0036_1940", "pubmed23n0055_23456", "InternalMed_Harrison_23934", "InternalMed_Harrison_23783", "pubmed23n0061_9286", "pubmed23n0048_12350", "InternalMed_Harrison_24121", "InternalMed_Harrison_24176", "Obstentrics_Williams_7600", "pubmed23n0049_2731", "pubmed23n0060_6551", "pubmed23n0058_18602", "pubmed23n0048_14955", "pubmed23n0056_20815", "pubmed23n0015_905", "pubmed23n0055_13639", "pubmed23n0012_8310", "Surgery_Schwartz_9022"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0021_10046", "pubmed23n0059_9002", "pubmed23n0036_1940", "pubmed23n0055_23456", "InternalMed_Harrison_23934", "InternalMed_Harrison_23783", "pubmed23n0061_9286", "pubmed23n0048_12350", "InternalMed_Harrison_24121", "InternalMed_Harrison_24176", "Obstentrics_Williams_7600", "pubmed23n0049_2731", "pubmed23n0060_6551", "pubmed23n0058_18602", "pubmed23n0048_14955", "pubmed23n0056_20815", "pub