{"topic": "COVID-19", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What was the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on travel medicine services in Taiwan from 2019 to 2022?", "options": {"A": "The pandemic had no impact on travel medicine services in Taiwan.", "B": "The pandemic led to a decrease in travel clinic visits and travel vaccinations.", "C": "The pandemic led to an increase in travel clinic visits and travel vaccinations.", "D": "The pandemic had a mixed impact, with some years showing an increase and others a decrease in travel medicine services."}, "answer_key": "D", "explanation": "The COVID-19 pandemic had a mixed impact on travel medicine services in Taiwan, with a decrease in travel clinic visits and travel vaccinations in 2020, but an increase in subsequent years.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41580001", "title": "Impact of the COVID-19 Pandemic on Travel Medicine Services in Taiwan, 2019-2022", "span_text": "The pandemic reshaped Taiwan's travel medicine landscape. Coordinated government-hospital efforts enabled timely vaccine allocation, minimized wastage, and maintained service capacity. These results underscore the need for flexible vaccination strategies and the transition toward digital health documentation for future preparedness."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41580734", "pubmed_web_41580001", "pubmed_web_41579755", "pubmed_web_41579682", "pubmed_web_41579008", "pubmed_web_41578985", "pubmed_web_41578736", "pubmed_web_41578650", "pubmed_web_41578501", "pubmed_web_41578439", "pubmed_web_41578061", "pubmed_web_41577334", "pubmed_web_41577256", "pubmed_web_41576992", "pubmed_web_41576408", "pubmed_web_41576149", "pubmed_web_41576069", "pubmed_web_41575399", "pubmed_web_41575221", "pubmed_web_41575207"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41580734", "pubmed_web_41580001", "pubmed_web_41579755", "pubmed_web_41579682", "pubmed_web_41579008", "pubmed_web_41578985", "pubmed_web_41578