{"topic": "Neonatal sepsis", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "What is the primary challenge in diagnosing neonatal sepsis?", "options": {"A": "Lack of clinical symptoms", "B": "Limited laboratory tests", "C": "No definitive diagnostic test", "D": "Insufficient blood culture results"}, "answer_key": "C", "explanation": "The diagnosis of neonatal sepsis is difficult due to the lack of a definitive diagnostic test, making it challenging to accurately diagnose the condition.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0062_17702", "title": "Clinicopathologic approach to the diagnosis of neonatal sepsis", "span_text": "Accurate diagnosis is difficult because there is no definitive diagnostic test; even blood cultures have an unacceptably low sensitivity."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0062_17702", "pubmed23n0002_8348", "pubmed23n0015_9330", "pubmed23n0043_188", "pubmed23n0018_2369", "pubmed23n0062_343", "pubmed23n0061_9797", "pubmed23n0058_20356", "pubmed23n0016_10849", "pubmed23n0013_829", "pubmed23n0019_4963", "pubmed23n0048_2899", "pubmed23n0041_3172", "pubmed23n0053_15474", "pubmed23n0022_8342", "pubmed23n0006_238", "pubmed23n0044_7958"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0062_17702", "pubmed23n0002_8348", "pubmed23n0015_9330", "pubmed23n0043_188", "pubmed23n0018_2369", "pubmed23n0062_343", "pubmed23n0061_9797", "pubmed23n0058_20356", "pubmed23n0016_10849", "pubmed23n0013_829", "pubmed23n0019_4963", "pubmed23n0048_2899", "pubmed23n0041_3172", "pubmed23n0053_15474", "pubmed23n0022_8342", "pubmed23n0006_238", "pubmed23n0044_7958"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Neonatal sepsis Diagnosis diagnosis differential diagnosis signs symptoms screening clinical features presentation diagnostic criteria workup evaluation diagnostic test laboratory findings imaging"