{"topic": "Cervical cancer", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is a major advancement in supportive care for cancer patients that has been the synthesis of which type of growth factors?", "options": {"A": "Hemopoietic growth factors", "B": "Interferon growth factors", "C": "Hormonal growth factors", "D": "Antidote growth factors"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The synthesis of hemopoietic growth factors has been a major advancement in supportive care for cancer patients, which are effective even in patients of advanced age.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0051_6937", "title": "Pharmacology and organ toxicity of chemotherapy in older patients", "span_text": "A major advancement in supportive care has been the synthesis of hemopoietic growth factors, which are effective even in patients of advanced age."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0051_6937", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2398", "Pharmacology_Katzung_108", "pubmed23n0054_5472", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3959", "pubmed23n0008_957", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3499", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3498", "Pharmacology_Katzung_422", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7085", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5945", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5941", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7144", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3997"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0051_6937", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2398", "Pharmacology_Katzung_108", "pubmed23n0054_5472", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3959", "pubmed23n0008_957", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3499", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3498", "Pharmacology_Katzung_422", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7085", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5945", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5941", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7144", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3997"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Cervical cancer Pharmacology pharmacology drug mechanism indication contraindication adverse effects dr