{"topic": "Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the primary goal of community-based screening programs for chronic health conditions, including chronic obstructive pulmonary disease?", "options": {"A": "To identify asymptomatic individuals who have the disease or who may be at risk for developing it", "B": "To provide treatment for individuals with chronic health conditions", "C": "To promote health education and risk-reduction programs", "D": "To conduct mass screening for biochemical markers or risk factors"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The primary goal of community-based screening programs is to identify asymptomatic individuals who have the disease or who may be at risk for developing it, in order to provide early intervention and prevention.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0063_20496", "title": "Guidelines for community-based screening for chronic health conditions", "span_text": "Preventive measures for many chronic diseases depend upon identification of asymptomatic individuals who have the disease or who may be at risk for developing it."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0063_20496", "pubmed23n0057_6081", "pubmed23n0052_7287", "pubmed23n0044_24565", "pubmed23n0021_8317", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0059_1765", "InternalMed_Harrison_315", "InternalMed_Harrison_5976", "pubmed23n0016_5876", "pubmed23n0058_3064", "pubmed23n0053_11610", "pubmed23n0045_19421", "InternalMed_Harrison_5978", "pubmed23n0028_12412", "pubmed23n0002_12168", "InternalMed_Harrison_5983", "pubmed23n0033_9269", "InternalMed_Harrison_294", "pubmed23n0028_2115", "pubmed23n0041_8966", "pubmed23n0053_5136", "pubmed23n0058_693", "pubmed23n0043_3127", "pubmed23n0055_19783", "InternalMed_Harrison_6708", "pubmed23n0059_18931", "InternalMed_Harrison_308", "Gynecology_Novak_713", "pubmed23n0028_11243", "pubmed23n0044_11098", "pubmed23n0053_19927", "pubmed23n0059_13871"