{"topic": "Anxiety disorder", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the recommended first-line treatment for anxiety disorders, such as panic disorder with or without agoraphobia?", "options": {"A": "Pharmacotherapy with SSRIs or TCAs", "B": "Behavioral therapies, such as CBT", "C": "Benzodiazepines, such as clonazepam", "D": "Monoamine oxidase inhibitors"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Behavioral therapies, such as cognitive-behavioral therapy (CBT), are recommended as the first-line treatment for anxiety disorders, including panic disorder with or without agoraphobia.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "First_Aid_Step2_987", "title": "First_Aid_Step2", "span_text": "Tx: CBT, pharmacotherapy (e.g., SSRIs, TCAs)."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_2200", "pubmed23n0056_2610", "Neurology_Adams_12314", "First_Aid_Step2_987", "pubmed23n0008_12397", "pubmed23n0049_12417", "pubmed23n0054_7177", "InternalMed_Harrison_31698", "pubmed23n0063_2014", "pubmed23n0059_7856", "pubmed23n0052_4636", "pubmed23n0054_14166", "First_Aid_Step2_985", "pubmed23n0056_822", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2320", "pubmed23n0052_1711", "pubmed23n0050_14464", "pubmed23n0059_2839", "pubmed23n0001_14259", "pubmed23n0061_5793", "pubmed23n0059_6938", "pubmed23n0057_2251", "InternalMed_Harrison_31659", "pubmed23n0056_14700", "pubmed23n0002_3536", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_1162", "pubmed23n0056_4079", "pubmed23n0045_2866", "pubmed23n0061_12283", "pubmed23n0051_16237", "pubmed23n0051_18118", "pubmed23n0063_22383", "pubmed23n0063_12722", "pubmed23n0049_6009", "pubmed23n0056_9336", "pubmed23n0002_4750", "pubmed23n0059_10025", "pubmed23n0062_15092", "pubmed23n0054_12628", "pubmed23n0052_3257", "pubmed23n0045_4453", "pubmed23n0063_646", "pubmed23n0001_9780", "pubmed23n0001_10085", "pubmed23n0054_18281", "pubmed23n0053_11350"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_2200", "pubmed23n0056_2610", "Neurology_Adams_12314", "First_Aid_Step2_987"