{"topic": "Dengue", "competency": "Investigation", "stem": "What is a simple and rapid diagnostic aid for the early diagnosis of dengue hemorrhagic fever?", "options": {"A": "Examination of the buffy coat preparation", "B": "Haemagglutination Inhibition test", "C": "Dengue Blot Assay", "D": "Dot enzyme immunoassay"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The examination of the buffy coat preparation is a unique finding in dengue hemorrhagic fever, especially during a secondary infection, and can be used as a simple and rapid diagnostic aid for early diagnosis.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0016_10875", "title": "Diagnostic value of buffy coat preparation in dengue hemorrhagic fever.", "span_text": "Examination of the buffy coat preparation is a simple, rapid diagnostic aid for the early diagnosis of dengue hemorrhagic fever (DHF)."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_16947", "InternalMed_Harrison_12697", "pubmed23n0016_10875", "pubmed23n0043_14688", "pubmed23n0059_16593", "pubmed23n0060_13248"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_16947", "InternalMed_Harrison_12697", "pubmed23n0016_10875", "pubmed23n0043_14688", "pubmed23n0059_16593", "pubmed23n0060_13248"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Dengue Investigation investigation diagnostic test laboratory findings imaging workup evaluation differential diagnosis clinical criteria biomarkers screening confirmatory test diagnostic accuracy", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 7980.138165992685, "llm_ms": 890.461916977074, "verification_ms": 800.6640840321779, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 1, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FA