{"topic": "Hepatitis B", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the primary goal of screening pregnant women for hepatitis B surface antigen?", "options": {"A": "To identify patients with clinical hepatitis", "B": "To detect occult liver disease", "C": "To prevent vertical transmission of the virus", "D": "To reduce the risk of acquiring hepatitis"}, "answer_key": "C", "explanation": "The primary goal of screening pregnant women for hepatitis B surface antigen is to prevent vertical transmission of the virus to the newborn.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0053_8768", "title": "[Determination of HBSAg in pregnancy. Epidemiologic study of 100 cases]", "span_text": "A universal screening must be undertaken in order to prevent vertical transmission of the virus and to detect families in risk."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0043_2664", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0061_8495", "pubmed23n0028_5085", "pubmed23n0043_3127", "pubmed23n0004_2204", "pubmed23n0043_1016", "pubmed23n0027_497", "pubmed23n0060_785", "pubmed23n0053_8768", "pubmed23n0058_19887", "pubmed23n0063_19629", "pubmed23n0048_10350", "pubmed23n0063_19562", "pubmed23n0061_679", "pubmed23n0046_18193", "pubmed23n0054_12575", "pubmed23n0051_9370", "pubmed23n0042_13673", "pubmed23n0037_1228", "Gynecology_Novak_722", "pubmed23n0043_1047"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0043_2664", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0061_8495", "pubmed23n0028_5085", "pubmed23n0043_3127", "pubmed23n0004_2204", "pubmed23n0043_1016", "pubmed23n0027_497", "pubmed23n0060_785", "pubmed23n0053_8768", "pubmed23n0058_19887", "pubmed23n0063_19629", "pubmed23n0048_10350", "pubmed23n0063_19562", "pubmed23n0061_679", "pubmed23n0046_18193", "pubmed23n0054_12575", "pubmed23n0051_9370", "pubmed23n0042_13673", "pubmed23n0037_1228"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attem