{"topic": "Back pain", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is a significant predictor of long-term prognosis in patients with chronic low back pain?", "options": {"A": "Psychological factors", "B": "Age of the patient", "C": "Duration of symptoms", "D": "Type of occupation"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Psychological factors, such as pain-fear and sick role, have been shown to be significant predictors of long-term prognosis in patients with chronic low back pain.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0046_22372", "title": "Psychological factors in the long-term prognosis of chronic low back pain patients", "span_text": "The number of elevated scales, in combination with the level of certain scales (HS and HY), proved to be a better predictor than profile patterns, advocated in some studies."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_7061", "pubmed23n0054_19647", "pubmed23n0017_11173", "InternalMed_Harrison_28854", "InternalMed_Harrison_32", "pubmed23n0005_3284", "pubmed23n0046_22372", "Surgery_Schwartz_13435", "pubmed23n0046_18230", "pubmed23n0006_4202", "InternalMed_Harrison_467", "pubmed23n0052_14812", "pubmed23n0036_3409", "pubmed23n0053_10680", "pubmed23n0057_23160", "pubmed23n0056_20844", "Gynecology_Novak_2663", "pubmed23n0061_9825", "Obstentrics_Williams_7738", "pubmed23n0046_12464", "pubmed23n0001_14221", "Obstentrics_Williams_6733", "Surgery_Schwartz_13814", "pubmed23n0051_9307", "Surgery_Schwartz_9748"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_7061", "pubmed23n0054_19647", "pubmed23n0017_11173", "InternalMed_Harrison_28854", "InternalMed_Harrison_32", "pubmed23n0005_3284", "pubmed23n0046_22372", "Surgery_Schwartz_13435", "pubmed23n0046_18230", "pubmed23n0006_4202", "InternalMed_Harrison_467", "pubmed23n0052_14812", "pubmed23n0036_3409", "pubmed23n0053_10680", "pubmed23n0057_23160", "pubmed23n0056_20844", "Gynecology_Novak_2663", "pubmed23n0061_9825", "Obstentrics_Williams_773