{"topic": "Chronic kidney disease", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the primary cause of morbidity and mortality in patients with chronic kidney disease?", "options": {"A": "Cardiovascular disease", "B": "Infection", "C": "Malignancy", "D": "Accidents"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of morbidity and mortality in patients with chronic kidney disease, with an incremental risk ranging from 10- to 200-fold compared to the age- and sex-matched general population.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_21641", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of morbidity and mortality in patients at every stage of CKD."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_17698", "Obstentrics_Williams_7330", "pubmed23n0048_18301", "pubmed23n0060_1027", "pubmed23n0038_728", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1934", "InternalMed_Harrison_21641", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3447", "pubmed23n0015_10735", "pubmed23n0049_12951", "pubmed23n0062_3110", "pubmed23n0022_11030", "pubmed23n0061_9530", "pubmed23n0062_12627", "pubmed23n0057_22094", "Surgery_Schwartz_9248", "pubmed23n0061_3896", "pubmed23n0053_8979", "pubmed23n0021_6096", "pubmed23n0051_10905", "pubmed23n0053_5127", "pubmed23n0014_9879", "pubmed23n0054_7544", "InternalMed_Harrison_25426", "pubmed23n0053_7061", "pubmed23n0047_3072", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "pubmed23n0039_8537", "pubmed23n0046_18923", "pubmed23n0003_12412", "InternalMed_Harrison_8603", "pubmed23n0051_18332", "pubmed23n0053_11668", "Surgery_Schwartz_2481", "pubmed23n0043_3917", "pubmed23n0016_13225", "pubmed23n0063_12841", "pubmed23n0063_10697", "pubmed23n0037_292", "pubmed23n0028_4922", "pubmed23n0017_11173", "pubmed23n0053_20089", "pubmed23n0026_11205", "InternalMed_Harrison_19220", "InternalMed_Harrison_18485", "InternalMed_Harrison_7098", "pubmed23n0052_19736", "pubmed23n0003_1971", "pubmed23n0036_8618", "pubmed