{"topic": "Colorectal cancer", "competency": "Etiology", "stem": "What is a known risk factor for the development of colorectal cancer?", "options": {"A": "Diet low in fat and high in fiber", "B": "Diet high in fat and low in fiber", "C": "Family history of breast cancer", "D": "History of cervical cancer"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "A diet high in fat and low in fiber is a known risk factor for the development of colorectal cancer.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_6983", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Mortality from colorectal cancer is directly correlated with per capita consumption of calories, meat protein, and dietary fat and oil as well as elevations in the serum cholesterol concentration and mortality from coronary artery disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Surgery_Schwartz_9785", "pubmed23n0056_13372", "Surgery_Schwartz_9786", "pubmed23n0015_7079", "pubmed23n0050_14370", "InternalMed_Harrison_6983", "First_Aid_Step1_412", "pubmed23n0049_956", "pubmed23n0013_9182", "Pathology_Robbins_180", "pubmed23n0063_22334", "pubmed23n0047_3214", "pubmed23n0050_16004", "pubmed23n0016_9878", "pubmed23n0012_8418", "Pathology_Robbins_1185", "pubmed23n0058_12692", "pubmed23n0012_8448", "pubmed23n0022_3531", "pubmed23n0049_4467", "pubmed23n0049_959", "pubmed23n0033_4056", "pubmed23n0054_17161", "pubmed23n0052_6848", "pubmed23n0052_14651", "pubmed23n0059_17167", "pubmed23n0024_7275", "pubmed23n0062_15964", "pubmed23n0003_9312", "Surgery_Schwartz_7526", "pubmed23n0047_4501", "pubmed23n0049_18295", "Cell_Biology_Alberts_5647", "pubmed23n0005_1270", "pubmed23n0030_12004", "InternalMed_Harrison_7942", "pubmed23n0050_4508", "pubmed23n0043_15753", "Surgery_Schwartz_8510", "pubmed23n0043_20380", "pubmed23n0044_9646", "InternalMed_Harrison_5005", "pubmed23n0047_5496", "Surgery_Schwartz_8511", "pubmed23n0048_2394", "InternalMed_Harrison_7523", "pubmed23n0053_14635", "pubmed23n0029_509