{"topic": "Atrial fibrillation", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the impact of atrial fibrillation on the long-term mortality of patients after acute myocardial infarction?", "options": {"A": "Atrial fibrillation increases the long-term mortality of patients after acute myocardial infarction", "B": "Atrial fibrillation has no effect on the long-term mortality of patients after acute myocardial infarction", "C": "Atrial fibrillation decreases the long-term mortality of patients after acute myocardial infarction", "D": "The effect of atrial fibrillation on long-term mortality after acute myocardial infarction is unknown"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The presence of atrial fibrillation during acute myocardial infarction is associated with a higher long-term mortality rate compared to patients without atrial fibrillation.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0052_17072", "title": "Long-term prognosis of patients with paroxysmal atrial fibrillation complicating acute myocardial infarction", "span_text": "The 1- and 5-year mortality rates were 18.6% and 43.3% in patients with paroxysmal atrial fibrillation as compared to 8.2% and 25.4% (P less than 0.001), respectively, in patients free of paroxysmal atrial fibrillation."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0052_17072", "pubmed23n0021_11550", "pubmed23n0057_19863", "pubmed23n0046_18923", "pubmed23n0018_4149", "pubmed23n0020_2428", "pubmed23n0051_2900", "pubmed23n0049_21579", "pubmed23n0045_8350", "Surgery_Schwartz_5057", "pubmed23n0024_3282", "Surgery_Schwartz_5564", "pubmed23n0013_11341", "pubmed23n0021_11432", "pubmed23n0031_497", "InternalMed_Harrison_19337", "pubmed23n0022_5196", "pubmed23n0052_15912", "pubmed23n0052_4147", "pubmed23n0058_723", "pubmed23n0045_14253", "pubmed23n0015_600", "pubmed23n0063_17430", "InternalMed_Harrison_29979", "Pathology_Robbins_2573", "pubmed23n0060_228", "pubmed23n0049_16207", "pubmed23n0058_14891", "pubmed2