{"topic": "Depression", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a potential predictor of chronicity of depression in geriatric patients?", "options": {"A": "Short duration of the current or previous episodes", "B": "Long duration of the current or previous episodes", "C": "Low severity of depression", "D": "Absence of coexisting medical illness"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Chronicity of depression may be predicted by long duration of the current or previous episodes, coexisting medical illness, high severity of depression, nonmelancholic presentation, delusions, and perhaps cognitive impairment and neuroradiologic abnormalities.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0053_12173", "title": "Outcomes of geriatric depression", "span_text": "Chronicity of depression may be predicted by long duration of the current or previous episodes, coexisting medical illness, high severity of depression, nonmelancholic presentation, delusions, and perhaps cognitive impairment and neuroradiologic abnormalities."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_12173", "pubmed23n0048_7202", "pubmed23n0057_20397", "pubmed23n0051_10905", "Obstentrics_Williams_8517", "pubmed23n0050_11132", "pubmed23n0043_15270", "pubmed23n0055_21906", "pubmed23n0045_9791", "pubmed23n0048_164", "pubmed23n0061_16151", "pubmed23n0024_10346", "pubmed23n0053_6687", "Surgery_Schwartz_13787", "pubmed23n0058_7275", "Obstentrics_Williams_8496"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_12173", "pubmed23n0048_7202", "pubmed23n0057_20397", "pubmed23n0051_10905", "Obstentrics_Williams_8517", "pubmed23n0050_11132", "pubmed23n0043_15270", "pubmed23n0055_21906", "pubmed23n0045_9791", "pubmed23n0048_164", "pubmed23n0061_16151", "pubmed23n0024_10346", "pubmed23n0053_6687", "Surgery_Schwartz_13787", "pubmed23n0058_7275", "Obstentrics_Williams_8496"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "n