{"topic": "Chronic pain", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "What is a key component of a comprehensive approach to managing cancer pain?", "options": {"A": "Addressing psychosocial issues", "B": "Using only opioid therapy", "C": "Focusing solely on the origin and cause of the pain", "D": "Ignoring the patient's quality of life"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "A comprehensive approach to managing cancer pain requires careful assessment of the origin and cause of the pain, as well as addressing psychosocial issues.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0045_20584", "title": "Pharmacological management of cancer pain", "span_text": "A comprehensive approach must also address psychosocial issues. A successful pharmacotherapy programme for cancer pain requires careful assessment of the origin and cause of the pain."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_2200", "First_Aid_Step2_1063", "pubmed23n0045_20584", "pubmed23n0014_2698", "pubmed23n0050_17342", "Gynecology_Novak_2502", "pubmed23n0050_17341", "pubmed23n0031_4281", "pubmed23n0060_3302", "InternalMed_Harrison_25237", "Surgery_Schwartz_13529", "pubmed23n0060_13879", "pubmed23n0022_2751", "Obstentrics_Williams_8258", "pubmed23n0060_260", "Surgery_Schwartz_8684", "pubmed23n0057_17763", "pubmed23n0056_7311", "Gynecology_Novak_3798", "pubmed23n0063_22274", "pubmed23n0004_9746", "pubmed23n0027_11294", "pubmed23n0060_10873", "pubmed23n0045_6108", "pubmed23n0051_15077", "pubmed23n0050_16161", "pubmed23n0056_3208", "pubmed23n0021_7295", "pubmed23n0052_18176", "pubmed23n0056_7129", "pubmed23n0049_3730", "pubmed23n0060_270", "pubmed23n0026_6441", "pubmed23n0044_9426", "pubmed23n0049_6499", "pubmed23n0056_1175", "Gynecology_Novak_2474", "pubmed23n0007_15420", "pubmed23n0050_18389", "pubmed23n0046_19458", "InternalMed_Harrison_10479", "pubmed23n0029_7802", "pubmed23n0019_13460", "pubmed23n0058_19511", "InternalMed_Harrison_24436", "Surgery_Schwartz_4220", "G