{"topic": "Malaria", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the significance of cytokine storm in severe falciparum malaria?", "options": {"A": "It is a minor complication with no significant impact on mortality", "B": "It plays an important role in the high mortality of severe falciparum malaria", "C": "It is a rare occurrence in severe falciparum malaria", "D": "It is not related to the severity of malaria"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Cytokine storm is a critical factor in the high mortality of severe falciparum malaria, as it can lead to multiple organ dysfunction syndrome (MODS).", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41552719", "title": "The blood purification therapy-based strategy effectively rescued the severe falciparum malaria patient experiencing cytokine storm-driven MODS", "span_text": "The mortality of severe falciparum malaria is high, in which cytokine storm (CS) plays an important role, and the standard effective therapy strategy remains unclear."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"search_terms": ["severe falciparum malaria", "cytokine storm", "mortality"], "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41573781", "pubmed_web_41572877", "pubmed_web_41552719", "pubmed_web_41549418", "pubmed_web_41487781", "pubmed_web_41471157", "pubmed_web_41466407", "pubmed_web_41456598", "pubmed_web_41423666", "pubmed_web_41415126", "pubmed_web_41413459", "pubmed_web_41401174", "pubmed_web_41359641", "pubmed_web_41328670", "pubmed_web_41327422", "pubmed_web_41307909", "pubmed_web_41298347", "pubmed_web_41291512", "pubmed_web_41289888", "pubmed_web_41277377"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41573781", "pubmed_web_41572877", "pubmed_web_41552719", "pubmed_web_41549418", "pubmed_web_41487781", "pubmed_web_41471157", "pubmed_web_41466407", "pubmed_web_41456598", "pubmed_web_41423666", "pubmed_web_41415126", "pubmed_web_41413459", "pubmed_web_41401174", "pubmed_web_41359641", "pubmed_web_41328670", "pubmed_web_41327422", "pubmed_web_41307909", "p