{"topic": "Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the primary goal of screening for chronic obstructive pulmonary disease in asymptomatic individuals?", "options": {"A": "To identify individuals with elevated serum cholesterol", "B": "To detect preclinical disease and prevent progression", "C": "To screen for biochemical markers of chronic conditions", "D": "To refer patients to an ophthalmologist for further evaluation"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The primary goal of screening for chronic obstructive pulmonary disease in asymptomatic individuals is to detect preclinical disease and prevent progression, which can be achieved through early identification and management of risk factors.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0063_20496", "title": "Guidelines for community-based screening for chronic health conditions", "span_text": "Preventive measures for many chronic diseases depend upon identification of asymptomatic individuals who have the disease or who may be at risk for developing it."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0063_20496", "pubmed23n0057_6081", "pubmed23n0052_7287", "pubmed23n0044_24565", "pubmed23n0021_8317", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0059_1765", "InternalMed_Harrison_315", "InternalMed_Harrison_5976", "pubmed23n0016_5876", "pubmed23n0058_3064", "pubmed23n0053_11610", "pubmed23n0045_19421", "InternalMed_Harrison_5978", "pubmed23n0028_12412", "pubmed23n0002_12168", "InternalMed_Harrison_5983", "pubmed23n0033_9269", "InternalMed_Harrison_294", "pubmed23n0028_2115", "pubmed23n0041_8966", "pubmed23n0053_5136", "pubmed23n0058_693", "pubmed23n0043_3127", "pubmed23n0055_19783", "InternalMed_Harrison_6708", "pubmed23n0059_18931", "InternalMed_Harrison_308", "Gynecology_Novak_713", "pubmed23n0028_11243", "pubmed23n0044_11098", "pubmed23n0053_19927", "pubmed23n0059_13871", "InternalMed_Harrison_19039", "InternalMed_Harrison_6706", "pu