{"topic": "Diabetes mellitus", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is a significant factor that influences the prognosis of patients with diabetes mellitus?", "options": {"A": "Frequent contact with a specialized diabetes clinic", "B": "High insulin dose", "C": "High body weight", "D": "Poor quality of metabolic control"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Frequent contact with a specialized diabetes clinic has been shown to have a significantly beneficial effect on the survival of patients with diabetes mellitus.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0022_12475", "title": "Prognosis of diabetics with diabetes onset before the age of thirty-one. II. Factors influencing the prognosis.", "span_text": "In 307 patients with diabetes mellitus, developed prior to 1933 and before age 31 it was demonstrated that: (1) frequent contact with a specialized diabetes clinic from an early stage of the disease; (2) a good quality of \"metabolic control\"; (3) a low insulin dose; (4) a body weight of 10% less than ideal; and (5) a mean blood pressure below 100 mm Hg, all had significantly beneficial effects upon the survival."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0021_6096", "pubmed23n0022_12475", "pubmed23n0048_21158", "pubmed23n0017_2386", "pubmed23n0061_9530", "Obstentrics_Williams_8026", "Surgery_Schwartz_7708", "Surgery_Schwartz_9951", "pubmed23n0062_3110", "pubmed23n0004_10883", "pubmed23n0026_11205", "pubmed23n0004_7282", "pubmed23n0053_3693", "pubmed23n0049_6412", "pubmed23n0062_2668", "pubmed23n0023_6940", "pubmed23n0060_409", "pubmed23n0024_874", "pubmed23n0045_8350", "pubmed23n0045_12647", "pubmed23n0053_12545", "pubmed23n0016_4975", "pubmed23n0032_6058", "pubmed23n0058_21354", "pubmed23n0043_15595", "Obstentrics_Williams_8008", "pubmed23n0033_10609", "pubmed23n0005_3284", "pubmed23n0061_903", "pubmed23n0028_9359", "Obstentrics_Williams_8021", "pubmed23n0052_19711", "pubmed23n0042_12962", "pubmed23n0027_7422"