{"topic": "Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease", "competency": "Monitoring", "stem": "What is a potential risk of using aminophylline to treat acute exacerbation of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease?", "options": {"A": "Triggering prolonged and difficult to control focal motor seizures with generalization", "B": "Causing a rapid decline in pulmonary function", "C": "Leading to an increase in blood pressure", "D": "Resulting in a decrease in heart rate"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Aminophylline therapy for acute exacerbation of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease may trigger prolonged and difficult to control focal motor seizures with generalization, especially in previously neurologically asymptomatic patients.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0027_3507", "title": "Focal seizures and aminophylline", "span_text": "Intravenous aminophylline therapy for acute exacerbation of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease may trigger prolonged and difficult to control focal motor seizures with generalization."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Obstentrics_Williams_6959", "pubmed23n0049_5754", "pubmed23n0027_3507", "pubmed23n0052_18729", "pubmed23n0044_6373", "pubmed23n0052_4583", "pubmed23n0047_7602", "pubmed23n0043_18199", "Obstentrics_Williams_6440", "pubmed23n0006_10003", "pubmed23n0052_7551", "pubmed23n0058_4011", "InternalMed_Harrison_337", "pubmed23n0062_3510", "pubmed23n0059_20688", "pubmed23n0052_21566", "pubmed23n0026_3378", "InternalMed_Harrison_11428", "pubmed23n0031_371", "pubmed23n0032_5167", "pubmed23n0058_18326", "pubmed23n0062_4408", "pubmed23n0029_4882", "pubmed23n0021_7947", "InternalMed_Harrison_13413", "pubmed23n0013_7730", "pubmed23n0059_575", "pubmed23n0062_205", "pubmed23n0001_3920", "pubmed23n0043_258", "pubmed23n0063_15337", "pubmed23n0058_4016", "pubmed23n0050_6798", "pubmed23n0058_6601", "pubmed23n0043_4462", "pubmed23n0004_10454", "pubmed23n0018_2", "pubmed23n0053_14029", "pubme