{"topic": "Schizophrenia", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the primary goal of treatment for patients with schizophrenia?", "options": {"A": "To suppress psychotic symptoms and prevent relapse", "B": "To improve social interactions and daily living skills", "C": "To reduce the risk of suicide and self-harm", "D": "To increase the patient's tolerance to medication"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The primary goal of treatment for patients with schizophrenia is to suppress psychotic symptoms, ameliorate the disorder of thinking and the apathetic state, prevent relapse, and optimize social adjustment.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Neurology_Adams_12314", "title": "Neurology_Adams", "span_text": "The aims of treatment are to suppress psychotic symptoms, ameliorate the disorder of thinking and the apathetic state, prevent relapse, and optimize social adjustment."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_3183", "pubmed23n0045_2866", "Neurology_Adams_12314", "pubmed23n0045_5937", "pubmed23n0056_7311", "pubmed23n0056_822", "pubmed23n0012_6170", "pubmed23n0001_14259", "pubmed23n0002_1370", "pubmed23n0045_3051", "pubmed23n0002_3716", "pubmed23n0056_821", "pubmed23n0001_438", "pubmed23n0049_18084", "pubmed23n0056_3770", "pubmed23n0002_2309", "pubmed23n0056_1432", "pubmed23n0056_3766", "pubmed23n0002_3536", "pubmed23n0001_13261", "pubmed23n0047_13492", "pubmed23n0061_12219", "pubmed23n0043_6413"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_3183", "pubmed23n0045_2866", "Neurology_Adams_12314", "pubmed23n0045_5937", "pubmed23n0056_7311", "pubmed23n0056_822", "pubmed23n0012_6170", "pubmed23n0001_14259", "pubmed23n0002_1370", "pubmed23n0045_3051", "pubmed23n0002_3716", "pubmed23n0056_821", "pubmed23n0001_438", "pubmed23n0049_18084", "pubmed23n0056_3770", "pubmed23n0002_2309", "pubmed23n0056_1432", "pubmed23n0056_3766", "pubmed23n0002_3536", "pubmed23n0001_13261"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"},