{"topic": "Asthma", "competency": "Investigation", "stem": "What is the role of diagnostic imaging in the evaluation of allergic disease, specifically in the context of asthma?", "options": {"A": "Diagnostic imaging has a limited role in the evaluation of allergic disease, but chest radiography is helpful in the differential diagnosis of asthma.", "B": "Diagnostic imaging is essential in the evaluation of allergic disease and is used as a primary diagnostic tool for asthma.", "C": "Diagnostic imaging is only used to evaluate non-allergic diseases and has no role in the diagnosis of asthma.", "D": "Diagnostic imaging is used to distinguish between allergic and non-allergic diseases, including asthma."}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Diagnostic imaging has a limited role in the evaluation of allergic disease, but chest radiography can be helpful in the differential diagnosis of asthma. Sinus radiography and computed tomography may also be useful, but abnormal results do not distinguish between allergic and non-allergic disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pediatrics_Nelson_1753", "title": "Pediatrics_Nelson", "span_text": "Diagnostic imaging has a limited role in the evaluation of allergic disease. Chest radiography is helpful with the differential diagnosis of asthma. Sinus radiography and computed tomography may be useful, but when these images are abnormal, they do not distinguish allergic disease from nonallergic disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pediatrics_Nelson_1753", "pubmed23n0043_5967", "pubmed23n0034_3594", "pubmed23n0051_20135", "pubmed23n0016_2380", "pubmed23n0038_3499"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pediatrics_Nelson_1753", "pubmed23n0043_5967", "pubmed23n0034_3594", "pubmed23n0051_20135", "pubmed23n0016_2380", "pubmed23n0038_3499"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "r