{"topic": "Anxiety disorder", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary goal of secondary prevention in the context of anxiety disorders in college students?", "options": {"A": "To reduce test anxiety through cognitive modification and anxiety management training", "B": "To identify and treat test anxiety early in the academic career", "C": "To promote self-care in chronic diseases and acute conditions", "D": "To adapt the training of professionals to the priorities in primary health care problems"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Secondary prevention aims to identify and treat problems early, and in the context of anxiety disorders in college students, this means identifying and treating test anxiety early in the academic career.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0017_11695", "title": "Evaluation of two test-anxiety reduction treatments in a secondary prevention program", "span_text": "The study evaluated the effectiveness of both a new anxiety management training program and a cognitive modification procedure as part of a secondary prevention effort to identify and treat test anxiety early in the academic career of college students."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0017_11695", "pubmed23n0053_17329", "InternalMed_Harrison_5041", "pubmed23n0051_18347", "pubmed23n0063_6707", "pubmed23n0006_994", "pubmed23n0059_18940", "pubmed23n0018_7158", "InternalMed_Harrison_4827"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0017_11695", "pubmed23n0053_17329", "InternalMed_Harrison_5041", "pubmed23n0051_18347", "pubmed23n0063_6707", "pubmed23n0006_994", "pubmed23n0059_18940", "pubmed23n0018_7158", "InternalMed_Harrison_4827"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Anxiety disorder Prevention prevention prophylaxis risk reduction screening vaccination primary 