{"topic": "Hepatitis B", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary method of preventing perinatal transmission of hepatitis B virus?", "options": {"A": "Hepatitis B immune globulin at birth and hepatitis B vaccine at birth and ages 1 and 6 months", "B": "Hepatitis B vaccine at birth and ages 1 and 6 months only", "C": "Hepatitis B immune globulin at birth only", "D": "No prophylaxis"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The primary method of preventing perinatal transmission of hepatitis B virus is through the administration of hepatitis B immune globulin at birth and hepatitis B vaccine at birth and ages 1 and 6 months.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0050_2282", "title": "Prevention of perinatal transmission of the hepatitis B virus", "span_text": "Prenatal testing of women and immunoprophylaxis of infants with hepatitis B immune globulin at birth and hepatitis B vaccine at birth and ages 1 and 6 months."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0055_9924", "pubmed23n0011_8022", "pubmed23n0055_3924", "pubmed23n0050_2282", "pubmed23n0061_3727", "pubmed23n0044_19424", "pubmed23n0055_13427", "pubmed23n0043_1189", "pubmed23n0051_1197", "pubmed23n0043_8175", "Surgery_Schwartz_1283", "pubmed23n0043_11737", "pubmed23n0044_1828", "pubmed23n0061_593", "pubmed23n0061_9105", "Obstentrics_Williams_2408", "pubmed23n0049_5390", "pubmed23n0055_21130", "pubmed23n0041_8099", "pubmed23n0061_8255", "InternalMed_Harrison_23589", "pubmed23n0046_4404", "pubmed23n0002_9116", "pubmed23n0062_3059", "InternalMed_Harrison_10885", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3319", "pubmed23n0063_434", "pubmed23n0007_4002", "pubmed23n0052_13356", "pubmed23n0005_9152"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0055_9924", "pubmed23n0011_8022", "pubmed23n0055_3924", "pubmed23n0050_2282", "pubmed23n0061_3727", "pubmed23n0044_19424", "pubmed23n0055_13427", "pubmed23n0043_1189", "pubmed23n0051_1197"