{"topic": "Pregnancy", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the prognosis for women with systemic lupus erythematosus who have had a previous adverse pregnancy outcome?", "options": {"A": "They have at least a 50% chance of another adverse outcome in their next pregnancy", "B": "They have less than a 20% chance of another adverse outcome in their next pregnancy", "C": "Their risk of another adverse outcome is not increased", "D": "They are not at risk for any adverse outcomes in their next pregnancy"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Women with systemic lupus erythematosus who have had a previous adverse pregnancy outcome are at increased risk for another adverse outcome in their next pregnancy, with at least a 50% chance of recurrence.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0043_1775", "title": "Previous pregnancy outcome is an important determinant of subsequent pregnancy outcome in women with systemic lupus erythematosus", "span_text": "Both cases and controls with an adverse outcome in their first pregnancy had at least a 50% chance of another adverse outcome in their second pregnancy."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"source": "pubmed", "query": "systemic lupus erythematosus pregnancy prognosis", "doc_ids": ["Obstentrics_Williams_7330", "pubmed23n0014_9879", "pubmed23n0043_1775", "Obstentrics_Williams_8283", "Obstentrics_Williams_8693", "Obstentrics_Williams_6863", "Obstentrics_Williams_1010", "pubmed23n0043_1776", "InternalMed_Harrison_7578", "pubmed23n0059_9002", "Obstentrics_Williams_7067", "Obstentrics_Williams_7600", "Obstentrics_Williams_8423", "Obstentrics_Williams_6850", "Obstentrics_Williams_7064", "pubmed23n0052_3180", "Obstentrics_Williams_7545", "Obstentrics_Williams_8071", "Obstentrics_Williams_7738", "pubmed23n0009_1694", "Obstentrics_Williams_6524", "Obstentrics_Williams_8118", "Obstentrics_Williams_7396", "pubmed23n0055_404", "Obstentrics_Williams_7112", "pubmed23n0050_505", "pubmed23n0032_11816", "Obstentric