{"topic": "Systemic lupus erythematosus", "competency": "Etiology", "stem": "What factors are thought to contribute to the development of systemic lupus erythematosus?", "options": {"A": "Genetic and environmental factors", "B": "Only genetic factors", "C": "Only environmental factors", "D": "Neither genetic nor environmental factors"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Systemic lupus erythematosus is a complex disease that is thought to result from the interaction of genetic and environmental factors.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0043_12743", "title": "Autoimmunity, polyclonal B-cell activation and infection", "span_text": "It is widely believed that autoimmunity is an integral part of the immune system, and that genetic, immunologic, hormonal, environmental and other factors contribute to the pathogenesis of autoimmune disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0048_17127", "pubmed23n0006_11094", "pubmed23n0043_12743", "pubmed23n0053_6067", "pubmed23n0037_12214", "pubmed23n0045_8466", "pubmed23n0062_20734", "pubmed23n0016_1500", "pubmed23n0058_12472", "InternalMed_Harrison_22850", "pubmed23n0023_896", "pubmed23n0002_7034", "pubmed23n0062_18362", "pubmed23n0011_12906", "pubmed23n0035_5483", "pubmed23n0043_12742", "pubmed23n0044_6552", "pubmed23n0051_12218", "pubmed23n0010_9024", "pubmed23n0049_2079", "pubmed23n0063_19378", "pubmed23n0057_18328", "InternalMed_Harrison_29123", "pubmed23n0049_1606", "pubmed23n0052_1357", "pubmed23n0036_10937", "Psichiatry_DSM-5_759", "pubmed23n0055_13141", "pubmed23n0013_4883", "Obstentrics_Williams_7322", "Obstentrics_Williams_8344", "pubmed23n0004_496", "pubmed23n0053_5646", "pubmed23n0052_20673", "pubmed23n0050_605", "pubmed23n0049_1007", "pubmed23n0060_8947", "pubmed23n0037_4605", "pubmed23n0039_9968", "pubmed23n0047_11192", "pubmed23n0041_815", "Obstentrics_Williams_8321", "pubmed23n0043_11188", "pubmed23n0029_10038", "pubmed23n0005_11512", "pubmed23n0023_100