{"topic": "Prostate cancer", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is the primary medical therapy for prostate cancer?", "options": {"A": "Androgen deprivation therapy", "B": "Saw palmetto therapy", "C": "Vinblastine therapy", "D": "Mitoxantrone therapy"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Androgen deprivation therapy is the primary medical therapy for prostate cancer, which involves reducing serum testosterone concentrations and effects.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_4182", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "Prostate cancer\u2014Androgen deprivation therapy is the primary medical therapy for prostate cancer. Combined antiandrogen therapy with continuous GnRH agonist and an androgen receptor antagonist is as effective as surgical castration in reducing serum testosterone concentrations and effects."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0051_6937", "Pharmacology_Katzung_108", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2398", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7144", "pubmed23n0054_5472", "pubmed23n0008_957", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4192", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7143", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5941", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3499", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4182", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5963", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3959", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6179", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5945", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7085", "Pharmacology_Katzung_422", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3997"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0051_6937", "Pharmacology_Katzung_108", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2398", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7144", "pubmed23n0054_5472", "pubmed23n0008_957", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4192", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7143", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5941", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3499", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4182", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5963", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3959", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6179", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5945", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7085", "Pharmacology_Katzung_422", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3997"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verific