{"topic": "Prostate cancer", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a common local complication after definitive radiotherapy for prostatic adenocarcinoma?", "options": {"A": "Urethral stricture", "B": "Prostatic obstruction", "C": "Hematuria", "D": "All of the above"}, "answer_key": "D", "explanation": "Local complications after radiotherapy included urethral stricture, prostatic obstruction, hematuria, radiation cystitis, ureteral obstruction, and rectosigmoid radiation injury.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0051_11328", "title": "Late local complications after definitive radiotherapy for prostatic adenocarcinoma", "span_text": "Local complications after radiotherapy included urethral stricture (10 cases), prostatic obstruction (8), hematuria (4), radiation cystitis (3), ureteral obstruction (2) and rectosigmoid radiation injury (4)."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0051_11328", "pubmed23n0053_17697", "pubmed23n0057_23932", "pubmed23n0045_18891", "pubmed23n0063_8506", "InternalMed_Harrison_7393", "pubmed23n0057_15714", "Gynecology_Novak_1183", "pubmed23n0048_18483", "pubmed23n0046_3326", "pubmed23n0060_20490", "pubmed23n0047_2331", "pubmed23n0030_11320", "pubmed23n0063_19843", "pubmed23n0051_1842", "pubmed23n0054_19712", "pubmed23n0045_19297", "InternalMed_Harrison_7915", "pubmed23n0055_6430", "InternalMed_Harrison_27451", "Gynecology_Novak_6994", "pubmed23n0028_11144", "pubmed23n0040_6194", "pubmed23n0063_14659", "pubmed23n0045_17658", "pubmed23n0048_18812", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "pubmed23n0056_13372", "pubmed23n0063_18568", "pubmed23n0053_6407", "pubmed23n0052_8663", "Pathology_Robbins_1083", "pubmed23n0060_4215", "InternalMed_Harrison_32036", "InternalMed_Harrison_27405", "pubmed23n0056_12567", "pubmed23n0043_4326", "pubmed23n0051_6928", "pubmed23n0057_23309", "pubmed23n0053_16521", "pubmed23n0063_11459", "pubmed23n0059_2218", "pubmed23n0056_16147", "Surgery_Schwartz_10401", "