{"topic": "Anemia", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is a potential adverse effect of sulfasalazine?", "options": {"A": "Hemolytic anemia", "B": "Aplastic anemia", "C": "Megaloblastic anemia", "D": "Sickle cell anemia"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Sulfasalazine has a high incidence of adverse effects, most of which are attributable to systemic effects of the sulfapyridine molecule. Hypersensitivity to sulfapyridine can result in fever, exfoliative dermatitis, pancreatitis, pneumonitis, hemolytic anemia, pericarditis, or hepatitis.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_6954", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "Hypersensitivity to sulfapyridine (or, rarely, 5-ASA) can result in fever, exfoliative dermatitis, pancreatitis, pneumonitis, hemolytic anemia, pericarditis, or hepatitis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_1043", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4010", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5368", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6173", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5928", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2504", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6954", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5765", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6212", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4002", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2547", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3084", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5191"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_1043", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4010", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5368", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6173", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5928", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2504", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6954", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5765", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6212", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4002", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2547", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3084", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5191"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Anemia Pharmacology pharmacology drug mechanism indicat