{"topic": "Smoking cessation", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the effect of smoking cessation on the risk of death in older adults?", "options": {"A": "Reduced risk of death within 1 to 2 years after quitting", "B": "Increased risk of death within 1 to 2 years after quitting", "C": "No effect on the risk of death", "D": "Unknown effect on the risk of death"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Smoking cessation in older adults reduces the risk of death compared with current smokers within 1 to 2 years after quitting.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0052_16686", "title": "Older adults and smoking", "span_text": "Older smokers who quit have a reduced risk of death compared with current smokers within 1 to 2 years after quitting. Their overall risk of death approaches that of those who never smoked after 15 to 20 years of abstinence."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0052_16686", "pubmed23n0043_3917", "pubmed23n0036_3361", "pubmed23n0063_4814", "pubmed23n0029_8807", "InternalMed_Harrison_6678", "pubmed23n0028_9430", "Biochemistry_Lippincott_1832", "pubmed23n0062_4312", "pubmed23n0045_18193", "pubmed23n0057_21938", "pubmed23n0058_3068", "pubmed23n0045_457", "pubmed23n0051_21851", "InternalMed_Harrison_19132", "pubmed23n0011_907", "pubmed23n0053_8975", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "Obstentrics_Williams_1069", "InternalMed_Harrison_19633", "pubmed23n0012_6870", "pubmed23n0029_10584", "Gynecology_Novak_3806"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0052_16686", "pubmed23n0043_3917", "pubmed23n0036_3361", "pubmed23n0063_4814", "pubmed23n0029_8807", "InternalMed_Harrison_6678", "pubmed23n0028_9430", "Biochemistry_Lippincott_1832", "pubmed23n0062_4312", "pubmed23n0045_18193", "pubmed23n0057_21938", "pubmed23n0058_3068", "pubmed23n0045_457", "pubmed23n0051_21851", "InternalMed_Harrison_19132", "pubmed23n0011_907", "pubmed23n0053_8975", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "Obstentrics_Williams_1069", "InternalMed