{"topic": "Malnutrition", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "What is a common, yet often overlooked problem in geriatric patients that can lead to severe complications if left untreated?", "options": {"A": "Protein-energy malnutrition", "B": "Dehydration", "C": "Chronic pain", "D": "Depression"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Protein-energy malnutrition is a frequent problem in geriatric patients that can lead to severe complications if left untreated, highlighting the need for a systematic strategy to identify signs, symptoms, and risk factors of malnutrition.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0063_18266", "title": "Malnutrition in old age: the importance of multi-dimensional evaluation", "span_text": "Protein-energy malnutrition is a frequent, but often overlooked problem in geriatric patients."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0063_18266"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0063_18266"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "manual review", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Malnutrition Diagnosis diagnosis differential diagnosis signs symptoms screening clinical features presentation diagnostic criteria workup evaluation diagnostic test laboratory findings imaging", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 7669.576708984096, "llm_ms": 2169.5827079820447, "verification_ms": 908.5566249559633, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 1, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FAILED_VERIFICATION": 0}, "failed_checks": [], "failed_checks_all": [], "evidence_doc_ids_used": ["pubmed23n0063_18266"], "evidence_reused": false}]}, "timings_ms": {"retrieval": 100.0, "verification": 200.0, "llm": 2169.5827079820447}}}
{"topic": "Acne", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "What is the first-line endocrine treatment for hirsutism and acne after cosmetic and dermatologic management?", "options": {"A": "Combination estrogen-progestin therapy in the form of an oral contraceptive", "B": "Retinoic acid therapy", "C": "Tetracycline regimen", "D": "Isotretinoin therapy"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Combination estrogen-progestin therapy is usually the first-line endocrine treatment for hirsutism and acne, after cosmetic and dermatologic management, as it suppresses LH, reduces production of ovarian androgens, and has a direct, dose-dependent suppressive effect on sebaceous cell function.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_3884", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Combination estrogen-progestin therapy in the form of an oral contraceptive is usually the first-line endocrine treatment for hirsutism and acne, after cosmetic and dermatologic management."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 10, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_3884", "pubmed23n0005_8457", "pubmed23n0061_6834", "pubmed23n0006_244", "pubmed23n0005_6855", "pubmed23n0005_3370"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_3884", "pubmed23n0005_8457", "pubmed23n0061_6834", "pubmed23n0006_244", "pubmed23n0005_6855", "pubmed23n0005_3370"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 5, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Acne Therapy therapy treatment management drug dosage medication pharmacotherapy first-line second-line guideline intervention acute management long-term management", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 15126.854290952906, "llm_ms": 1859.0591659885831, "verification_ms": 961.2632499774918, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_m