{"topic": "Myocardial infarction", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the most powerful predictor of cardiac mortality after recovery from myocardial infarction?", "options": {"A": "Left ventricular end-systolic volume", "B": "Ejection fraction", "C": "End-diastolic volume", "D": "Myocardial score"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Left ventricular end-systolic volume is the most powerful predictor of cardiac mortality after recovery from myocardial infarction.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0043_3917", "title": "Prognosis after recovery from myocardial infarction: the relative importance of cardiac dilatation and coronary stenoses", "span_text": "Left ventricular end-systolic volume was the most powerful predictor of cardiac mortality; ejection fraction and end-diastolic volume added no further information."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_17698", "pubmed23n0043_3917", "pubmed23n0038_4721", "pubmed23n0037_7495", "pubmed23n0053_7061", "pubmed23n0063_5228", "pubmed23n0036_3361", "pubmed23n0051_29", "pubmed23n0057_20631", "pubmed23n0056_6322", "pubmed23n0010_5455", "pubmed23n0004_12343", "pubmed23n0021_11023", "pubmed23n0054_7544", "pubmed23n0051_4975", "pubmed23n0013_11341", "pubmed23n0046_18923", "pubmed23n0048_156", "pubmed23n0023_10674", "pubmed23n0022_5196", "pubmed23n0002_7267", "pubmed23n0008_4279", "pubmed23n0051_21851", "pubmed23n0057_21938", "pubmed23n0018_610", "pubmed23n0049_586", "pubmed23n0031_497", "pubmed23n0027_15054", "pubmed23n0048_14066", "Surgery_Schwartz_7708", "pubmed23n0009_332", "pubmed23n0033_1013", "pubmed23n0015_10350", "pubmed23n0062_3549", "pubmed23n0017_5566", "pubmed23n0020_2427", "pubmed23n0053_9219", "pubmed23n0062_12627", "pubmed23n0063_8187", "pubmed23n0047_7694", "pubmed23n0058_3067", "pubmed23n0031_9032", "pubmed23n0041_10756", "pubmed23n0063_502", "pubmed23n0022_9337", "pubmed23n0052_17072", "pubmed23n0028_9430", "pubmed23n0018_9613", "pubmed23