{"topic": "Typhoid fever", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the prognostic significance of lymphocyte adenosine deaminase activity in patients with typhoid fever?", "options": {"A": "It is of no prognostic significance", "B": "It can predict the severity of the disease", "C": "It is only useful in diagnosing typhoid fever", "D": "It is used to monitor treatment response"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Lymphocyte adenosine deaminase activity can be used to predict the prognosis and severity of typhoid fever, with a cut-off value of 24 mU/10(6) cells suggested to predict prognosis and severity of disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0047_3870", "title": "Lymphocytic adenosine deaminase activity in typhoid fevers", "span_text": "Serial L-ADA activity can be of prognostic significance. A cut-off value of 24 mU/10(6) cells is suggested to predict prognosis and severity of disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0047_3870", "pubmed23n0007_16091", "pubmed23n0027_15167", "pubmed23n0022_2409", "pubmed23n0059_8586", "pubmed23n0046_18230", "pubmed23n0001_14221", "pubmed23n0060_2762"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0047_3870", "pubmed23n0007_16091", "pubmed23n0027_15167", "pubmed23n0022_2409", "pubmed23n0059_8586", "pubmed23n0046_18230", "pubmed23n0001_14221", "pubmed23n0060_2762"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Typhoid fever Prognosis prognosis outcomes mortality survival complications disease course recurrence risk stratification severity long-term outcomes quality of life predictors", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 63224.00704101892, "llm_ms": 1313.7596669839695, "verification_ms": 979.8079999745823, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"a