{"topic": "Acute kidney injury", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary goal in the management of patients after an acute episode of a disease has resolved?", "options": {"A": "Ensure long-term clinical follow-up and adherence to a regimen of secondary prophylaxis", "B": "Focus on primary prevention of the disease", "C": "Provide optimal care for the acute episode", "D": "Reduce the risk of cardiovascular disease"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The primary goal in the management of patients after an acute episode of a disease has resolved is to ensure long-term clinical follow-up and adherence to a regimen of secondary prophylaxis.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Once the acute episode has resolved, the priority in management is to ensure long-term clinical follow-up and adherence to a regimen of secondary prophylaxis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_4197", "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "pubmed23n0052_5362", "pubmed23n0062_3896", "pubmed23n0063_18617", "pubmed23n0053_4635", "pubmed23n0048_2567", "pubmed23n0050_11692", "pubmed23n0052_16683", "pubmed23n0048_3940", "pubmed23n0050_11695", "pubmed23n0044_15670", "pubmed23n0055_17797", "pubmed23n0054_3698", "pubmed23n0053_18358", "pubmed23n0058_9309", "pubmed23n0024_8726", "pubmed23n0058_20511", "pubmed23n0063_11435", "pubmed23n0063_6707", "Pediatrics_Nelson_224", "pubmed23n0043_11359", "pubmed23n0048_4307", "pubmed23n0052_18745", "pubmed23n0049_14983", "pubmed23n0051_13965", "pubmed23n0053_9441", "pubmed23n0061_13101", "pubmed23n0050_9373"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_4197", "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "pubmed23n0052_5362", "pubmed23n0062_3896", "pubmed23n0063_18617", "pubmed23n0053_4635", "pubmed23n0048_2567", "pubmed23n0050_11692", "pubmed23n0052_16683", "pubmed23n0048_3940", "pubmed23n0050_11695",