{"topic": "Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is the primary method of preventing chronic obstructive pulmonary disease?", "options": {"A": "Avoiding tobacco smoking", "B": "Regular exercise and a healthy diet", "C": "Getting vaccinated against respiratory infections", "D": "Using air purifiers in the home"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Avoiding tobacco smoking is the most effective way to prevent chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, as it is the primary cause of the disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0016_1289", "title": "[Chronic diseases of the respiratory tract (proceedings)]", "span_text": "The combat against tobacco smoking (primary prevention) and long-term treatment of the chronic obstructive bronchitis (tertiary prevention) stand in the foreground of the measures."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_19033", "pubmed23n0014_766", "pubmed23n0059_18944", "pubmed23n0061_8664", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0061_20690", "InternalMed_Harrison_294", "pubmed23n0060_4515", "pubmed23n0016_1289", "pubmed23n0055_13775", "pubmed23n0055_13768", "pubmed23n0049_3300", "pubmed23n0054_3559", "pubmed23n0063_11753", "pubmed23n0048_17336", "pubmed23n0011_8274", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "pubmed23n0024_2414", "pubmed23n0054_9105", "pubmed23n0054_4200", "Gynecology_Novak_839", "pubmed23n0053_8313", "pubmed23n0055_21781", "pubmed23n0049_8703", "pubmed23n0062_15316", "pubmed23n0050_7903", "InternalMed_Harrison_17264", "pubmed23n0058_1366", "pubmed23n0052_5362", "pubmed23n0061_8532", "pubmed23n0044_2780", "pubmed23n0022_6533", "Surgery_Schwartz_5388", "InternalMed_Harrison_322", "pubmed23n0057_2100", "pubmed23n0063_3886", "pubmed23n0045_15534", "pubmed23n0024_1190", "pubmed23n0047_18271", "pubmed23n0025_2073", "Obstentrics_Williams_9092", "InternalMed_Harrison_11663", "InternalMed_Harrison_4907"