{"topic": "Chronic kidney disease", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is a key component in the prevention of chronic diseases, including chronic kidney disease, in a clinical setting?", "options": {"A": "Regular screening and risk assessment", "B": "Only treating symptoms as they arise", "C": "Focusing solely on disease management after diagnosis", "D": "Ignoring lifestyle factors"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Prevention of chronic diseases, including chronic kidney disease, involves early detection and management of risk factors. Regular screening and risk assessment are crucial for identifying individuals at high risk and implementing preventive measures.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0061_8664", "title": "[Automated system of mass examination of the working population]", "span_text": "The system is designed for the use at polyclinics, health units and health centres. The following programmes are provided: premedical screening, ECG data interpretation, analysis of physician's data and management of follow-up, primary and secondary prevention of chronic diseases."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "database search", "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_19033", "pubmed23n0014_766", "pubmed23n0061_8664", "pubmed23n0059_18944", "pubmed23n0061_20690", "InternalMed_Harrison_10756", "pubmed23n0055_13775", "pubmed23n0055_13768", "pubmed23n0060_4515", "pubmed23n0054_3559", "pubmed23n0049_3300", "InternalMed_Harrison_294", "pubmed23n0063_11753", "pubmed23n0048_17336", "pubmed23n0024_2414", "pubmed23n0011_8274", "Gynecology_Novak_839", "pubmed23n0054_4200", "pubmed23n0057_19176", "InternalMed_Harrison_25306", "pubmed23n0050_7903", "pubmed23n0053_8313", "pubmed23n0054_9105", "pubmed23n0055_21781", "InternalMed_Harrison_17264", "pubmed23n0022_6533", "pubmed23n0058_1366", "pubmed23n0049_8703", "pubmed23n0057_2100", "pubmed23n0052_5362", "pubmed23n0061_8532", "Surgery_Schwartz_5388", "InternalMed_Harrison_4907", "pubmed23