{"topic": "Atrial fibrillation", "competency": "Monitoring", "stem": "What method is commonly used to evaluate the effects of class III antiarrhythmic agents in patients with atrial fibrillation?", "options": {"A": "Holter monitoring", "B": "Electrocardiogram", "C": "Echocardiogram", "D": "Cardiac catheterization"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Holter monitoring is a reliable method for evaluating the effects of class III antiarrhythmic agents in patients with atrial fibrillation.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0042_11840", "title": "Therapy with and assessment of class III antiarrhythmic agents in different patient populations", "span_text": "Both Holter monitoring and electrophysiologic studies appear to constitute reliable methods for evaluating the effects of class III agents and the long-term outcome in patients with a history of sustained ventricular tachycardia or fibrillation."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "database search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0042_11840", "pubmed23n0050_11440", "pubmed23n0063_20466", "pubmed23n0029_4090", "pubmed23n0058_4016", "pubmed23n0006_878", "pubmed23n0056_16377", "pubmed23n0015_12648", "pubmed23n0028_13613", "pubmed23n0058_3479", "pubmed23n0049_3238", "pubmed23n0039_8679", "pubmed23n0021_8569", "First_Aid_Step1_476", "First_Aid_Step1_472", "pubmed23n0024_7521", "pubmed23n0042_12029", "First_Aid_Step1_338", "pubmed23n0015_10967", "Neurology_Adams_6161", "pubmed23n0056_15997", "pubmed23n0058_16222", "pubmed23n0053_10557", "pubmed23n0052_6217", "pubmed23n0056_16373", "pubmed23n0043_17127", "pubmed23n0063_20490", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1438", "pubmed23n0054_19712", "pubmed23n0029_2354", "Surgery_Schwartz_778", "pubmed23n0046_2555", "pubmed23n0025_3349", "pubmed23n0053_1836", "pubmed23n0036_10099", "pubmed23n0015_2463", "InternalMed_Harrison_563", "pubmed23n0050_21496", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4316", "pubmed23n0013_3597", "pubmed23n0045_2040", "Surgery_Schwartz_5714", "pubmed23n0056_23