{"topic": "Allergic rhinitis", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "What is the most useful diagnostic tool for distinguishing allergic rhinitis from other causes of rhinorrhea in children?", "options": {"A": "Nasal smear for eosinophils", "B": "Chest radiography", "C": "Sinus radiography", "D": "Computed tomography"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "A nasal smear for eosinophils can help diagnose allergic rhinitis by identifying the presence of eosinophils in the nasal discharge, which is a characteristic feature of allergic rhinitis.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pediatrics_Nelson_2245", "title": "Pediatrics_Nelson", "span_text": "A nasal smear for eosinophils may be useful in the evaluation for allergic rhinitis (see Chapter 79)."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pediatrics_Nelson_1753", "pubmed23n0062_5386", "pubmed23n0046_3266", "InternalMed_Harrison_20239", "Pediatrics_Nelson_2245", "pubmed23n0050_11428", "pubmed23n0051_17043", "pubmed23n0022_2139", "pubmed23n0054_1181", "pubmed23n0058_21098", "pubmed23n0034_3594", "pubmed23n0039_6674", "pubmed23n0034_6663", "pubmed23n0014_6992", "pubmed23n0006_1230", "pubmed23n0033_941", "pubmed23n0059_2455", "pubmed23n0054_17200", "pubmed23n0050_9213", "pubmed23n0059_16726", "pubmed23n0005_3643", "pubmed23n0032_4201"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pediatrics_Nelson_1753", "pubmed23n0062_5386", "pubmed23n0046_3266", "InternalMed_Harrison_20239", "Pediatrics_Nelson_2245", "pubmed23n0050_11428", "pubmed23n0051_17043", "pubmed23n0022_2139", "pubmed23n0054_1181", "pubmed23n0058_21098", "pubmed23n0034_3594", "pubmed23n0039_6674", "pubmed23n0034_6663", "pubmed23n0014_6992", "pubmed23n0006_1230", "pubmed23n0033_941", "pubmed23n0059_2455", "pubmed23n0054_17200", "pubmed23n0050_9213", "pubmed23n0059_16726"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "