{"topic": "Neonatal sepsis", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the primary goal of neonatal screening for disorders such as sepsis?", "options": {"A": "To identify high-risk pregnancies", "B": "To detect and treat disorders before symptoms appear", "C": "To reduce the cost of healthcare for newborns", "D": "To educate parents about newborn care"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The primary goal of neonatal screening is to detect and treat disorders before symptoms appear, thereby preventing morbidity and mortality.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pediatrics_Nelson_1089", "title": "Pediatrics_Nelson", "span_text": "The purpose of neonatal screening is the early detection and rapid treatment of disorders before the onset of symptoms, thus preventing morbidity and mortality."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0002_11976", "pubmed23n0063_9813", "pubmed23n0002_12168", "pubmed23n0017_11766", "pubmed23n0010_1929", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1089", "pubmed23n0033_9269", "pubmed23n0063_12645", "pubmed23n0059_14302", "pubmed23n0016_13058", "pubmed23n0025_10220", "pubmed23n0063_9823", "pubmed23n0047_9261", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1090", "pubmed23n0058_16153", "pubmed23n0042_6437", "pubmed23n0013_7729", "pubmed23n0051_1193", "pubmed23n0054_19606", "pubmed23n0058_12084", "pubmed23n0048_5959", "pubmed23n0063_17369", "pubmed23n0046_17111", "pubmed23n0050_17651"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0002_11976", "pubmed23n0063_9813", "pubmed23n0002_12168", "pubmed23n0017_11766", "pubmed23n0010_1929", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1089", "pubmed23n0033_9269", "pubmed23n0063_12645", "pubmed23n0059_14302", "pubmed23n0016_13058", "pubmed23n0025_10220", "pubmed23n0063_9823", "pubmed23n0047_9261", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1090", "pubmed23n0058_16153", "pubmed23n0042_6437", "pubmed23n0013_7729", "pubmed23n0051_1193", "pubmed23n0054_19606", "pubmed23n0058_12084"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "expert re