{"topic": "Hypertension", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the recommended first-line therapy for hypertension unless contraindicated?", "options": {"A": "ACE inhibition", "B": "Beta-blockers", "C": "Diuretics", "D": "Calcium antagonists"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "ACE inhibition is the first-line therapy for hypertension unless contraindicated, as it has been shown to be effective in reducing blood pressure and preventing complications.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_22127", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Treatment with ACE inhibition is the first-line therapy unless contraindicated."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0059_20077", "pubmed23n0042_12959", "pubmed23n0022_11986", "pubmed23n0055_17212", "pubmed23n0045_14165", "InternalMed_Harrison_22127", "pubmed23n0024_4774", "pubmed23n0039_410", "pubmed23n0045_10082", "InternalMed_Harrison_25125", "pubmed23n0043_4967", "pubmed23n0049_16234", "pubmed23n0061_1343", "pubmed23n0045_6481", "pubmed23n0062_12872", "InternalMed_Harrison_18590", "pubmed23n0057_21089", "pubmed23n0063_19507", "pubmed23n0045_4850", "pubmed23n0044_2037", "InternalMed_Harrison_21652", "pubmed23n0049_12543", "pubmed23n0001_4834", "pubmed23n0056_4389", "pubmed23n0057_21036", "pubmed23n0056_790", "pubmed23n0045_13186", "pubmed23n0001_15133", "pubmed23n0012_10787", "pubmed23n0057_14531", "pubmed23n0063_13859", "pubmed23n0054_8923", "pubmed23n0059_14790", "pubmed23n0027_8024"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0059_20077", "pubmed23n0042_12959", "pubmed23n0022_11986", "pubmed23n0055_17212", "pubmed23n0045_14165", "InternalMed_Harrison_22127", "pubmed23n0024_4774", "pubmed23n0039_410", "pubmed23n0045_10082", "InternalMed_Harrison_25125", "pubmed23n0043_4967", "pubmed23n0049_16234", "pubmed23n0061_1343", "pubmed23n0045_6481", "pubmed23n0062_12872", "InternalMed_Harrison_18590", "pubmed23n0057_21089", "pubmed23n0063_19507", "p