{"topic": "Dermatitis", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the expected outcome for patients with moderate to severe atopic dermatitis treated with ruxolitinib cream?", "options": {"A": "Significant improvement in Investigator's Global Assessment-Treatment Success and Eczema Area and Severity Index", "B": "No improvement in symptoms", "C": "Worsening of symptoms", "D": "Increased risk of treatment-emergent adverse events"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Ruxolitinib cream has been shown to significantly improve outcomes in atopic dermatitis, including Investigator's Global Assessment-Treatment Success and Eczema Area and Severity Index.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41556257", "title": "Ruxolitinib cream improves outcomes in atopic dermatitis: An updated systematic review and meta-analysis", "span_text": "Ruxolitinib significantly improved IGA-TS at 4 weeks (RR 4.56; 95% CI 3.01-6.92; p < .001) and 8 weeks (RR 4.00; 95% CI 2.97-5.38; p < .001), and EASI75 at 4 weeks (RR 3.10; 95% CI 1.79-5.38; p < .001) and 8 weeks (RR 3.16; 95% CI 2.21-4.51; p < .001)."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41562046", "pubmed_web_41556257", "pubmed_web_41552868", "pubmed_web_41546368", "pubmed_web_41537500", "pubmed_web_41532885", "pubmed_web_41527980", "pubmed_web_41518320", "pubmed_web_41517685", "pubmed_web_41504136", "pubmed_web_41503869", "pubmed_web_41496352", "pubmed_web_41491205", "pubmed_web_41480692", "pubmed_web_41474570", "pubmed_web_41465894", "pubmed_web_41414786", "pubmed_web_41413008", "pubmed_web_41413002", "pubmed_web_41413001"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41562046", "pubmed_web_41556257", "pubmed_web_41552868", "pubmed_web_41546368", "pubmed_web_41537500", "pubmed_web_41532885", "pubmed_web_41527980", "pubmed_web_41518320", "pubmed_web_41517685", "pubmed_web_41504136", "pubmed_web_41503869", "pubmed_web_41496352", "pubmed_web_41491205", "pubmed_web_41480692", "pubmed_web_4