{"topic": "Psoriasis", "competency": "Investigation", "stem": "What is the primary mechanism by which anhydroicaritin (ANH) exerts its therapeutic effects in the treatment of psoriasis?", "options": {"A": "Inhibition of acyl-CoA ligase family member 4 (ACSL4)-dependent ferroptosis", "B": "Stimulation of interleukin (IL)-17 production", "C": "Enhancement of Th1/Th17 cell infiltration", "D": "Induction of keratinocyte apoptosis"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Anhydroicaritin (ANH) has been shown to exert its therapeutic effects in the treatment of psoriasis primarily through the inhibition of acyl-CoA ligase family member 4 (ACSL4)-dependent ferroptosis.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41577955", "title": "Anhydroicaritin-loaded mesenchymal stem cell exosomes ameliorate psoriasis via ACSL4-mediated ferroptosis in mice", "span_text": "Furthermore, RNA-seq indicates that the therapeutic effect of ANH is achieved through the inhibition of acyl-CoA ligase family member 4 (ACSL4)-dependent ferroptosis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41577955", "pubmed_web_41577189", "pubmed_web_41575986", "pubmed_web_41575605", "pubmed_web_41575604", "pubmed_web_41565343", "pubmed_web_41563741", "pubmed_web_41562814", "pubmed_web_41561196", "pubmed_web_41555153", "pubmed_web_41553700", "pubmed_web_41552704", "pubmed_web_41552497", "pubmed_web_41546169", "pubmed_web_41546067", "pubmed_web_41539635", "pubmed_web_41538134", "pubmed_web_41535531", "pubmed_web_41526088", "pubmed_web_41524178"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41577955", "pubmed_web_41577189", "pubmed_web_41575986", "pubmed_web_41575605", "pubmed_web_41575604", "pubmed_web_41565343", "pubmed_web_41563741", "pubmed_web_41562814", "pubmed_web_41561196", "pubmed_web_41555153", "pubmed_web_41553700", "pubmed_web_41552704", "pubmed_web_41552497", "pubmed_web_41546169", "pubmed_web_41546067", "pubmed_web_41539635", "pubmed_web_41538134", "pubmed_web_