{"topic": "Hypothyroidism", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is an example of a preventive mechanism for hypothyroidism that can prevent mental retardation?", "options": {"A": "Neonatal screening", "B": "Cervical cytology testing", "C": "Health maintenance", "D": "Continuity of care"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Neonatal screening for hypothyroidism is an effective mechanism for prevention of mental retardation.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Gynecology_Novak_695", "title": "Gynecology_Novak", "span_text": "Neonatal screening for phenylketonuria (PKU) and hypothyroidism are examples of effective mechanisms for prevention of mental retardation."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["Gynecology_Novak_695"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Gynecology_Novak_695"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "manual review", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Hypothyroidism Prevention prevention prophylaxis risk reduction screening vaccination primary prevention secondary prevention lifestyle modification counseling public health early detection follow-up", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 8838.825166982133, "llm_ms": 907.030834001489, "verification_ms": 789.1516250092536, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 1, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FAILED_VERIFICATION": 0}, "failed_checks": [], "failed_checks_all": [], "evidence_doc_ids_used": ["Gynecology_Novak_695"], "evidence_reused": false}]}, "timings_ms": {"retrieval": 100.0, "verification": 200.0, "llm": 907.030834001489}}}
{"topic": "Heart failure", "competency": "Investigation", "stem": "What is the role of echocardiography in the diagnostic workup of heart failure?", "options": {"A": "To assess the underlying cardiac disease", "B": "To evaluate the severity of coronary artery disease", "C": "To diagnose pulmonary embolism", "D": "To measure blood pressure"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Echocardiography provides a high level of diagnostic accuracy for heart diseases and is used to assess the underlying cardiac disease in patients with heart failure.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0053_14899", "title": "[What does echocardiography contribute to heart failure?]", "span_text": "When examining patients with heart failure, it is often impossible to assess the underlying cardiac disease only on the basis of clinical examination, electrocardiogram and chest X-ray. As an additional noninvasive method, echocardiography provides a high level of diagnostic accuracy for heart diseases."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0015_9331", "pubmed23n0018_7002", "InternalMed_Harrison_17680", "pubmed23n0003_2374", "pubmed23n0064_321", "pubmed23n0005_1387", "InternalMed_Harrison_1371", "InternalMed_Harrison_1724", "pubmed23n0019_1825", "Gynecology_Novak_6186", "pubmed23n0053_14899", "pubmed23n0028_1799", "pubmed23n0051_7194", "pubmed23n0044_4835", "InternalMed_Harrison_19660", "pubmed23n0003_6973", "pubmed23n0029_7233", "pubmed23n0010_8946", "pubmed23n0015_4649", "pubmed23n0062_6348"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0015_9331", "pubmed23n0018_7002", "InternalMed_Harrison_17680", "pubmed23n0003_2374", "pubmed23n0064_321", "pubmed23n0005_1387", "InternalMed_Harrison_1371", "InternalMed_Harrison_1724", "pubmed23n0019_1825", "Gynecology_Novak_6186", "pubmed23n0053_14899", "pubmed23n0028_1799", "pubmed23n0051_7194", "pubmed23n0044_4835", "InternalMed_Harrison_19660", "pubmed23n0003_6973", "pubmed23n0029_7233", "pubmed23n0010_8946", "pubm