{"topic": "Breast cancer", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "What is the primary goal of second-line therapy in the treatment of relapsed breast cancer?", "options": {"A": "To prolong survival", "B": "To improve the quality of life", "C": "To reduce symptoms", "D": "To increase the dose of chemotherapy"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The primary goal of second-line therapy in the treatment of relapsed breast cancer is to improve the quality of life, as the capacity to prolong survival is limited.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0046_2320", "title": "Management of relapsing disease in prostate cancer", "span_text": "Second-line therapy in relapsed disease makes sense if life can be prolonged while relieving symptoms and maintaining or improving the quality of survival."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0046_2320", "pubmed23n0049_1490", "pubmed23n0054_17944", "pubmed23n0050_3505", "pubmed23n0024_5517", "pubmed23n0048_11867", "pubmed23n0051_386", "pubmed23n0048_19397", "pubmed23n0057_9751", "pubmed23n0035_5", "pubmed23n0045_20584", "pubmed23n0046_19458", "pubmed23n0047_12244", "pubmed23n0059_8920", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5954", "Surgery_Schwartz_2050", "Gynecology_Novak_7505", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6017", "Obstentrics_Williams_8749", "pubmed23n0051_15077", "pubmed23n0063_22274", "pubmed23n0012_9959", "pubmed23n0042_1745", "pubmed23n0056_3208", "pubmed23n0010_3665", "pubmed23n0014_3696", "pubmed23n0057_6886", "pubmed23n0050_3504", "pubmed23n0010_1239", "pubmed23n0057_17763", "pubmed23n0061_19896", "pubmed23n0062_10658", "pubmed23n0062_10726", "pubmed23n0057_14053", "pubmed23n0012_1496", "pubmed23n0053_15889", "pubmed23n0014_1234", "Surgery_Schwartz_4168", "Gynecology_Novak_7625", "pubmed23n0052_1034", "InternalMed_Harrison_6871", "Gynecology_Novak_7929", "pubmed23n0059_21327", "pubmed23n0059_20614", "pubmed23n0056_19041", "pubmed23n0051_2518", "pubmed23n0053_4520", "pubmed23n0046_11650", "pubmed23n