{"topic": "Myocardial infarction", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the purpose of thallium myocardial imaging in the diagnostic workup and treatment of patients with coronary artery disease?", "options": {"A": "To detect the presence or absence of coronary artery disease", "B": "To assess questionable stenosis and detect infarction", "C": "To evaluate the effectiveness of treatment", "D": "To predict future myocardial infarction"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Thallium myocardial imaging provides unique information and is useful in assessing questionable stenosis and detecting infarction.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0018_7002", "title": "Myocardial imaging with thallium-201: the controversy over its clinical usefulness in ischemic heart disease.", "span_text": "Several uses of thallium myocardial imaging (assessment of questionable stenosis and detection of infarction) provide unique information and are useful adjuncts in the diagnostic workup and treatment of patients with coronary artery disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0018_7002", "pubmed23n0043_9816", "pubmed23n0058_2120", "pubmed23n0010_8834"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0018_7002", "pubmed23n0043_9816", "pubmed23n0058_2120", "pubmed23n0010_8834"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Myocardial infarction Screening screening early detection risk assessment screening test sensitivity specificity guideline population screening high-risk preventive care follow-up diagnostic threshold", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 7186.490625026636, "llm_ms": 919.8741249856539, "verification_ms": 819.8155830032192, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtim