{"topic": "Asthma", "competency": "Pathophysiology", "stem": "What is the major pathologic feature of asthma?", "options": {"A": "Airway obstruction", "B": "Airway inflammation", "C": "Bronchial smooth muscle spasm", "D": "Reversible airflow limitation"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Asthma is characterized by airway inflammation, which is the major pathologic feature of the disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0057_20556", "title": "The inflammatory response in asthma", "span_text": "Asthma is remarkably underdiagnosed and undertreated. While the clinical hallmark of asthma is reversible airflow obstruction, airway inflammation is the major pathologic feature."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0060_1503", "Immunology_Janeway_3573", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2163", "pubmed23n0057_20556", "pubmed23n0044_5458", "pubmed23n0057_13963", "pubmed23n0050_6325", "pubmed23n0055_9085", "pubmed23n0051_15642", "pubmed23n0045_5772", "pubmed23n0061_18281", "pubmed23n0048_2496", "Physiology_Levy_2804", "pubmed23n0045_5983", "pubmed23n0051_1382", "pubmed23n0042_12228", "pubmed23n0054_2718", "pubmed23n0048_5859", "InternalMed_Harrison_20110", "pubmed23n0060_1506", "pubmed23n0044_15835", "InternalMed_Harrison_20116", "pubmed23n0053_13267", "pubmed23n0046_7491", "pubmed23n0057_3305", "pubmed23n0050_2846", "pubmed23n0059_8825", "pubmed23n0055_16580", "pubmed23n0054_594", "pubmed23n0043_8891", "Physiology_Levy_2796", "pubmed23n0030_2013", "pubmed23n0049_14778", "pubmed23n0054_1191", "pubmed23n0047_13746"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0060_1503", "Immunology_Janeway_3573", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2163", "pubmed23n0057_20556", "pubmed23n0044_5458", "pubmed23n0057_13963", "pubmed23n0050_6325", "pubmed23n0055_9085", "pubmed23n0051_15642", "pubmed23n0045_5772", "pubmed23n0061_18281", "pubmed23n0048_2496", "Physiology_Levy_2804", "pubmed23n0045_5983", "pubmed23n0051_1382", "pubmed23n0042_12228", "pubmed23n0054_2718", "p