{"topic": "Pulmonary embolism", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What percentage of patients developed postoperative pulmonary embolism in a study of 101 consecutive total hip arthroplasties?", "options": {"A": "6%", "B": "8%", "C": "10%", "D": "12%"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The study found that 8% of patients developed postoperative pulmonary embolism.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0016_8199", "title": "Risk factor assessment in 101 total hip arthroplasties: a medical perspective", "span_text": "Six per cent of patients developed postoperative clinical thrombophlebitis, and 8% a pulmonary embolism."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0016_8199", "pubmed23n0052_8305", "pubmed23n0057_11728", "pubmed23n0053_17697", "pubmed23n0050_20923", "Surgery_Schwartz_13806", "pubmed23n0048_7202", "pubmed23n0017_11173", "pubmed23n0026_8097", "Obstentrics_Williams_7738", "pubmed23n0052_20727", "Surgery_Schwartz_13389", "pubmed23n0032_3863", "pubmed23n0032_3710", "pubmed23n0060_228", "pubmed23n0011_11271", "pubmed23n0046_17991", "Surgery_Schwartz_13390", "pubmed23n0057_20992", "pubmed23n0052_19707", "pubmed23n0015_2140", "pubmed23n0050_6567", "pubmed23n0049_10423", "pubmed23n0053_11329", "pubmed23n0048_11883", "pubmed23n0052_19617", "pubmed23n0053_12543", "pubmed23n0025_9543", "Surgery_Schwartz_7883", "pubmed23n0063_2773", "Obstentrics_Williams_5042", "pubmed23n0059_3067", "pubmed23n0057_21040", "Surgery_Schwartz_3015", "pubmed23n0058_5241", "pubmed23n0047_21293", "pubmed23n0005_966", "Histology_Ross_1152", "pubmed23n0016_12071", "Obstentrics_Williams_7067", "pubmed23n0049_1811", "pubmed23n0049_6776", "Obstentrics_Williams_6905", "pubmed23n0023_12065", "pubmed23n0053_12367", "pubmed23n0037_2417", "pubmed23n0052_3562", "pubmed23n0054_10563", "pubmed23n0058_1049", "pubmed23n0052_1199", "pubmed23n0043_16334", "pubmed23n0052_2654", "Surgery_Schwartz_5235", "pubmed23n0045_17658", "pubmed23n0061_22468",