{"topic": "Dengue", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the current status of specific antiviral therapy for dengue virus?", "options": {"A": "There are several FDA-approved antiviral drugs available", "B": "There are no specific antiviral drugs currently available", "C": "Dengue virus can be treated with antibiotics", "D": "Supportive care is the only treatment option"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Currently, there are no specific antiviral drugs available for the treatment of dengue virus.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41575777", "title": "Dengue and Aging: Challenges and Opportunities in Prevention and Care. A narrative review", "span_text": "To date, there are no specific prognostic markers and no specific antiviral drugs."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41578914", "pubmed_web_41576105", "pubmed_web_41575777", "pubmed_web_41571683", "pubmed_web_41571221", "pubmed_web_41568746", "pubmed_web_41568594", "pubmed_web_41567885", "pubmed_web_41561567", "pubmed_web_41559858", "pubmed_web_41557736", "pubmed_web_41557722", "pubmed_web_41545435", "pubmed_web_41538617", "pubmed_web_41533739", "pubmed_web_41531540", "pubmed_web_41530076", "pubmed_web_41529013", "pubmed_web_41524167", "pubmed_web_41514311"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41578914", "pubmed_web_41576105", "pubmed_web_41575777", "pubmed_web_41571683", "pubmed_web_41571221", "pubmed_web_41568746", "pubmed_web_41568594", "pubmed_web_41567885", "pubmed_web_41561567", "pubmed_web_41559858", "pubmed_web_41557736", "pubmed_web_41557722", "pubmed_web_41545435", "pubmed_web_41538617", "pubmed_web_41533739", "pubmed_web_41531540", "pubmed_web_41530076", "pubmed_web_41529013", "pubmed_web_41524167", "pubmed_web_41514311"], "retrieval_mode": "pubmed_web"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "pubmed_web_fallback", "query": "Dengue