{"topic": "COVID-19", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "A 60-year-old patient with a history of hypertension is diagnosed with COVID-19. What is the prognostic value of the Brixia score on the initial chest X-ray for this patient?", "options": {"A": "It can predict the severity of the disease and mortality rate", "B": "It can only predict the severity of the disease", "C": "It can only predict the mortality rate", "D": "It has no prognostic value"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The Brixia score is a useful tool for predicting disease severity, progression, and outcomes in COVID-19 patients. A higher Brixia score at admission and at discharge/death is associated with increased mortality.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41578536", "title": "Brixia score on initial chest X-ray as a predictor of outcome in COVID-19 and H1N1 acute chest infections: A retrospective study", "span_text": "This study aims to evaluate the use of the Brixia score on chest X-ray to predict disease severity, progression, and outcomes across 2 distinct viral infections: COVID-19 and H1N1."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41580870", "pubmed_web_41580819", "pubmed_web_41580537", "pubmed_web_41580460", "pubmed_web_41580084", "pubmed_web_41579008", "pubmed_web_41578536", "pubmed_web_41578455", "pubmed_web_41578061", "pubmed_web_41577338", "pubmed_web_41576058", "pubmed_web_41574535", "pubmed_web_41574293", "pubmed_web_41574291", "pubmed_web_41573760", "pubmed_web_41573606", "pubmed_web_41573439", "pubmed_web_41573393", "pubmed_web_41573353", "pubmed_web_41573272"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41580819", "pubmed_web_41580537", "pubmed_web_41580460", "pubmed_web_41580084", "pubmed_web_41579008", "pubmed_web_41578536", "pubmed_web_41578455", "pubmed_web_41578061", "pubmed_web_41577338", "pubmed_web_41576058", "pubmed_web_41574535", "pubmed_web_41574293", "pubmed_web_41574291", "pubmed_web_41573760", "pubmed_web_415