{"topic": "Atrial fibrillation", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "A 74-year-old patient with atrial fibrillation is referred for evaluation after an acute embolic event. What diagnostic procedure may potentially convert atrial fibrillation to sinus rhythm?", "options": {"A": "Transesophageal echocardiography", "B": "Transthoracic echocardiography", "C": "Cardiac catheterization", "D": "Electrocardiography"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Transesophageal echocardiography is a diagnostic procedure that can potentially convert atrial fibrillation to sinus rhythm, as seen in a case report of a 74-year-old patient.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0053_12075", "title": "Conversion of atrial fibrillation to sinus rhythm: a possible side effect of transesophageal echocardiography", "span_text": "Transesophageal echocardiography (TEE) is accepted as the procedure of choice for the diagnosis of intracardiac sources of systemic embolism. A case report is presented on a 74-year-old patient with atrial fibrillation referred for TEE evaluation after an acute embolic event. During TEE, atrial fibrillation converted to sinus rhythm."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0033_2730", "pubmed23n0024_5709", "pubmed23n0041_801", "pubmed23n0006_1403", "pubmed23n0051_19322", "pubmed23n0016_11334", "pubmed23n0018_4149", "pubmed23n0035_3486", "pubmed23n0052_14503", "pubmed23n0033_11419", "pubmed23n0015_4649", "pubmed23n0003_11513", "pubmed23n0032_6541", "pubmed23n0053_12075", "pubmed23n0056_2553", "pubmed23n0021_10079"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0033_2730", "pubmed23n0024_5709", "pubmed23n0041_801", "pubmed23n0006_1403", "pubmed23n0051_19322", "pubmed23n0016_11334", "pubmed23n0018_4149", "pubmed23n0035_3486", "pubmed23n0052_14503", "pubmed23n0033_11419", "pubmed23n0015_4649", "pubmed23n0003_11513", "pubmed23n0032_6541", "pubmed23n0053_12075", "pubmed23n0056_2553", "pubmed23n0021_10079"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_