{"topic": "Anxiety disorder", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What class of medications is often used for the management of acute anxiety states and for rapid control of panic attacks?", "options": {"A": "Benzodiazepines", "B": "Selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors", "C": "Monoamine oxidase inhibitors", "D": "Tricyclic antidepressants"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Benzodiazepines are widely used for the management of acute anxiety states and for rapid control of panic attacks due to their rapid onset of action and relatively high therapeutic index.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_2320", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "For control of ethanol or other sedative-hypnotic withdrawal states widely used for the management of acute anxiety states and for rapid control of panic attacks."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_2343", "pubmed23n0045_2865", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3223", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3314", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2346", "pubmed23n0003_7838", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3273", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3349", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2527", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3230", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3221", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2319", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2320", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3317", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3217", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2521"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_2343", "pubmed23n0045_2865", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3223", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3314", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2346", "pubmed23n0003_7838", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3273", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3349", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2527", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3230", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3221", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2319", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2320", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3317", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3217", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2521"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 50, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"atte