{"topic": "Iron deficiency anemia", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the primary treatment for asymptomatic patients with established iron-deficiency anemia?", "options": {"A": "Transfusion therapy", "B": "Oral iron therapy", "C": "Intravenous iron therapy", "D": "Surgery"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Oral iron therapy is usually adequate for asymptomatic patients with established iron-deficiency anemia.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_7990", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "In the asymptomatic patient with established iron-deficiency anemia, treatment with oral iron is usually adequate."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_7990", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1562", "pubmed23n0060_3233", "Obstentrics_Williams_2104", "pubmed23n0056_13656", "pubmed23n0048_2729", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3726", "First_Aid_Step2_1240", "pubmed23n0060_15744", "pubmed23n0051_386", "InternalMed_Harrison_22449", "pubmed23n0029_1509", "pubmed23n0024_1746", "pubmed23n0058_3919", "pubmed23n0051_9191", "InternalMed_Harrison_7989", "pubmed23n0028_2423", "pubmed23n0052_18491", "pubmed23n0011_12107", "pubmed23n0063_9142", "pubmed23n0021_3538", "pubmed23n0050_1508", "pubmed23n0043_8419", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3195", "pubmed23n0028_3206", "pubmed23n0052_9089", "pubmed23n0059_21274", "Pediatrics_Nelson_694", "pubmed23n0047_16831", "pubmed23n0019_6546"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_7990", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1562", "pubmed23n0060_3233", "Obstentrics_Williams_2104", "pubmed23n0056_13656", "pubmed23n0048_2729", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3726", "First_Aid_Step2_1240", "pubmed23n0060_15744", "pubmed23n0051_386", "InternalMed_Harrison_22449", "pubmed23n0029_1509", "pubmed23n0024_1746", "pubmed23n0058_3919", "pubmed23n0051_9191", "InternalMed_Harrison_7989", "pubmed23n0028_2423", "pubmed23n0052_18491", "pubmed23n0011_12107", "pubmed23n0063_9142"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verific