{"topic": "Anxiety disorder", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the primary goal of screening for anxiety disorders in primary care patients?", "options": {"A": "To diagnose generalized anxiety disorder", "B": "To identify patients at high risk for dissociative disorders", "C": "To detect patients with unexplained somatic symptoms", "D": "To evaluate the performance of function-specific mental health measures"}, "answer_key": "C", "explanation": "The primary goal of screening for anxiety disorders in primary care patients is to detect patients with unexplained somatic symptoms who may be at risk for anxiety disorders.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0055_17232", "title": "The relationship of function-specific mental health measures to psychiatric diagnoses", "span_text": "Focusing on the clinical relevance of the MHI scales, we evaluated their performance in screening for DIS-diagnosable disorders in a sample of primary care patients with multiple unexplained somatic symptoms."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0055_17232", "pubmed23n0062_105", "pubmed23n0046_15982", "pubmed23n0051_7734", "pubmed23n0060_11180", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1089", "pubmed23n0051_18347", "pubmed23n0059_21221", "InternalMed_Harrison_4911", "pubmed23n0059_10437", "InternalMed_Harrison_306", "pubmed23n0058_19887", "pubmed23n0046_13581", "InternalMed_Harrison_4827"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0055_17232", "pubmed23n0062_105", "pubmed23n0046_15982", "pubmed23n0051_7734", "pubmed23n0060_11180", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1089", "pubmed23n0051_18347", "pubmed23n0059_21221", "InternalMed_Harrison_4911", "pubmed23n0059_10437", "InternalMed_Harrison_306", "pubmed23n0058_19887", "pubmed23n0046_13581", "InternalMed_Harrison_4827"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"time": 200, "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Anxiety disorde