{"topic": "Chronic kidney disease", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is the leading cause of morbidity and mortality in patients with chronic kidney disease?", "options": {"A": "Cardiovascular disease", "B": "Infections", "C": "Malignancies", "D": "Gastrointestinal disorders"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of morbidity and mortality in patients with chronic kidney disease, with an incremental risk ranging from 10- to 200-fold compared to the age- and sex-matched general population.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "InternalMed_Harrison_21641", "title": "InternalMed_Harrison", "span_text": "Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of morbidity and mortality in patients at every stage of CKD."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0053_17698", "pubmed23n0058_9235", "pubmed23n0052_8305", "Pathology_Robbins_1082", "InternalMed_Harrison_21641", "pubmed23n0061_16963", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1934", "pubmed23n0060_1027", "pubmed23n0053_17697", "pubmed23n0036_11146", "pubmed23n0052_9476", "InternalMed_Harrison_25408", "pubmed23n0048_18301", "pubmed23n0047_5691", "pubmed23n0047_6071", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "pubmed23n0053_8979", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3447", "pubmed23n0018_6422", "pubmed23n0010_7082", "pubmed23n0043_106", "pubmed23n0016_13225", "pubmed23n0062_981", "pubmed23n0062_12627", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1979", "pubmed23n0050_211", "Pathology_Robbins_1684", "pubmed23n0057_14423", "pubmed23n0043_1775", "pubmed23n0063_5297", "pubmed23n0061_13025", "pubmed23n0048_16794", "pubmed23n0053_17538", "pubmed23n0063_21334", "pubmed23n0049_10703", "pubmed23n0048_7202", "pubmed23n0057_19177", "pubmed23n0051_8311", "pubmed23n0053_10924", "pubmed23n0045_1117", "InternalMed_Harrison_21487", "pubmed23n0047_2331", "pubmed23n0059_10495", "pubmed23n0012_7416", "Biochemistry_Lippincott_1201", "pubmed23n0059_10496", "pubmed23n0062_3110", "pubmed23n0063_622", "Pathology_Robbins_108