{"topic": "Allergic rhinitis", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "What is a key component of the therapeutic strategy for preventing allergic rhinitis in children?", "options": {"A": "Identification and eviction of main allergens", "B": "Only pharmacological therapy", "C": "Delayed introduction of antihistamines", "D": "Ignoring environmental factors"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The therapeutic strategy for preventing allergic rhinitis in children includes identifying and avoiding the main allergens, in addition to pharmacological therapy.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0045_9898", "title": "New strategies for the prevention and treatment of allergic rhinitis in children", "span_text": "The therapeutic strategy will include prevention by identification and eviction of the main allergens, associated to pharmacological therapy."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0050_7411", "pubmed23n0045_9898", "pubmed23n0059_9845"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0050_7411", "pubmed23n0045_9898", "pubmed23n0059_9845"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "manual review", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Allergic rhinitis Prevention prevention prophylaxis risk reduction screening vaccination primary prevention secondary prevention lifestyle modification counseling public health early detection follow-up", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 35093.201917014085, "llm_ms": 1105.270083004143, "verification_ms": 896.8999999924563, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 1, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FAILED_VERIFICATION": 0}, "failed_checks": [], "failed_checks_all": [], "evidence_doc_ids_used": ["pubmed23n0050_7411", "pubmed2