{"topic": "Breast cancer", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "A patient presents with numbness of the lower lip and chin, generalized tooth mobility with dull pain, and swelling of the right lower jaw. What is the most likely diagnosis?", "options": {"A": "Metastatic disease of the jaws", "B": "Dental abscess", "C": "Temporomandibular joint disorder", "D": "Salivary gland tumor"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The patient's symptoms, such as numbness of the lower lip and chin, generalized tooth mobility with dull pain, and swelling of the right lower jaw, are consistent with metastatic disease of the jaws, which can be a manifestation of breast cancer.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0060_18841", "title": "Mandible metastasis as the initial manifestation of breast carcinoma--report of a case", "span_text": "A case is presented in which the only positive subjective and clinical findings were numbness of the lower lip and chin, generalized tooth mobility with dull pain, and swelling of the right lower jaw."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0060_18841", "pubmed23n0054_20199", "pubmed23n0017_1983", "pubmed23n0014_9733", "pubmed23n0036_7308", "pubmed23n0054_1438", "Gynecology_Novak_3379", "pubmed23n0063_11624", "pubmed23n0018_4903", "pubmed23n0041_8955", "InternalMed_Harrison_28583", "pubmed23n0030_1016", "pubmed23n0053_4263", "pubmed23n0016_5680", "pubmed23n0036_8039", "Gynecology_Novak_3318", "pubmed23n0024_3840", "pubmed23n0059_8918", "Surgery_Schwartz_4074", "pubmed23n0034_218", "pubmed23n0046_13933", "pubmed23n0020_4315", "pubmed23n0047_2770", "pubmed23n0052_9196", "pubmed23n0008_8750", "pubmed23n0051_392", "pubmed23n0014_13380", "pubmed23n0006_7486", "Pediatrics_Nelson_3308", "pubmed23n0050_10466", "pubmed23n0023_10159", "pubmed23n0007_1772", "pubmed23n0056_17878", "pubmed23n0060_6543", "pubmed23n0043_8258", "pubmed23n0052_15320", "Surgery_Schwartz_3924", "pubmed23n0051_4745", "pubmed23n0018_