{"topic": "Typhoid fever", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a potential complication of typhoid fever that can occur in the second week of the disease?", "options": {"A": "Pleuro-pulmonary complications", "B": "Gastrointestinal bleeding", "C": "Cardiac involvement", "D": "Neurological manifestations"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Pleuro-pulmonary complications can occur in typhoid fever, typically in the second week of the disease, and may appear even under treatment.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0007_16091", "title": "[Pleuro-pulmonary complications of typhoid fever. 1case]", "span_text": "The authors report a case of typhoid fever with pleuro-pulmonary complications and recall their characteristics: Usually early (second week), may appear under treatment, whereas the disease evolves normally."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0057_23932", "pubmed23n0022_2409", "pubmed23n0059_8586", "pubmed23n0007_16091", "pubmed23n0059_757", "pubmed23n0057_24447", "pubmed23n0047_5064", "pubmed23n0060_2762", "InternalMed_Harrison_11709", "pubmed23n0042_10533", "pubmed23n0005_437", "pubmed23n0020_4121", "pubmed23n0028_14089", "InternalMed_Harrison_14692", "pubmed23n0060_3014", "pubmed23n0017_11494", "pubmed23n0044_22981", "pubmed23n0030_10900", "pubmed23n0035_65", "pubmed23n0062_7246", "Surgery_Schwartz_11062", "InternalMed_Harrison_12683", "pubmed23n0046_19290", "pubmed23n0050_2131", "pubmed23n0011_4730", "pubmed23n0060_20230", "pubmed23n0060_20838", "pubmed23n0057_4932"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0057_23932", "pubmed23n0022_2409", "pubmed23n0059_8586", "pubmed23n0007_16091", "pubmed23n0059_757", "pubmed23n0057_24447", "pubmed23n0047_5064", "pubmed23n0060_2762", "InternalMed_Harrison_11709", "pubmed23n0042_10533", "pubmed23n0005_437", "pubmed23n0020_4121", "pubmed23n0028_14089", "InternalMed_Harrison_14692", "pubmed23n0060_3014", "pubmed23n0017_11494", "pubmed23n0044_22981", "pubmed23