{"topic": "Pancreatitis", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "A 52-year-old woman is admitted with acute necrotizing pancreatitis. On admission, she has elevated white blood cell count, elevated serum transaminases, and hypocalcemia. According to Ranson's criteria, which of the following best predicts her prognosis if she has more than seven risk factors?", "options": {"A": "She has a 100% mortality rate.", "B": "She has a 40% chance of survival.", "C": "She will require immediate surgical intervention to survive.", "D": "She will likely develop chronic pancreatitis within six months."}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "In patients with acute necrotizing pancreatitis, having more than seven Ranson's criteria risk factors is associated with a 100% mortality rate. This finding is based on clinical evaluation of 36 cases, where all 13 patients with more than seven risk factors died.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0043_16585", "title": "[High risk factors in the prognosis of acute necrotizing pancreatitis]", "span_text": "It was found that all 13 cases with more than 7 factors each died, the mortality rate was 100%, and 2 of 5 cases with 5-7 factors each succumbed with the mortality rate of 40%."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"query": "prognosis acute necrotizing pancreatitis Ranson criteria mortality", "doc_ids": ["Surgery_Schwartz_9951", "Surgery_Schwartz_9248", "Surgery_Schwartz_9670", "pubmed23n0027_15167", "Surgery_Schwartz_9923", "Obstentrics_Williams_7644", "Surgery_Schwartz_9672", "First_Aid_Step2_354", "Surgery_Schwartz_9964", "Surgery_Schwartz_9726", "pubmed23n0043_16585", "pubmed23n0014_6129", "pubmed23n0023_1646", "pubmed23n0025_11221", "Surgery_Schwartz_9970"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0027_15167", "Surgery_Schwartz_9923", "Obstentrics_Williams_7644", "Surgery_Schwartz_9672", "First_Aid_Step2_354", "Surgery_Schwartz_9964", "Surgery_Schwartz_9726", "pubmed23n0043_16585", "pubmed23n0014_6129", "pubmed23n0023_1646", "pubmed23n0025_11221", "Surgery_Schwartz_9970", "Surgery_Schwartz_9951", "Surgery_Schwartz_9248", "Surgery_Schwartz_9670"], "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank"}, "verification": {"method": "exact_match", "result": "confirmed", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 1, "reason": "initial", "query": "Pancreatitis Prognosis prognosis outcomes mortality survival complications disease course recurrence risk stratification severity long-term outcomes quality of life predictors", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 12977.84954198869, "llm_ms": 2074.599500047043, "verification_ms": 2816.8432080419734, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 0, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FAILED_VERIFICATION": 1}, "failed_checks": ["reviewer_error"], "failed_checks_all": ["reviewer_error"], "evidence_doc_ids_used": ["pubmed23n0027_15167", "Surgery_Schwartz_9923", "Obstentrics_Williams_7644", "Surgery_Schwartz_9672", "First_Aid_Step2_354", "Surgery_Schwartz_9964", "Surgery_Schwartz_9726", "pubmed23n0043_16585", "pubmed23n0014_6129", "pubmed23n0023_1646", "pubmed23n0025_11221", "Surgery_Schwartz_9970", "Surgery_Schwartz_9951", "Surgery_Schwartz_9248", "Surgery_Schwartz_9670"], "evidence_reused": false}, {"attempt": 2, "reason": "v6_retry", "query": "Pancreatitis Prognosis prognosis outcomes mortality survival complications disease course recurrence risk stratification severity long-term outcomes quality of life predictors", "evidence_top_k": 20, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 14691.885165986605, "llm_ms": 1197.1071250154637, "verification_ms": 1515.9277910133824, "extra_instructions": "Ensure the correct answer is directly supported by the evidence and quote the exact supporting span.", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid_rerank", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs":