{"topic": "Back pain", "competency": "Etiology", "stem": "A 45-year-old male smoker presents with chronic low back pain. Imaging reveals advanced degeneration of intervertebral disks. Which factor is most strongly supported by evidence as an independent risk factor for this finding?", "options": {"A": "Smoking", "B": "Sedentary occupation", "C": "Heavy lifting", "D": "Psychosomatic factors"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Smoking has been identified as an independent variable associated with advanced degeneration of intervertebral disks, as demonstrated in a study of monozygotic twins. This finding suggests a direct association between smoking and disk degeneration, independent of genetic and occupational factors.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0051_7772", "title": "Epidemiology, etiology, diagnostic evaluation, and treatment of low back pain.", "span_text": "In an important study of monozygotic twins, smoking was identified as an independent variable associated with advanced degeneration of intervertebral disks."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"query": "risk factors for intervertebral disk degeneration in back pain", "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_1753", "pubmed23n0051_7772", "pubmed23n0051_6013", "pubmed23n0047_5726", "pubmed23n0061_3584", "pubmed23n0051_5935", "pubmed23n0061_12577", "pubmed23n0013_403", "InternalMed_Harrison_1331", "pubmed23n0051_6715", "InternalMed_Harrison_1480", "pubmed23n0051_8998", "pubmed23n0051_8515", "pubmed23n0047_1902", "InternalMed_Harrison_1485", "pubmed23n0052_6086", "pubmed23n0061_8728", "InternalMed_Harrison_1469", "pubmed23n0061_12153", "pubmed23n0061_1972", "pubmed23n0002_12021", "pubmed23n0043_17762", "pubmed23n0060_17352", "InternalMed_Harrison_704", "pubmed23n0046_11174", "pubmed23n0061_11677"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_1753", "pubmed23n0051_7772", "pubmed23n0051_6013", "pubmed23n0047_5726", "pubmed23n0061_3584", "pubmed23n0051_5935", "pubmed23n0061_12577", "pubmed2