{"topic": "GERD", "competency": "Therapy", "stem": "Which therapeutic approach was reported to improve chronic GERD symptoms and allow discontinuation of proton pump inhibitors in a patient after a brief course of conventional therapy?", "options": {"A": "A structured 12\u2011week Unani regimen combined with lifestyle and dietary counseling", "B": "Long\u2011term high\u2011dose proton pump inhibitor therapy", "C": "Intravenous pantoprazole administered for more than four days", "D": "Laparoscopic Nissen fundoplication performed with an in\u2011situ gastrostomy tube"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The case report described a patient with chronic GERD who, after a short course of triple therapy, received a 12\u2011week Unani regimen. Clinical symptoms, quality\u2011of\u2011life scores, and imaging findings improved, and the patient remained off PPIs, indicating the regimen was associated with symptom resolution without continued acid\u2011suppression medication.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41558065", "title": "Integrative Unani pharmacotherapy in chronic gastroesophageal reflux disease: A case report", "span_text": "BACKGROUND: Gastroesophageal reflux disease (GERD) is a chronic gastrointestinal disorder that often requires prolonged proton pump inhibitor (PPI) therapy. It frequently coexists with Helicobacter pylori-associated gastritis. Limitations of long-term PPI use, symptom recurrence, and patient adherence have increased interest in complementary medical systems. Unani system of medicine (USM) conceptualizes reflux-like disorders as disturbances of digestion and gastric temperament, emphasizing mucosal protection and physiological restoration."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "query": "Unani regimen GERD case report", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41578529", "pubmed_web_41577482", "pubmed_web_41576548", "pubmed_web_41576321", "pubmed_web_41564033", "pubmed_web_41563645", "pubmed_web_41558065", "pubmed_web_41557001", "pubmed_web_41553382", "pubmed_web_41551831", "pubmed_web_41551533", "pubmed_web_41545289", "pubmed_web_41539580", "pubmed_web_41537290", "pubmed_web_41534397", "pubmed_web_41530072", "pubmed_web_41527695", "pubmed_web_41525274", "pubmed_web_41525031", "pubmed_web_41524830"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41558065", "pubmed_web_41557001", "pubmed_web_41553382", "pubmed_web_41551831", "pubmed_web_41551533", "pubmed_web_41545289", "pubmed_web_41539580", "pubmed_web_41537290", "pubmed_web_41534397", "pubmed_web_41530072", "pubmed_web_41527695", "pubmed_web_41525274", "pubmed_web_41525031", "pubmed_web_41524830", "pubmed_web_41578529", "pubmed_web_41577482", "pubmed_web_41576548", "pubmed_web_41576321", "pubmed_web_41564033", "pubmed_web_41563645"], "retrieval_mode": "pubmed_web"}, "verification": {"checked_by": "assistant", "date": "2026-01-27", "gate": {"pass": true, "failed_checks": [], "notes": []}, "attempt_history": [{"attempt": 2, "reason": "pubmed_web_fallback", "query": "GERD Therapy therapy treatment management drug dosage medication pharmacotherapy first-line second-line guideline intervention acute management long-term management Therapy", "evidence_top_k": 60, "candidate_count": 1, "selected_index": 1, "retrieval_ms": 3361.042124999585, "llm_ms": 1239.6659589999217, "verification_ms": 0.3259579998484696, "extra_instructions": "", "retrieval_mode": "pubmed_web", "pubmed_web": {"attempted": false, "docs": 0, "runtime_ms": 0.0}, "status_counts": {"OK": 0, "INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE": 0, "FAILED_VERIFICATION": 1}, "failed_checks": ["evidence_span_mismatch"], "failed_checks_all": ["evidence_span_mismatch"], "evidence_doc_ids_used": ["pubmed_web_41558065", "pubmed_web_41557001", "pubmed_web_41553382", "pubmed_web_41551831", "pubmed_web_41551533", "pubmed_web_41545289", "pubmed_web_41539580", "pubmed_web_41537290", "pubmed_web_41534397", "pubmed_web_41530072", "pubmed_web_41527695", "pubmed_web_41525274", "pubmed_web_41525031", "pubmed_we