{"topic": "Sepsis", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "In clinical studies of sepsis, supplementation with butyrate has been associated with a reduction in which of the following complications?", "options": {"A": "Gastrointestinal complications", "B": "Acute kidney injury", "C": "Deep vein thrombosis", "D": "Hyperglycemia"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Butyrate supplementation in sepsis patients has been linked to fewer gastrointestinal complications, as demonstrated in a randomized trial where patients with synbiotic\u2011induced butyrate increases experienced reduced GI complications and ventilator\u2011associated pneumonia.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41580009", "title": "Therapeutic potential of butyrate supplementation in sepsis: a review of preclinical evidence and translational perspectives", "span_text": "a randomized trial reported fewer gastrointestinal complications and ventilator-associated pneumonia in patients with synbiotic-induced butyrate increases."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"query": "butyrate sepsis complications gastrointestinal", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41582759", "pubmed_web_41582269", "pubmed_web_41580950", "pubmed_web_41580574", "pubmed_web_41580332", "pubmed_web_41580009", "pubmed_web_41579966", "pubmed_web_41579563", "pubmed_web_41579501", "pubmed_web_41579211", "pubmed_web_41579146", "pubmed_web_41578749", "pubmed_web_41578565", "pubmed_web_41578542", "pubmed_web_41578537", "pubmed_web_41578464", "pubmed_web_41578395", "pubmed_web_41575374", "pubmed_web_41574690", "pubmed_web_41574664"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41580009", "pubmed_web_41579966", "pubmed_web_41579563", "pubmed_web_41579501", "pubmed_web_41579211", "pubmed_web_41579146", "pubmed_web_41578749", "pubmed_web_41578565", "pubmed_web_41578542", "pubmed_web_41578537", "pubmed_web_41578464", "pubmed_web_41578395", "pubmed_web_41575374", "pubmed_web_41574690", "pubmed_web_41574664", "pubmed_web_41582759", "pubmed_w