{"topic": "Chronic pain", "competency": "Etiology", "stem": "What is a known risk factor for the development of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD)?", "options": {"A": "Genetic susceptibility", "B": "Environmental factors only", "C": "Infectious agents only", "D": "Poor diet"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Genetic susceptibility is a known risk factor for the development of COPD, as studies have shown that individuals with a family history of the disease are more likely to develop it.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0036_1511", "title": "A genetic-epidemiologic study of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. I. Study design and preliminary observations.", "span_text": "The voluminous literature on the familial occurrence of COPD as well as the association between genetically determined serum alpha 1-antitrypsin (alpha 1-at) deficiency and COPD, however, reveals many aspects yet to be clarified."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_1753", "pubmed23n0050_6755", "pubmed23n0036_1511", "InternalMed_Harrison_7124", "InternalMed_Harrison_5626", "pubmed23n0054_9240", "pubmed23n0062_11930", "pubmed23n0052_6086", "pubmed23n0051_6013", "pubmed23n0013_403", "pubmed23n0062_17765", "pubmed23n0049_4234", "pubmed23n0048_2394", "InternalMed_Harrison_1285", "Pathology_Robbins_4029", "pubmed23n0002_12021", "pubmed23n0049_1606", "pubmed23n0051_7772", "pubmed23n0062_15490", "pubmed23n0045_1163", "InternalMed_Harrison_25193", "pubmed23n0047_3573", "pubmed23n0044_20505", "pubmed23n0051_8515", "InternalMed_Harrison_28019", "InternalMed_Harrison_1485", "pubmed23n0047_448", "pubmed23n0059_1330", "pubmed23n0051_8311", "pubmed23n0027_37", "pubmed23n0051_3855", "pubmed23n0047_5726", "InternalMed_Harrison_704", "pubmed23n0052_16117", "pubmed23n0045_14864", "pubmed23n0013_3189", "pubmed23n0060_17352", "pubmed23n0033_10306", "Gynecology_Novak_2463", "pubmed23n0045_12309", "pubmed23n0063_740", "pubmed23n0055