{"topic": "Influenza", "competency": "Screening", "stem": "What is the primary concern with Oseltamivir as a first-line antiviral drug for influenza?", "options": {"A": "Its high cost", "B": "The risk of drug resistance", "C": "Its limited availability", "D": "Its side effects"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The risk of drug resistance to Oseltamivir is a significant concern, as it can reduce the effectiveness of the drug in treating influenza.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41571900", "title": "Emerging trends and hotspots in Oseltamivir resistance: insights from a bibliometric investigation", "span_text": "Influenza has long been a serious global public health problem, and the risk of drug resistance to Oseltamivir, as a first-line antiviral drug, cannot be ignored."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41582136", "pubmed_web_41581816", "pubmed_web_41578536", "pubmed_web_41571900", "pubmed_web_41570445", "pubmed_web_41570068", "pubmed_web_41567776", "pubmed_web_41563477", "pubmed_web_41561862", "pubmed_web_41561654", "pubmed_web_41561089", "pubmed_web_41555529", "pubmed_web_41554401", "pubmed_web_41552786", "pubmed_web_41552247", "pubmed_web_41547242", "pubmed_web_41545885", "pubmed_web_41544183", "pubmed_web_41543805", "pubmed_web_41536653", "pubmed_web_41536406", "pubmed_web_41535683", "pubmed_web_41530074", "pubmed_web_41529557", "pubmed_web_41529435", "pubmed_web_41529325", "pubmed_web_41527184", "pubmed_web_41525289", "pubmed_web_41524797", "pubmed_web_41523242"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41582136", "pubmed_web_41581816", "pubmed_web_41578536", "pubmed_web_41571900", "pubmed_web_41570445", "pubmed_web_41570068", "pubmed_web_41567776", "pubmed_web_41563477", "pubmed_web_41561862", "pubmed_web_41561654", "pubmed_web_41561089", "pubmed_web_41555529", "pubmed_web_41554401", "pubmed_web_41552786", "pubmed_web_41552247", "pubmed_web_41547242", "pubmed_web_41545885", "pubmed_web_4