{"topic": "Prostate cancer", "competency": "Prognosis", "stem": "What is the primary factor that correlates with prognosis in patients with incidental carcinoma of the prostate?", "options": {"A": "Histologic grade", "B": "Patient age", "C": "Extent of disease", "D": "All of the above"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The prognosis of incidental carcinoma of the prostate is correlated with histologic grade and extent of disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0061_1040", "title": "Therapeutic options in the management of incidental carcinoma of the prostate", "span_text": "Incidental carcinoma of the prostate is a protean disease with a natural course which may be indolent or aggressive, with prognosis correlated with histologic grade and extent of disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0063_10697", "pubmed23n0063_15760", "pubmed23n0053_5927", "pubmed23n0046_16684", "pubmed23n0056_20847", "pubmed23n0045_18891", "pubmed23n0061_1040", "pubmed23n0063_8505", "pubmed23n0015_666", "pubmed23n0063_12841", "pubmed23n0054_16380", "pubmed23n0056_20844", "pubmed23n0046_3326", "Surgery_Schwartz_9248", "pubmed23n0061_732", "InternalMed_Harrison_534", "pubmed23n0062_13842", "pubmed23n0054_10173", "pubmed23n0051_6928", "pubmed23n0043_19005", "Obstentrics_Williams_8693", "Surgery_Schwartz_8569", "pubmed23n0053_3289", "pubmed23n0057_5979", "pubmed23n0053_16521", "Gynecology_Novak_7636", "pubmed23n0043_11061", "InternalMed_Harrison_25429", "Surgery_Schwartz_7300", "pubmed23n0043_1334", "pubmed23n0060_4215", "pubmed23n0053_19769", "pubmed23n0036_8618", "pubmed23n0057_6218", "pubmed23n0038_9801", "pubmed23n0034_1116", "pubmed23n0044_10432", "pubmed23n0052_15076", "InternalMed_Harrison_31956", "pubmed23n0057_20740", "pubmed23n0015_9891", "pubmed23n0061_9002", "Surgery_Schwartz_4031", "Surgery_Schwartz_8612", "Surgery_Schwartz_11798", "pubmed23n0054_13123", "pubmed23n0043_12894", "InternalMed_Harrison_7728", "pub