{"topic": "Anaphylaxis", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "A patient with a history of anaphylaxis due to hymenoptera venom allergy is undergoing venom immunotherapy and has been prescribed an adrenaline autoinjector. What is the most critical factor in ensuring the patient's effective use of the autoinjector?", "options": {"A": "Proper storage and handling of the device", "B": "Ongoing tailored education and training on autoinjector use", "C": "Regular monitoring of the patient's allergy symptoms", "D": "Adjusting the dosage of venom immunotherapy"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Ongoing tailored education and training on autoinjector use is essential to ensure the patient's effective use of the device, as knowledge retention and adherence to proper use can decline over time.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41420617", "title": "Evaluation of adherence and knowledge retention for adrenaline autoinjector use in hymenoptera venom-allergic patients with c-KIT p.D816V", "span_text": "Knowledge retention was 82.3% at 3 months, dropping to 40.0% at 12 to 24 months (p = 0.0160) and 22.2% after 24 months (p = 0.0005), indicating a clear decline over time."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "method": "exact match", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41562057", "pubmed_web_41560745", "pubmed_web_41538374", "pubmed_web_41521849", "pubmed_web_41514192", "pubmed_web_41510936", "pubmed_web_41510935", "pubmed_web_41510923", "pubmed_web_41508631", "pubmed_web_41505160", "pubmed_web_41489807", "pubmed_web_41475155", "pubmed_web_41475135", "pubmed_web_41465502", "pubmed_web_41459438", "pubmed_web_41429729", "pubmed_web_41429040", "pubmed_web_41428685", "pubmed_web_41420617", "pubmed_web_41418604", "pubmed_web_41412959", "pubmed_web_41408837", "pubmed_web_41405481", "pubmed_web_41401453", "pubmed_web_41399928", "pubmed_web_41355466", "pubmed_web_41344809", "pubmed_web_41343267", "pubmed_web_41339811", "pubmed_web_41324154"], "evidence_