{"topic": "Chronic Liver Disease", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "A patient with chronic liver disease is prescribed tizanidine for muscle spasm. What adjustment should be made to the dosage regimen in this patient?", "options": {"A": "Increase the dosage to achieve therapeutic effects", "B": "Decrease the dosage to minimize hepatotoxicity", "C": "No adjustment is necessary as tizanidine is not metabolized by the liver", "D": "Discontinue tizanidine and use an alternative agent"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Tizanidine is metabolized by the liver, and patients with hepatic impairment require dosage adjustments to minimize the risk of hepatotoxicity.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_2940", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "Dosage must be adjusted in patients with hepatic or renal impairment."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0043_4462", "pubmed23n0026_3648", "Pharmacology_Katzung_115", "InternalMed_Harrison_337", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3086", "InternalMed_Harrison_328", "pubmed23n0043_2523", "pubmed23n0013_7562", "Pharmacology_Katzung_343", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5612", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2940", "Pharmacology_Katzung_108", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2398", "pubmed23n0052_5259", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5453", "pubmed23n0053_8867", "pubmed23n0057_16351", "Pharmacology_Katzung_33", "pubmed23n0062_6927", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5883", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2540", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5752", "pubmed23n0054_10758", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2160", "pubmed23n0009_857", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3803", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5750", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2280", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7128", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5841", "pubmed23n0003_7838", "pubmed23n0053_12327", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5775", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6106", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6568", "Pharmacology_Katzung_352", "pubmed23n0015_13814", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5436", "