{"topic": "Chronic Liver Disease", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "What is a potential adverse effect of darunavir in patients with chronic liver disease?", "options": {"A": "Severe hepatitis", "B": "Nephrotoxicity", "C": "Respiratory failure", "D": "Cardiac arrhythmia"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Darunavir can cause liver toxicity, including severe hepatitis, especially in patients with pre-existing liver disease such as HBV, HCV, or other chronic liver disease.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_5436", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "Liver toxicity, including severe hepatitis, has been reported, such that liver function tests should be monitored; the risk may be higher for persons with HBV, HCV, or other chronic liver disease."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0054_10758", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2160", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3803", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2280", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2540", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7128", "pubmed23n0053_12327", "pubmed23n0009_857", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5752", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6568", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6106", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5841", "pubmed23n0003_7838", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5775", "pubmed23n0015_13814", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5750", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6415", "Pharmacology_Katzung_352", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5436", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5758", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5740", "pubmed23n0040_6690", "pubmed23n0013_3263", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4057", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5511", "Pharmacology_Katzung_437", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1289", "Pharmacology_Katzung_295", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4003", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6114", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5779", "pubmed23n0029_4831", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6681", "pubmed23n0011_6620", "pubmed23n0060_214", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5765", "Pharmacology_Katzung_453", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3994", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2935", "pubmed23n0045_12789", "Pharmacology_Kat