{"topic": "Osteosarcoma", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "What is the significance of UBR5 in osteosarcoma, and how does it relate to the disease's progression?", "options": {"A": "UBR5 is a tumor suppressor that inhibits osteosarcoma progression", "B": "UBR5 is an oncogene that induces osteosarcoma progression and is a potential diagnostic and prognostic biomarker", "C": "UBR5 has no role in osteosarcoma progression", "D": "UBR5 is a marker of good prognosis in osteosarcoma"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "UBR5 is involved in cancer progression, and its upregulation is strongly associated with poor prognosis in osteosarcoma. It is a potential diagnostic and prognostic biomarker and a key driver of osteosarcoma progression.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41534128", "title": "UBR5, a potential diagnostic and prognostic biomarker induces osteosarcoma progression", "span_text": "UBR5 expression was significantly elevated in osteosarcoma and various cancers, and its upregulation was strongly associated with poor prognosis. Furthermore, UBR5 exhibited high diagnostic accuracy in distinguishing cancer from normal tissues."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41582380", "pubmed_web_41562936", "pubmed_web_41562935", "pubmed_web_41558915", "pubmed_web_41552210", "pubmed_web_41550183", "pubmed_web_41547692", "pubmed_web_41539257", "pubmed_web_41534128", "pubmed_web_41518355", "pubmed_web_41518041", "pubmed_web_41517779", "pubmed_web_41517748", "pubmed_web_41517690", "pubmed_web_41509083", "pubmed_web_41502512", "pubmed_web_41501582", "pubmed_web_41500705", "pubmed_web_41494974", "pubmed_web_41492046", "pubmed_web_41490637", "pubmed_web_41487843", "pubmed_web_41487033", "pubmed_web_41485474", "pubmed_web_41481491", "pubmed_web_41481339", "pubmed_web_41479782", "pubmed_web_41479597", "pubmed_web_41479192", "pubmed_web_41479051"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41547692", "pubmed_web_41539257", 