{"topic": "Sinusitis", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "A patient with selective IgA deficiency is more likely to experience which type of infection?", "options": {"A": "Skin infection", "B": "Sinusitis", "C": "Pneumonia", "D": "Meningitis"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The patient is more likely to experience sinusitis due to the increased risk of respiratory infections associated with selective IgA deficiency.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41562052", "title": "Serologic IL-18 increase with B-cell IL-18R loss characterizes selective IgA deficiency", "span_text": "Clinically, adults with sIgAD had an airway-predominant infectious burden (notably increased sinusitis and pneumonia), a skin-skewed atopic pattern (eczema and urticaria), and frequent ANA/ENA positivity despite normal IgG and IgM."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41575258", "pubmed_web_41575166", "pubmed_web_41571926", "pubmed_web_41570920", "pubmed_web_41569767", "pubmed_web_41569759", "pubmed_web_41569755", "pubmed_web_41569753", "pubmed_web_41569745", "pubmed_web_41569744", "pubmed_web_41569736", "pubmed_web_41569723", "pubmed_web_41569721", "pubmed_web_41569714", "pubmed_web_41567859", "pubmed_web_41563872", "pubmed_web_41562467", "pubmed_web_41562052", "pubmed_web_41561213", "pubmed_web_41558049", "pubmed_web_41557658", "pubmed_web_41557009", "pubmed_web_41549496", "pubmed_web_41546578", "pubmed_web_41543604", "pubmed_web_41541871", "pubmed_web_41535036", "pubmed_web_41534885", "pubmed_web_41531532", "pubmed_web_41528674"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41569721", "pubmed_web_41569714", "pubmed_web_41567859", "pubmed_web_41563872", "pubmed_web_41562467", "pubmed_web_41562052", "pubmed_web_41561213", "pubmed_web_41558049", "pubmed_web_41557658", "pubmed_web_41557009", "pubmed_web_41549496", "pubmed_web_41546578", "pubmed_web_41543604", "pubmed_web_41541871", "pubmed_web_41535036", "pubmed_web_41534885", "pubmed