{"topic": "Asthma", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is a key factor in the management of acute severe asthma according to recent observations?", "options": {"A": "Identifying and addressing the underlying factors of each attack", "B": "Using anticholinergic bronchodilators as first-line therapy", "C": "Relying solely on aerosol beta 2-agonists for treatment", "D": "Ignoring the role of patient education in self-management"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "The correct answer is supported by the evidence, which emphasizes the importance of identifying and addressing the underlying factors of each acute severe asthma attack to improve management and prevent future attacks.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0056_3085", "title": "Current management of acute severe asthma", "span_text": "Most attacks of acute severe asthma represent a failure of asthma management. The factors underlying each attack should be identified and determined attempts made to improve the assessment of asthma severity and self-management by the patient so that future attacks can be aborted or prevented."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0048_2494", "pubmed23n0046_8215", "pubmed23n0018_6146", "pubmed23n0061_12104", "pubmed23n0056_9098", "pubmed23n0044_16056", "pubmed23n0054_18928", "pubmed23n0062_7993", "pubmed23n0049_8549", "pubmed23n0056_3085", "pubmed23n0044_4340", "Pediatrics_Nelson_1804", "pubmed23n0032_10564", "pubmed23n0054_5551", "pubmed23n0048_15488", "pubmed23n0050_18176", "pubmed23n0058_9876", "pubmed23n0053_6724", "pubmed23n0015_8342", "Obstentrics_Williams_6999", "pubmed23n0045_4558", "pubmed23n0002_9133", "pubmed23n0027_11187", "pubmed23n0006_811", "pubmed23n0014_3720", "pubmed23n0043_5063", "pubmed23n0027_5217", "pubmed23n0022_2866", "pubmed23n0014_3961"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0018_6146", "pubmed23n0061_12104", "pubmed23n0056_9098", "pubmed23n0044_16056", "pubmed23n0054