{"topic": "Appendicitis", "competency": "Clinical Practice", "stem": "A 25-year-old woman presents with right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and vomiting. What is the most reliable symptom that supports the diagnosis of appendicitis?", "options": {"A": "Migration of pain to the right iliac fossa", "B": "Presence of anorexia", "C": "Tenderness in the left iliac fossa", "D": "Bilateral adnexal tenderness"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Migration of pain to the right iliac fossa and/or guarding/rigidity support the diagnosis of appendicitis.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0059_8127", "title": "Assessment of the reliability of the symptoms and signs of acute appendicitis", "span_text": "Migration of pain to the right iliac fossa and/or guarding/rigidity support the diagnosis of appendicitis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["Surgery_Schwartz_8873", "pubmed23n0039_10866", "pubmed23n0053_10852", "Surgery_Schwartz_8875", "Surgery_Schwartz_8807", "Obstentrics_Williams_7486", "Surgery_Schwartz_8869", "Surgery_Schwartz_8859", "pubmed23n0005_8135", "Obstentrics_Williams_7478", "pubmed23n0059_8127", "pubmed23n0063_8551", "pubmed23n0053_10856", "Pediatrics_Nelson_2861", "pubmed23n0047_4769", "pubmed23n0023_10103", "pubmed23n0014_7101", "Surgery_Schwartz_8171", "Surgery_Schwartz_8810", "Surgery_Schwartz_8803", "pubmed23n0044_21656", "pubmed23n0012_856", "Surgery_Schwartz_8871", "pubmed23n0015_2139", "Surgery_Schwartz_8872", "pubmed23n0044_25120", "pubmed23n0029_8856", "Surgery_Schwartz_1184", "Obstentrics_Williams_7479", "pubmed23n0016_5895", "pubmed23n0048_15293", "pubmed23n0042_9639", "Obstentrics_Williams_6431", "pubmed23n0058_9693", "pubmed23n0046_12291", "pubmed23n0016_13617", "pubmed23n0052_4635", "pubmed23n0033_3448", "pubmed23n0013_11618", "pubmed23n0022_4754", "pubmed23n0041_8494", "pubmed23n0028_13514", "Surgery_Schwartz_8858", "pubmed23n0052_19650", "pubmed23n0053_1397