{"topic": "Appendicitis", "competency": "Clinical Practice", "stem": "A 30-year-old man undergoes an appendectomy for acute appendicitis. Which of the following is a common cause of luminal obstruction leading to inflammation of the appendix?", "options": {"A": "Foreign bodies", "B": "Tumors", "C": "Scars", "D": "All of the above"}, "answer_key": "D", "explanation": "Luminal obstruction is a common cause of inflammation of the appendix, and it can be caused by various factors such as scars, foreign bodies, tumors, granulomas, and dysfunction of the cecocolon.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0024_8310", "title": "[Surgical diseases of the veriform appendix]", "span_text": "Various diseases can symptomatically resemble appendicitis. It has been proved that luminal obstruction is the most frequent cause of inflammation of the appendix. There are various causes of obstruction, such as scars, foreign bodies, tumors, granulomas, and dysfunction of coecocolon."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2022-01-01", "method": "database search", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0050_1521", "pubmed23n0017_7271", "pubmed23n0047_18233", "pubmed23n0054_8565", "Surgery_Schwartz_8863", "pubmed23n0024_8310", "pubmed23n0062_20088", "pubmed23n0032_8174", "pubmed23n0058_19650", "pubmed23n0048_20826", "pubmed23n0017_6756", "pubmed23n0022_5574", "pubmed23n0041_7881", "pubmed23n0059_13611", "pubmed23n0046_16252", "pubmed23n0034_664", "pubmed23n0053_10853", "pubmed23n0017_6722", "pubmed23n0041_356", "pubmed23n0046_12652", "pubmed23n0048_16892", "pubmed23n0019_4721", "pubmed23n0032_3968", "pubmed23n0047_5745", "pubmed23n0050_21001", "pubmed23n0040_5890", "pubmed23n0058_9251", "pubmed23n0051_16899", "pubmed23n0047_8881", "pubmed23n0033_4675", "pubmed23n0053_1832", "pubmed23n0022_2096", "pubmed23n0059_4197", "pubmed23n0059_3407", "pubmed23n0059_4198", "pubmed23n0017_6765", "pubmed23n0062_2898", "pubmed23n0048_20824", "pubmed23n0039_11079", "pubmed23n0050_6001", "pubmed2