{"topic": "Hypertension", "competency": "treatment", "stem": "A 60-year-old patient with newly diagnosed hypertension and no other comorbidities is considering treatment options. Which of the following antihypertensive drugs has been shown to have similar efficacy to other first-line agents, with less short-term toxicity and no induction of biochemical changes associated with thiazides?", "options": {"A": "Indapamide", "B": "Hydrochlorothiazide", "C": "Atenolol", "D": "Clonidine"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Indapamide is a new generation diuretic with combined diuretic and hypotensive effects, and it has been shown to have similar efficacy to other first-line agents, with less short-term toxicity and no induction of biochemical changes associated with thiazides.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0061_1343", "title": "Indapamide: a diuretic of choice for the treatment of hypertension?", "span_text": "Indapamide is the first of this new generation to be released. Its pharmacologic characteristics show that it has the prerequisites to be considered a first-line drug for use in hypertension."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"search_terms": ["hypertension treatment", "indapamide"], "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0022_11986", "pubmed23n0059_20077", "pubmed23n0042_12959", "pubmed23n0045_14165", "pubmed23n0055_17212", "pubmed23n0045_4850", "pubmed23n0017_2808", "pubmed23n0043_4967", "pubmed23n0061_1343", "pubmed23n0049_16234", "pubmed23n0039_410", "InternalMed_Harrison_22127", "pubmed23n0033_9851", "pubmed23n0057_21089", "pubmed23n0045_6481", "pubmed23n0044_2037", "pubmed23n0050_6835", "pubmed23n0027_8024", "pubmed23n0001_4834", "pubmed23n0001_15133", "pubmed23n0057_14531", "pubmed23n0049_12543", "pubmed23n0012_10787", "pubmed23n0014_10259", "pubmed23n0001_5365", "pubmed23n0052_13708", "pubmed23n0045_13186"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0045_14165", "pubmed23n0055_17212", "pubmed23n0045_4850", "pubmed23n0017_2808", "pubmed23n0043_4967", "p