{"topic": "Tuberculosis", "competency": "Pathology", "stem": "What is the significance of the ClpC1:ClpP1P2 protease in Mycobacterium tuberculosis?", "options": {"A": "It is involved in the synthesis of the bacterial cell wall", "B": "It mediates both regulatory and stress-related protein degradation", "C": "It plays a role in the replication of the bacterial genome", "D": "It is responsible for the production of toxins"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The ClpC1:ClpP1P2 protease is an essential component of the protein quality control system in Mycobacterium tuberculosis, and it mediates both regulatory and stress-related protein degradation.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41611701", "title": "ClpC1-targeting peptide natural products differentially dysregulate the proteome of Mycobacterium tuberculosis", "span_text": "The ClpC1:ClpP1P2 protease is an essential component of the system that mediates both regulatory and stress-related protein degradation."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41630661", "pubmed_web_41630000", "pubmed_web_41627576", "pubmed_web_41626300", "pubmed_web_41624953", "pubmed_web_41624833", "pubmed_web_41624824", "pubmed_web_41624781", "pubmed_web_41624601", "pubmed_web_41616237", "pubmed_web_41613602", "pubmed_web_41611701", "pubmed_web_41611315", "pubmed_web_41608688", "pubmed_web_41606824", "pubmed_web_41605572", "pubmed_web_41603352", "pubmed_web_41601918", "pubmed_web_41599098", "pubmed_web_41599085", "pubmed_web_41599035", "pubmed_web_41598199", "pubmed_web_41597648", "pubmed_web_41594129", "pubmed_web_41592052", "pubmed_web_41587873", "pubmed_web_41586350", "pubmed_web_41585266", "pubmed_web_41584398", "pubmed_web_41584152"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41626300", "pubmed_web_41624953", "pubmed_web_41624833", "pubmed_web_41624824", "pubmed_web_41624781", "pubmed_web_41624601", "pubmed_web_41616237", "pubmed_web_41613602", "pubmed_web_41611701", "pubmed_we