{"topic": "Migraine", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "A 35-year-old woman with chronic migraine and endometriosis is considering hormonal therapy. Which of the following options is contraindicated in patients with migraine with aura?", "options": {"A": "Combined hormonal contraceptives", "B": "Progestins", "C": "Gonadotropin-releasing hormone agonists", "D": "Selective estrogen receptor modulators"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Combined hormonal contraceptives are contraindicated in patients with migraine with aura due to the increased risk of ischemic stroke.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41630559", "title": "Safety and efficacy of hormonal therapies used to treat endometriosis in women suffering migraine", "span_text": "CHCs are contraindicated in patients with migraine with aura because of the increased risk of ischemic stroke, while their prescription in migraine without aura should be individualized, considering also the fact that evidence in women with concomitant endometriosis is still limited."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41634591", "pubmed_web_41633219", "pubmed_web_41630559", "pubmed_web_41630419", "pubmed_web_41630307", "pubmed_web_41630047", "pubmed_web_41629775", "pubmed_web_41628620", "pubmed_web_41628212", "pubmed_web_41628210", "pubmed_web_41628204", "pubmed_web_41627537", "pubmed_web_41626588", "pubmed_web_41623789", "pubmed_web_41620660", "pubmed_web_41619552", "pubmed_web_41619056", "pubmed_web_41616910", "pubmed_web_41615317", "pubmed_web_41615311", "pubmed_web_41615244", "pubmed_web_41615180", "pubmed_web_41614252", "pubmed_web_41614018", "pubmed_web_41613259", "pubmed_web_41613184", "pubmed_web_41613173", "pubmed_web_41612541", "pubmed_web_41609368", "pubmed_web_41609130"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41630559", "pubmed_web_41630419", "pubmed_web_41630307", "pubmed_web_41630047", "pubmed_web_41629775", "pubmed_web_41628620", "pubmed_web_41628212",