{"topic": "Hypertension", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "What is the most common clinical symptom accompanying transient global amnesia in the acute phase?", "options": {"A": "Arterial hypotension", "B": "Arterial hypertension", "C": "Hyperthermia", "D": "Hypoglycemia"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Arterial hypertension is the most common clinical symptom accompanying transient global amnesia in the acute phase.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41633620", "title": "Seasonal Incidence of Transient Global Amnesia (TGA) and Seasonal Variations of Blood Pressure - Is there an Association?", "span_text": "Arterial hypertension is the most common clinical symptom accompanying TGA in the acute phase."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2023-12-01", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41637013", "pubmed_web_41636996", "pubmed_web_41636870", "pubmed_web_41636707", "pubmed_web_41636461", "pubmed_web_41636435", "pubmed_web_41636195", "pubmed_web_41635670", "pubmed_web_41635579", "pubmed_web_41635567", "pubmed_web_41635563", "pubmed_web_41635378", "pubmed_web_41635343", "pubmed_web_41635286", "pubmed_web_41634178", "pubmed_web_41633645", "pubmed_web_41633620", "pubmed_web_41633425", "pubmed_web_41633376", "pubmed_web_41632932", "pubmed_web_41632717", "pubmed_web_41632705", "pubmed_web_41632493", "pubmed_web_41632337", "pubmed_web_41632311", "pubmed_web_41632160", "pubmed_web_41632142", "pubmed_web_41631990", "pubmed_web_41631433", "pubmed_web_41631227"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41634178", "pubmed_web_41633645", "pubmed_web_41633620", "pubmed_web_41633425", "pubmed_web_41633376", "pubmed_web_41632932", "pubmed_web_41632717", "pubmed_web_41632705", "pubmed_web_41632493", "pubmed_web_41632337", "pubmed_web_41632311", "pubmed_web_41632160", "pubmed_web_41632142", "pubmed_web_41631990", "pubmed_web_41631433", "pubmed_web_41631227", "pubmed_web_41637013", "pubmed_web_41636996", "pubmed_web_41636870", "pubmed_web_41636707", "pubmed