{"topic": "Diabetes Mellitus", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the primary goal in the management of non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus (NIDDM)?", "options": {"A": "To achieve acceptable glucose control through complex insulin programs", "B": "To control hyperglycemia, hypertension, and hyperlipidemia", "C": "To promote weight loss and treat obesity-related complications", "D": "To prevent long-term complications through dietary modification and exercise"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The primary goal in the management of NIDDM is to control hyperglycemia, hypertension, and hyperlipidemia, which are all important factors in preventing long-term complications.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0062_12872", "title": "Current status of non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus (type II): management with gliclazide", "span_text": "Measures to control hyperglycemia, hypertension, and hyperlipidemia are important in the management of NIDDM and prevention of its long-term complications."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "method": "keyword search", "doc_ids": ["Surgery_Schwartz_7971", "InternalMed_Harrison_27833", "pubmed23n0027_8181", "pubmed23n0042_12959", "Surgery_Schwartz_7703", "pubmed23n0062_12872", "Obstentrics_Williams_7983", "pubmed23n0055_187", "pubmed23n0050_7407", "pubmed23n0033_9851", "Gynecology_Novak_3887", "Surgery_Schwartz_6106", "pubmed23n0041_2367", "pubmed23n0057_21089", "Surgery_Schwartz_7984", "pubmed23n0061_6120", "InternalMed_Harrison_5123", "Surgery_Schwartz_7983", "pubmed23n0043_17479", "pubmed23n0027_8024", "pubmed23n0014_304", "pubmed23n0002_7992", "pubmed23n0024_6678", "pubmed23n0063_17534", "pubmed23n0004_11550", "pubmed23n0050_1935", "pubmed23n0045_6481", "pubmed23n0024_6451", "pubmed23n0051_10329", "pubmed23n0033_7192", "pubmed23n0041_3275", "pubmed23n0036_176", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3156"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["Surgery_Schwartz_7703", "pubmed23n0062_12872", "Obstentrics_Willi