{"topic": "Diabetes Mellitus", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "What is the potential benefit of using glycated albumin as an alternative to detect and monitor glycaemic status in patients with diabetes mellitus?", "options": {"A": "It is less accurate than HbA1c", "B": "It is affected by conditions that distort HbA1c", "C": "It can be used to detect dysglycaemia and diabetes", "D": "It is only used for screening"}, "answer_key": "C", "explanation": "Glycated albumin can be used as an alternative to detect and monitor glycaemic status in patients with diabetes mellitus because it is not affected by conditions that distort HbA1c, and it has been shown to correlate significantly with other markers of glycaemic control.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41635539", "title": "Associations between glycated albumin and current measures of glycaemic control in Saudi adults", "span_text": "GA correlated significantly with other markers and can be suggested as an alternative to detect and monitor glycaemic status among Saudis."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2023-02-20T14:30:00Z", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41636892", "pubmed_web_41636679", "pubmed_web_41636656", "pubmed_web_41636295", "pubmed_web_41636014", "pubmed_web_41635853", "pubmed_web_41635837", "pubmed_web_41635832", "pubmed_web_41635670", "pubmed_web_41635656", "pubmed_web_41635539", "pubmed_web_41635536", "pubmed_web_41635535", "pubmed_web_41635458", "pubmed_web_41635446", "pubmed_web_41635371", "pubmed_web_41635365", "pubmed_web_41635345", "pubmed_web_41635336", "pubmed_web_41635325", "pubmed_web_41635279", "pubmed_web_41635195", "pubmed_web_41635156", "pubmed_web_41635131", "pubmed_web_41635113", "pubmed_web_41633942", "pubmed_web_41633881", "pubmed_web_41633708", "pubmed_web_41633689", "pubmed_web_41633688"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41635539", "pubmed_web_41635536", "pubmed_web_41635535", "pubmed_web_41635458", "pubmed_web_41635446", "pubmed_web_41635371",