{"topic": "Diabetes Mellitus", "competency": "Treatment", "stem": "A patient with type 1 diabetes mellitus is at risk for severe hypoglycemia. Which of the following features can be used to identify individuals at high risk of severe hypoglycemia using continuous glucose monitoring data?", "options": {"A": "Time above range and time in range", "B": "Time below range, coefficient of variation, and glycemic risk index", "C": "Mean glucose and glycated hemoglobin", "D": "Blood pressure and body mass index"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Severe hypoglycemia in adults with type 1 diabetes mellitus can be identified using continuous glucose monitoring data, with features such as time below range, coefficient of variation, and glycemic risk index being important predictors.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41635446", "title": "Identification of severe hypoglycemia in adults with type 1 diabetes using CGM-based machine learning: evidence from the FGM-Japan study", "span_text": "The model using four CGM variables (TBR < 70, %CV, GMI, and GRI) achieved the highest AUC of 0.794."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2024-02-20T14:30:00Z", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41636892", "pubmed_web_41636679", "pubmed_web_41636656", "pubmed_web_41636295", "pubmed_web_41636014", "pubmed_web_41635853", "pubmed_web_41635837", "pubmed_web_41635832", "pubmed_web_41635670", "pubmed_web_41635656", "pubmed_web_41635539", "pubmed_web_41635536", "pubmed_web_41635535", "pubmed_web_41635458", "pubmed_web_41635446", "pubmed_web_41635371", "pubmed_web_41635365", "pubmed_web_41635345", "pubmed_web_41635336", "pubmed_web_41635325", "pubmed_web_41635279", "pubmed_web_41635195", "pubmed_web_41635156", "pubmed_web_41635131", "pubmed_web_41635113", "pubmed_web_41633942", "pubmed_web_41633881", "pubmed_web_41633708", "pubmed_web_41633689", "pubmed_web_41633688"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41635535", "pubmed_web_41635458", "pubmed_web_41635446", "pubmed_web_