{"topic": "Myocardial Infarction", "competency": "Etiology", "stem": "What is a significant risk factor for the development of perioperative myocardial infarction in patients undergoing distal vascular reconstructive procedures?", "options": {"A": "Hypercholesterolaemia", "B": "Diabetes", "C": "Hypertension", "D": "Previous minor stroke"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Diabetes is identified as a significant risk factor for the development of perioperative myocardial infarction in patients undergoing distal vascular reconstructive procedures.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0054_20945", "title": "Risk factors for myocardial infarction after distal arterial reconstructive procedures", "span_text": "Diabetes, heart murmur, and previous major amputations were identified as significant risk factors for the development of a perioperative MI."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"source": "pubmed", "query": "myocardial infarction risk factors", "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0057_7193", "pubmed23n0047_7854", "Pathology_Robbins_2485", "Neurology_Adams_6199", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1218", "Pathology_Robbins_2245", "pubmed23n0048_16847", "pubmed23n0021_6321", "pubmed23n0015_10739", "pubmed23n0063_482", "pubmed23n0062_12629", "pubmed23n0057_21911", "pubmed23n0018_4311", "pubmed23n0044_24277", "pubmed23n0051_14247", "pubmed23n0044_20080", "pubmed23n0032_6057", "pubmed23n0055_5559", "pubmed23n0027_11960", "pubmed23n0054_20945", "pubmed23n0025_1959", "pubmed23n0059_11777", "pubmed23n0045_8655"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0057_21911", "pubmed23n0018_4311", "pubmed23n0044_24277", "pubmed23n0051_14247", "pubmed23n0044_20080", "pubmed23n0032_6057", "pubmed23n0055_5559", "pubmed23n0027_11960", "pubmed23n0054_20945", "pubmed23n0025_1959", "pubmed23n0059_11777", "pubmed23n0045_8655", "pubmed23n0057_7193", "pubmed23n0047_7854", "Pathology_Robbins_2485", "Neurology_Adams_6199", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1218", "Pathology_Robbins_2245", "pubmed23n0048_16847", "pu