{"topic": "Myocardial Infarction", "competency": "Etiology", "stem": "What condition can cause severe anemia-induced type 2 myocardial infarction in individuals with significant prior atherosclerotic coronary disease?", "options": {"A": "Hypertension", "B": "Acute bleeding", "C": "Pulmonary embolism", "D": "Cardiogenic shock"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Severe anemia-induced type 2 myocardial infarction can occur in individuals with significant prior atherosclerotic coronary disease due to acute bleeding, which leads to a decrease in oxygen delivery to the heart muscle.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41621009", "title": "Severe anemia-induced type 2 myocardial infarction", "span_text": "Acute bleeding can cause severe anemia-induced type 2 myocardial infarction in those with significant prior atherosclerotic coronary disease, but not plaque rupture."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2024-02-20T14:30:00Z", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41635670", "pubmed_web_41633605", "pubmed_web_41632477", "pubmed_web_41631724", "pubmed_web_41631049", "pubmed_web_41630293", "pubmed_web_41629182", "pubmed_web_41629127", "pubmed_web_41628974", "pubmed_web_41628730", "pubmed_web_41625718", "pubmed_web_41625238", "pubmed_web_41621906", "pubmed_web_41621021", "pubmed_web_41621009", "pubmed_web_41620890", "pubmed_web_41620233", "pubmed_web_41618755", "pubmed_web_41617364", "pubmed_web_41617356", "pubmed_web_41617253", "pubmed_web_41615556", "pubmed_web_41614508", "pubmed_web_41614487", "pubmed_web_41614370", "pubmed_web_41611310", "pubmed_web_41610117", "pubmed_web_41609957", "pubmed_web_41609377", "pubmed_web_41609321"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41621021", "pubmed_web_41621009", "pubmed_web_41620890", "pubmed_web_41620233", "pubmed_web_41618755", "pubmed_web_41617364", "pubmed_web_41617356", "pubmed_web_41617253", "pubmed_web_41615556", "pubmed_web_41614508", "pubmed_web_41614487", "pubmed_web_41614370", "pubmed_web_41611310", 