{"topic": "Pneumonia", "competency": "Diagnosis", "stem": "A patient with ventilator-associated pneumonia caused by multidrug-resistant Gram-negative bacteria is being treated with colistin. What is the most significant advantage of using aerosolized colistin compared to intravenous colistin?", "options": {"A": "Increased risk of nephrotoxicity", "B": "Shorter time to defervescence", "C": "Higher risk of microbiological treatment failure", "D": "Increased risk of secondary infections"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Aerosolized colistin has been shown to have a shorter time to defervescence compared to intravenous colistin, which can be beneficial in the treatment of ventilator-associated pneumonia.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed_web", "doc_id": "pubmed_web_41630819", "title": "Clinical Outcomes of Aerosolized Versus Intravenous Colistin in Ventilator-Associated Pneumonia Caused by Multidrug-Resistant Gram-Negative Bacteria", "span_text": "The time to defervescence was significantly shorter in the aerosolized group (3.0 \u00b1 1.2 days) than in the intravenous group (5.0 \u00b1 1.7 days; P = 0.002)."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"method": "keyword search", "query": "aerosolized colistin vs intravenous colistin", "doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41637075", "pubmed_web_41636344", "pubmed_web_41635840", "pubmed_web_41635827", "pubmed_web_41635718", "pubmed_web_41635177", "pubmed_web_41633747", "pubmed_web_41633725", "pubmed_web_41633397", "pubmed_web_41633328", "pubmed_web_41632630", "pubmed_web_41632202", "pubmed_web_41632143", "pubmed_web_41631845", "pubmed_web_41631341", "pubmed_web_41631168", "pubmed_web_41630819", "pubmed_web_41630718", "pubmed_web_41630680", "pubmed_web_41630570", "pubmed_web_41630414", "pubmed_web_41630339", "pubmed_web_41630268", "pubmed_web_41630101", "pubmed_web_41629804", "pubmed_web_41629492", "pubmed_web_41629372", "pubmed_web_41629286", "pubmed_web_41629153", "pubmed_web_41629119"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed_web_41630819", 