{"topic": "Stroke", "competency": "Pathophysiology", "stem": "What is the primary goal in managing ischemic cerebrovascular disease?", "options": {"A": "To reduce the incidence of stroke in the general population by controlling modifiable risk factors", "B": "To ameliorate the existing deficit and prevent future stroke", "C": "To identify the source of the problem--the heart, blood, or vessel wall", "D": "To reduce the incidence of TIA's, not the incidence of stroke"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "The main objective in these forms of ischemic cerebrovascular disease is the amelioration of the existing deficit and the prevention of future stroke.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Neurology_Adams_6348", "title": "Neurology_Adams", "span_text": "The main objective in these forms of ischemic cerebrovascular disease is the amelioration of the existing deficit and the prevention of future stroke."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Surgery_Schwartz_5509", "pubmed23n0051_7826", "pubmed23n0053_18684", "InternalMed_Harrison_1262", "Neurology_Adams_1525", "InternalMed_Harrison_29876", "InternalMed_Harrison_29957", "InternalMed_Harrison_29910", "pubmed23n0052_16924", "pubmed23n0014_12989", "pubmed23n0062_9041", "Neurology_Adams_227", "pubmed23n0054_7087", "pubmed23n0057_21051", "pubmed23n0050_6570", "Surgery_Schwartz_12245", "InternalMed_Harrison_29978", "pubmed23n0043_5686", "Surgery_Schwartz_1046", "pubmed23n0044_6885", "pubmed23n0002_13137", "pubmed23n0053_3702", "pubmed23n0052_2652", "Neurology_Adams_6348", "pubmed23n0036_5332", "InternalMed_Harrison_30053", "pubmed23n0047_2051", "InternalMed_Harrison_29960", "pubmed23n0062_5451", "pubmed23n0015_7885", "Surgery_Schwartz_6103", "pubmed23n0059_7115", "pubmed23n0048_2341", "InternalMed_Harrison_18502", "pubmed23n0012_5574", "pubmed23n0050_16049", "pubmed23n0050_18600", "pubmed23n0048_4862", "pubmed23n0048_10969", "Neurology_Adams_2408", "Surgery_Schwartz_5460", "Neurology_