{"topic": "Heart Failure", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "A patient with acute heart failure and severe hypotension requires immediate treatment with a positive inotropic drug. Which of the following is most appropriate?", "options": {"A": "Dopamine", "B": "Dobutamine", "C": "Levosimendan", "D": "Milrinone"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Dopamine is a positive inotropic drug with a prompt onset and short duration of action, making it most useful in patients with acute heart failure complicated by severe hypotension.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_1321", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "Dopamine or dobutamine are positive inotropic drugs with prompt onset and short durations of action; they are most useful in patients with failure complicated by severe hypotension."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": "2023-02-20", "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_4286", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1258", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1296", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1313", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1831", "Pharmacology_Katzung_992", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1076", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1291", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4309", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1307", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1580", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1478", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1312", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6660", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1321", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1233", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1232", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1559", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4866", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1305", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1876", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1476", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1621", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1196", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1856", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1565", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1326", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1214", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3740", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6141", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1318", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4401", "Pharmacology_Katzung_991", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3035", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1451", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1523", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1067", "Pharmacol