{"topic": "Tuberculosis", "competency": "Prevention", "stem": "A patient with diabetes mellitus is diagnosed with pulmonary tuberculosis. What is the most important factor for preventing a relapse of the mycobacterial infection in this patient?", "options": {"A": "Strict plasma glucose control", "B": "Regular exercise and balanced diet", "C": "Avoiding close contact with others", "D": "Taking vitamin supplements"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Strict plasma glucose control is crucial for preventing a relapse of the mycobacterial infection in patients with diabetes mellitus, as it helps to reduce the risk of complications and improve treatment outcomes.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0053_13997", "title": "[Clinical feature of the diabetic patients with recurrent pulmonary tuberculosis]", "span_text": "We concluded that strict plasma glucose control is important for the prevention of a relapse of the mycobacterial infection in patients with diabetes mellitus."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"search_terms": ["tuberculosis", "diabetes mellitus", "prevention"], "doc_ids": ["InternalMed_Harrison_16951", "pubmed23n0014_7608", "pubmed23n0061_5618", "pubmed23n0043_9332", "pubmed23n0053_13997", "pubmed23n0052_19531", "Gynecology_Novak_5970", "pubmed23n0010_1649", "pubmed23n0059_10012", "pubmed23n0060_12236", "pubmed23n0014_10462", "pubmed23n0038_184", "pubmed23n0053_14702", "pubmed23n0055_11072", "InternalMed_Harrison_15139", "pubmed23n0062_11708", "pubmed23n0006_9572", "Surgery_Schwartz_4789", "pubmed23n0044_11864", "pubmed23n0056_1842", "pubmed23n0044_734", "pubmed23n0006_9579", "Pediatrics_Nelson_2623", "Pediatrics_Nelson_2593", "pubmed23n0049_21418", "pubmed23n0058_14824", "pubmed23n0062_15471", "pubmed23n0015_1461", "pubmed23n0029_3993", "pubmed23n0056_22749", "pubmed23n0047_12391", "pubmed23n0058_14808", "pubmed23n0061_22423", "pubmed23n0049_18063", "pubmed23n0027_9892", "Gynecology_Novak_719", "InternalMed_Harrison_13599", "pu