{"topic": "Atrial Fibrillation", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "A 65-year-old patient with non-valvular atrial fibrillation is at increased risk for which type of stroke?", "options": {"A": "Hemorrhagic stroke", "B": "Ischemic stroke", "C": "Transient ischemic attack", "D": "Subarachnoid hemorrhage"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Non-valvular atrial fibrillation is associated with an increased risk of ischemic stroke due to the formation of blood clots in the atria.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0046_9121", "title": "Atrial fibrillation: epidemiology and the risk and prevention of stroke", "span_text": "Nonrheumatic atrial fibrillation is associated with an approximately five-fold increase in the risk of ischemic stroke and a 5% to 7% yearly risk that increases with age."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0056_6019", "pubmed23n0051_15847", "pubmed23n0060_228", "pubmed23n0063_20293", "pubmed23n0053_18967", "Surgery_Schwartz_5343", "pubmed23n0021_11550", "pubmed23n0046_9121", "pubmed23n0030_9331", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1471", "pubmed23n0049_21579", "pubmed23n0062_9075", "pubmed23n0052_784", "pubmed23n0052_2659", "InternalMed_Harrison_17909", "pubmed23n0052_15912", "pubmed23n0052_17072", "pubmed23n0060_19601", "pubmed23n0045_10469", "InternalMed_Harrison_29978", "pubmed23n0015_9275", "pubmed23n0047_3890", "pubmed23n0056_2552", "InternalMed_Harrison_29920", "pubmed23n0028_2229", "pubmed23n0028_1142", "pubmed23n0016_7414", "pubmed23n0062_9400", "InternalMed_Harrison_18038", "pubmed23n0063_8549", "pubmed23n0054_1577", "pubmed23n0064_377", "pubmed23n0062_9052", "pubmed23n0016_5495", "pubmed23n0030_7206", "pubmed23n0043_12237", "pubmed23n0046_10302", "pubmed23n0058_2113", "Neurology_Adams_6391", "pubmed23n0037_8656", "pubmed23n0017_1015", "InternalMed_Harrison_18040", "pubmed23n0063_20466", "pubmed23n0057_854", "pubmed23n0005_11377", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1480", "pubmed23n0042_11141", "pubme