{"topic": "Atrial Fibrillation", "competency": "Complications", "stem": "What is a potential consequence of atrial fibrillation associated with the Wolff-Parkinson-White syndrome?", "options": {"A": "Ventricular fibrillation or functional cardiac arrest", "B": "Sinus bradycardia", "C": "Atrial flutter", "D": "Junctional rhythm"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Atrial fibrillation associated with the Wolff-Parkinson-White syndrome can lead to ventricular fibrillation or functional cardiac arrest due to the abnormal electrical pathways in the heart.", "evidence": [{"source": "pubmed", "doc_id": "pubmed23n0031_13136", "title": "Sinus bradycardia and atrial fibrillation associated with the Wolff-Parkinson-White syndrome", "span_text": "Ventricular fibrillation of functional cardiac arrest was documented in four instances."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0052_535", "pubmed23n0050_9921", "pubmed23n0048_7295", "pubmed23n0046_12428", "pubmed23n0056_16373", "pubmed23n0025_3349", "pubmed23n0016_13186", "pubmed23n0030_3435", "pubmed23n0047_1314", "pubmed23n0043_3105", "pubmed23n0055_19414", "pubmed23n0038_8745", "pubmed23n0030_8378", "pubmed23n0054_18151", "pubmed23n0064_249", "pubmed23n0031_13136", "pubmed23n0038_9869", "pubmed23n0027_13571", "pubmed23n0050_13377", "pubmed23n0023_7794", "pubmed23n0051_10937", "pubmed23n0015_6246", "pubmed23n0049_12494", "pubmed23n0009_266", "pubmed23n0052_8333", "pubmed23n0051_21121", "pubmed23n0016_3095", "pubmed23n0050_970", "pubmed23n0041_7081", "pubmed23n0042_12097"], "evidence_doc_ids": ["pubmed23n0030_8378", "pubmed23n0054_18151", "pubmed23n0064_249", "pubmed23n0031_13136", "pubmed23n0038_9869", "pubmed23n0027_13571", "pubmed23n0050_13377", "pubmed23n0023_7794", "pubmed23n0051_10937", "pubmed23n0015_6246", "pubmed23n0049_12494", "pubmed23n0009_266", "pubmed23n0052_8333", "pubmed23n0051_21121", "pubmed23n0016_3095", "pubmed23n0050_970", "pubmed23n0041_7081", "pubmed23n0042_12097", "pubmed