{"topic": "Depression", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "A 35-year-old patient with major depressive disorder is prescribed an antidepressant that acts as an antagonist of the 5-HT3, 5-HT7, and 5-HT1D receptors. What is the name of this antidepressant?", "options": {"A": "Vortioxetine", "B": "Sertraline", "C": "Fluoxetine", "D": "Paroxetine"}, "answer_key": "A", "explanation": "Vortioxetine is a newer agent that acts as an antagonist of the 5-HT3, 5-HT7, and 5-HT1D receptors, a partial agonist of the 5-HT1B receptor, and an agonist of the 5HT1A receptor.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_3270", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "Vortioxetine is a newer agent that acts as an antagonist of the 5-HT3, 5-HT7, and 5-HT1D receptors, a partial agonist of the 5-HT1B receptor, and an agonist of the 5HT1A receptor."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_3345", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3243", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3256", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7132", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2366", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3240", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3247", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3238", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3259", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3236", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3352", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3253", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3149", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3244", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3270", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4255", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3350", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3257", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2668", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3189", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4545", "pubmed23n0013_240", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3241", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3410", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2953", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3351", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3346", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6578", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2308", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3409", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3299", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2813", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3355", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3431", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3347", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3415", "Pharmacology_Katzung_337