{"topic": "Depression", "competency": "Pharmacology", "stem": "A patient with major depressive disorder is prescribed bupropion. What is the primary indication for this medication?", "options": {"A": "Attention deficit hyperkinetic disorder", "B": "Major depression, including seasonal depression", "C": "Anxiety disorder", "D": "Bipolar depression"}, "answer_key": "B", "explanation": "Bupropion is primarily used to treat major depression, including seasonal depression, although it may be used off-label for other conditions such as attention deficit hyperkinetic disorder.", "evidence": [{"source": "textbook", "doc_id": "Pharmacology_Katzung_3313", "title": "Pharmacology_Katzung", "span_text": "The primary indication for bupropion is in the treatment of major depression, including seasonal (winter) depression."}], "status": "OK", "meta": {"retrieval": {"time": 100, "doc_ids": ["Pharmacology_Katzung_3299", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3355", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3415", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2813", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3431", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3375", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3389", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1876", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1196", "pubmed23n0055_2747", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2720", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3313", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3347", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1046", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2430", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3383", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3260", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4864", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3624", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3580", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3298", "Pharmacology_Katzung_7131", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3245", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3592", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3314", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3463", "Pharmacology_Katzung_1055", "Pharmacology_Katzung_2259", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4370", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3190", "Pharmacology_Katzung_4546", "Pharmacology_Katzung_5453", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3206", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3295", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3273", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3221", "Pharmacology_Katzung_3318", "Pharmacology_Katzung_6528", "Pharmacology_Katz